<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">JHN- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Zaŋ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Zaŋ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zaŋ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zaŋ</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zaŋ</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Zaŋ nakwyalaa ɛ étɛp ezɛɛga ekeletyɛ nadidi pɛ kyee bɔs Siili nɛghu pɛ kyee dik Azi Minɛl, dɔɔ nɛ kyee bɔs di djóoaa mos Tuulki ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mak ɛ́ koobela mɛtsek-mɛtsek. Etɛp nɛ mɛkpa mɛ di kwyala tɔ tak ɛ, tok tyee wat nɛ bɛdhiiti bɛmɛkana mɛ embɛɛ ɛ mɛbhaadal. Nyɛ ɛpedjɛ bɛtɛ nɛ duu tɔ ɛtiibal etɛp di syela tɔ mɛkpa nɛ mɛsa mɛ Yezu nadi sa ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɛtsek ɛ mɛkɛn mɛ mɛkana mɛ tak ɛ, ɛlaŋel ɛ wat kɛyaka nɛ ɛlaŋel ɛ kam nɛ ebá (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1-12">1–12</ref></char>) ye kaada ɛ́ eboo endem etɛn nɛ ebá yii Yezu nasa ɛ. Bɛ djóo yɛ endem ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, ye ɛpelyaal náá, Yezu ɛ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb. Ekwyala e ɛtsek ɛ tak kaada ɛ́ bhoma ɛ Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot, tyee: dhiiti kukuma ghaa-Zɛɛb eYuda, tɔ ɛlaŋel ɛ elɛl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 3">3</ref></char>); nɛ yii moma dɛl ɛ Samaali, tɔ ɛlaŋel ɛ ená (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 4">4</ref></char>); dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbɛ́, tɔ ɛlaŋel ɛ etɛn zɛnɔɔ ɛlaŋel ɛ etɛn nɛ ená (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 5-9">5–9</ref></char>). Tɔ mɛlyo mɛ, Yezu lyaal nyel ɛ́ dáa mapa di edjɛ tsik ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 6:35">6.35</ref></char>). Yezu lyaal nyel ɛ́ dáa mbaalel ɛsaa ebhata di etɔ́ nɛ bot bɛ pɛ kyee di di ekunaa nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 10:11">10.11</ref></char>). Yezu baalyaal nyel ɛ́ dáa gwyɛ ngel di ekas kɔ bot ɛ bɔs djas ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">8.12</ref></char>). Yezu ɛpetel nɛ bot djas náá, nyɛ ɛ́ tak.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɛtsek ɛ ebá e mɛkana, ɛlaŋel kam nɛ elɛl kɛyaka nɛ ɛlaŋel mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ wat (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13-21">13–21</ref></char>). Ye kwyalaa ɛ étɛp ɛwala ɛ Yezu aadus kɔ bɔs, byet pɛ ɛko pɛ daa Sɛɛg ɛ. Yezu eelii nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. Nyɛ nadi edjɛ bɛ mɛlyo étɛp ɛwala ɛ nyɛ aadi ààbɛ edi wat bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɛ; ɛlaŋel kam nɛ elɛl kɛyaka nɛ ɛlaŋel kam nɛ etɛn nɛ wat (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13-16">13–16</ref></char>). Bhii tak Yezu eezɛdjaala nɛ Sɛɛg kɔ ɛsu ɛ bɛdjekel bɛ; ɛlaŋel kam nɛ etɛn nɛ ebá (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 17">17</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">É mɛsik mɛ mɛkana, Ekwyala lyaal ɛ́ etɛp ee nasael é ghɛŋ ɛsyee ɛ Yezu ɛ. Nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ etɛp ee di nɔŋel nɛ yii bɔɔ Matye ɛ, Malak nɛ Luk nakwyal ɛ. Ɛlaŋel kam nɛ etɛn nɛ elɛl nɛ ɛlaŋel kam nɛ etɛn nɛ ená (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 18-19">18–19</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Yezu naatel bɛdjekel bɛ nyel nyɛy nɛ tsik, dwoo ɛbyoŋ ɛ eYuda di edjóoaa Pak ɛ; ɛlaŋel mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ wat (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20-21">20–21</ref></char>). Mot nakwyal Mbɛɛ Bhaadal yak ɔ, ke ɛ́ náá, nyɛ nakwyal mɛkana mɛ ɛ́, étɛp bot ɛ nadi ààbee Yezu ɔ needum koŋ nɛ nɛ pe; ɛlaŋel mɛkam-mɛmbá, kana ze mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ etɛn nɛ ená kɛkum ze mɛkam-mɛlɛl nɛ wat (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:29-31">20.29-31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbɛɛ bhaadal ɛ Zaŋ dyeebalii ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mbi zɛɛga eYuda, bot ɛ mɛbhuka ɛ Yezu. Deenek, daŋ-daŋ ɛ, ekukuma e eYuda nabɛ ààdi ekwyɛl nyɛ. Bela náá, Yezu nyɛ ɛmet nadi ɛ́ mot dhaad mbyak eYuda, dɔɔ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ yii mɛkɛn pe. É sok Zaŋ di elii nɛ eYuda ɛ, nyɛ ààzolii-liiak nɛ bɔɔ bɛmet, tin, nyɛ lii ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbhuka ɛ Yezu Klisto djas kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbɛɛ bhaadal ɛ Zaŋ ààkaada ɛbyel ɛ Yezu nɛ ɛkɛn ɛ mɛsa mɛ tɔ bot. Tin, é mɛkɛn mɛ mɛkana, nyɛ lɛɛ bot ɛ náá, Yezu Klisto ɛ́ «Mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb» nalookan ɛdi é di wat bɛ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ; ɛlaŋel ɛ wat, ze mɛken kɛsik nɛ yii kam nɛ etɛn nɛ elɛl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1.1-18</ref></char>). Yezu, «Mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb» nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛdi é di wat bɛ nɛ bot. Deenek bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdi bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb. Tɔ mɛlu mɛ nyɛ nadi bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ boo ɛgwakel bɛ nɛ Sɛɛg. Nyɛ ɛ́ «mot Sɛɛg nadhis kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs» ɔ. Bot djas aadi esaa Zɛɛb nɛ lyem kwyɛl ɔ, bɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛgu nyɛ kɔ lo ɛ Yezu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Mɛkpa mɛ tsik nɛ yii gwyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Tɔɔɔ é mɛkɛn mɛ esonok djas, ye nabɛ ɛ́, Mɛkpa moo tak. Mɛkpa nabɛ ɛ́ bɛ nɛ Zɛɛb, Mɛkpa nabɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, é mɛkɛn tɔɔɔ, Mɛkpa nadi ɛ́, é di wat bɛ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Esonok djas di kɔ bɔs ɛ, nakusel ɛ́ nɛ Mɛkpa. Ye tok nɛ sa wat kɔ bɔs'ak Mɛkpa nadi ààkus. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Tsik nadus ɛ́ pɛ tɔ lɛ. Deenek, tsik tak naasa náá, bot djas nyen popoopwon tɔ gwyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ngel ɛpekas, djɛ boo gwyɛ é di mɛghomela nadi ɔ. Tin, mɛghomela kadi ɛ́ ààkwak ɛdimal yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot Zɛɛb nadhis ɔ. Din ɛ mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ Zaŋ. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Nyɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ tyee tyaasɛs, étɛp ɛzɛlyo bot dum nɛ gwyɛ, etɛɛ náá, bot djas needum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb é ze yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Zaŋ nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ gwyɛ tak. Deenek, nyɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ tyee tyaasɛs étɛp ɛzɛlyo bot dum nɛ gwyɛ tak. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Mɛkpa mɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ sim gwyɛ na tsɛɛtsɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ tɛtɛ gwyɛ di edjɛ bot djas eselele ɛ. Ye nazyɛ kɔ bɔs ɛ, ye neezɛdjɛ bot gwyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Deenek, Mɛkpa naazyɛ pɛ kɔ bɔs, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ nakus bɔs. Tin, bot ɛ bɔs'ak ààpakamyaal nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Mɛkpa naazyɛ pɛ daa bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ. Ye kabela náá, bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ naabyen ɛmyaal ɛ nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />É di'enek, bot djas aamyaal nyɛ ɔ, bot aadum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ, Mɛkpa waadjɛ bɛ ghwyil ɛdi ɛ́ bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb tak aanàkwaabyel-byelak ghiya, ààbɛ yii gwyes epuud, ààkobaabɛ-bɛak yii ɛkwosak ɛ mot. Yɛ ɛ́ ɛbyel nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Mɛkpa nadi ɛ́, ye moo mot. Mot tak naazɛbe di tɔ lena. Mena naabeeka Mɛkas mɛ, yɛ ɛ́ Mɛkas mɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ sim Mɔn di ebela nɛ Sɛɛg ɛ, lwoodela nɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Zaŋ nakan ɛdi ɛ́ tyee tyaasɛs étɛp ɛlyo bot dum nɛ nɛ. Nyɛ nadi etuud náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ mɛ nadi ekeke náá: “Mot di ezyɛ bhis'am ɔ, nyɛ eedhaa mɛ. Etɛɛ náá, ɛsok nɛ mam nɛ byel, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ tak.”»<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mena naabelaka bɛtɛ nɛ ekum bɛ. Nyɛ naakɛl kɔ lena enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ yak kɔ yii. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, Zɛɛb naadjɛ mena etsi nɛ Moiiz. Deenek, Zɛɛb kabaadhis mena enɛm nɛ embɛɛ nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ, nɛ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt nabee Zɛɛb sok. Tin, sɛɛŋɛlɛ sim Mɔn'ɛ ɛmet, nyɛy mot di Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ di ɛ́ é di wat bɛ nɛ Sɛɛg. Yɛ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ di elyaal bot Sɛɛg.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛŋ dum nɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Ekukuma eYuda e ghaada Yeluzalɛm naalwom bɛdhiiti bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ eLevit, bot ɛ di esa mɛsa tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ. Bot ɛ tak nakɛdji Zaŋ Nduuel-bot ɛ́ náá: «Wɔy ɛ́ yɔ zɛ é?» <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Nyɛ naazɛlɛɛ bɛ nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ náá: «Mam tok Mɛsia.» <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Bha wɔy ɛ́ zɛ? Wɔ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Eli?» Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ààbɛ! Mɛ ɛ́ tok Eli.» Bɛ eebaazɛdji nyɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ di ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb di ebwoodaa ɛ?» Nyɛ eebaazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ààbɛ» <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />É di'enek, bɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Haaa wɔy ɛ́ zɛ? Etɛɛ náá, bis ɛ́ sik ɔɔ, bis neekɛlɛɛ bot ɛ dhis bis ɔ. Wɔy nakuma nyel, wɔ ke náá, wɔ ɛ́ zɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">«Mɛ ɛ́ gwood mot di etuud pɛ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Koobalka mɛze ɛ Ghɛŋ, ye di looba-looba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.23 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Eza 40.3</ref></char></char></note>!”»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 1:23">Dáa ye di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Tin, tɔ bot ɛ nalwomaa pɛ daa Zaŋ ɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ ɛdhuu ɛ eFalizyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Deenek, bɛ eebaazɛdji nyɛ náá: «Étɛp yé wɔ di eduu bot Zɛɛb, yɛ bɛ náá, wɔy tok Mɛsia, ààbɛ Eli, ààbaabɛ dhiiti ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Zaŋ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mam duu bin Zɛɛb ɛ, pɛ tɔ mɛdii. Tin, tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ len, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mot ngɔt bi di ààgu ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Mot di ezyɛ bhis'am ɔ, nyɛ eedhaa mɛ nɛ mɛbwala. Mam aanàkwaakobela-belak duu ɛmalal étɛp ɛkotii-tiiak ekel e ekoko bɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Etɛp bak djas sael tin ɛ, pɛ ghaada Bhetani, pɛ yii kyiid dii Yuldɛn. Yɛ ɛ́ pɛ kyee Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nadi eduu bot Zɛɛb ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Tɔ yak mɛlem, Zaŋ kabee ɛ́ Yezu ezyɛ pɛ daa lɛ. Tin, nyɛ eezɛke náá: «Beeka mɔn bhata Zɛɛb é! Yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ di edis mesyem mɛ bot ɛ bɔs djas. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Yɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ nɛ mɛ nalɛɛ náá: “Mot di ezyɛ bhii koŋ'am ɔ, nyɛ eedhaa mɛ. Etɛɛ náá, ɛsok nɛ mam nɛ zyɛ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ tak.” <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Mam nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi egu náá, nyɛ ɛ́ Mɛsia. Tin, mam nazyɛ, zɛduu bot Zɛɛb tɔ mɛdii ɛ́, etɛp mɛ neelyaal nyɛ nɛ bot ɛ Yisalaɛl.»<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Zaŋ ɛ́ boozɛkaada sa nyɛ nabee ɛ. Nyɛy náá: «Mɛ eebee Sisim Zɛɛb edus tɔ gwoo, sul pɛ si dáa ɛghum, bhii tak, Sisim tak eezɛtyaa kɔ lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Kɛkum dwoo lak mos, mam nabɛ ààdi egu náá, nyɛ ɛ́ Mɛsia. É di'enek, yɛ ɛ́ mot nadhis mɛ náá, mɛ zɛduu bot Zɛɛb tɔ mɛdii ɔ, nyɛ nalii nɛ nam ɛ́ náá: “Wɔ waabee Sisim edus tɔ gwoo, sul, zɛdi kɔ mot. Bhii tak Sisim tak ɛ zɛtyaa kɔ lɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ aakwaaduu bot Zɛɛb nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Mam eebee yɛ nɛ mis mam met. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di ebaŋa bin yɛ ɛ, mot'ak ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu yii mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Tɔ yak mɛlem Zaŋ nabaadi ɛ́ tin nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ bɛbá. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Dáa nyɛ nabee Yezu é dhaŋ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Beeka mot di mɔn bhata ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ!» <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Bɛdjekel bɛ bɛbá eezɛgwak deenek, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛdu Yezu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛliig mis, gwyák pɛ bhis, dáa nyɛ nabee náá, bɛdjekel binɔk nadi edu nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi saa yé?» Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Labhi! Wɔ dyeebadi paa?» Labhi kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́: Lyoel. <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dhaka, étɛp bi neezɛbee.» Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdu nyɛ, bɛ eezɛtɔ́, kɛbee sum di Yezu nadidi ɔ. Tin, bot binɔk zokadi bɛ nɛ Yezu é di wat dwoo tak. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ dwoo eezeleega moo tyee ɛwala ɛ ená.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andele, dhyeeb ɛ Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd, nabɛ ɛ́ ngɔt pak bɛdjekel ɛbá binɔk nagwak lii ɛ Zaŋ, da bhii tak bɛ ɛ́ du Yezu ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andele nakɛleeboma ɛ́ nɛ tel Simɔŋ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boolɛɛ nyɛ náá: «Bis eebela Mɛsia!» Nyɛ nadi eke deenek ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, din ɛ Mɛsia kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́: Klisto. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdul nyɛ pɛ daa Yezu. Dáa Yezu nabee nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ Simɔŋ, mɔn Zaŋ. Wɔ aakadjóoaa ɛ́ Kefas.» Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́: Pyɛɛd.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />É yak dhiiti dwoo, Yezu nadi ekwyɛl ɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Ghalile. Tin, nyɛ eezɛboma nɛ dhiiti mot di edjóoaa Filip ɔ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Dua mɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filip nadi ɛ́, mot Bhɛtsaida, ghaada ɛ Andele bɛ nɛ Pyɛɛd. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filip eezɛboma nɛ Natanaɛl, nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Bis eebela mot Moiiz nakwyal dum nɛ nɛ tɔ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ mot bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nabaalii kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɔ, Yezu mot dɛl Nazalɛt, mɔn ɛ Zozɛf.» <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanaɛl eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Tɛtɛ sonok ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛtuula pɛ Nazalɛt é?» Filip ɛ́ boobɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Dha, wɔ neezɛbee.»<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Dáa Yezu nakabee Natanaɛl ezyɛ pɛ daa lɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: «Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ beeka mot dik Yisalaɛl di ààgu mɛkɔŋ ɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanaɛl eezɛdji náá: «Wɔ gu mɛ dáa?» Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ɛsok nɛ náá, Filip djóo wɔ, ye bɛ ɛ́, mɛ eezebee wɔ. Wɔ di ɛ́, pɛ si le fiigh.» <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanaɛl eezɛbɔɔza, nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Labhi! Wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb! Wɔ ɛ́ mɛkoozi mɛ Yisalaɛl!» <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yezu eebaazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ dum koŋ nɛ nam ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, mɛ eelɛɛ wɔ náá: “Mɛ bɛ ɛ́, mɛ eebee wɔ é ghɛŋ wɔ di si le fiigh ɛ?” Wɔ waabee esonok dhaa yii wɔ di ebee'aak.»<verse eid="JHN 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yezu eebaazɛlɛɛ nyɛ náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ mɛ lɛɛ bin etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ ɛ́ náá: bi ɛ́ waabee gwoo ndiia, efofop ɛ Zɛɛb ebyet nɛ ɛsul kɔ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot.»<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Endem e mɛbwala ɛ Yezu yii mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Mɛlu mɛlɛl bhii tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛba pɛ dɛl Kana, pɛ kyee dik Ghalile. Nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu nadi ɛ́ tin. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ naadjóoaa pɛ ɛba ɛ tak. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Dáa mɛnyok nabɛ náá, ye naawyii ɛ, nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ Yezu náá: «Bɛ tokapɛ nɛ mɛnyok.» <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nyɛɛg náá: «Wɔy moma, yenabɛl mɛsɔ ɛ́ yé é tɛp'ak? Ɛwala ɛ lam dinaa ààpakum.» <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Deenek nyɛɛg eezɛke nɛ bot ɛ mɛsa náá: «Saka sa djas nyɛ aalɛɛ bin náá, bi sa ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Ghuna é di'enek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛbhe mɛ nasael nɛ mɛkok ɛ etɛn nɛ wat. Mɛbhe mɛ tak nadi tin ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ mbyak eYuda neesa mɛzel mɛ ɛdis edhuud<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">eYuda neesa mɛzel mɛ ɛdis edhuud </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yɛ ɛ́ dáa etsi ɛ Moiiz nalɛɛ bɛ ɛ <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 11:33-36">Msa 11.33-36</ref></char>.</char></note>. Ngɔt-ngɔt tɔ mɛbhe mɛ tak ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛnɔɔ bhɛɛb mɛdii elitɛlɛ dhet etɛɛ náá, ye neelwood. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Lwoodalka mɛbhe menek nɛ mɛdii.» Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛlwoodal kum pɛ ka. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Daaka yɛ batsa, da bi ɛ́ kɛdjɛ mot di elii etɛp e ɛbyoŋ ɔ, étɛp nyɛ neebowal.» Bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ yɛ pɛ daa mot tak.<verse eid="JHN 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Dáa mot tak nabowal mɛdii mɛ zeliigel moo mɛnyok ɛ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ ààgu pɛ mɛnyok mɛ tak nadus ɛ́. Tin, ye nazobɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ nalwoodal mɛbhe ɔ, bɔɔ bɛmet ɛ́ nadi egu pɛ kyee ye nadus ɛ. Mot'enɔk ɛ́ boodjóo motom nadi eba ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />Nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: «É mɛbyoŋ, bot djas dyeebadjɛ sok ɛ, tɛtɛ mɛnyok na nyenyɔ-nyɔ. Tin, da yii di ààdyeebanyɔ ɛ, kadjɛaa ɛbhis, bot ɛ di, bɛ moo tɔ elangi ɔɔ. Ghuna wɔ bɛ ɛ́, wɔ eekwom mbɛɛ mɛnyok étɛp ye needɛaa nenak ɛbhis.»<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yenek nabɛ ɛ́ ndem mɛbwala yii ɛsok Yezu nasa pɛ dɛl Kana pɛ kyee dik Ghalile ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ Yezu nalyaal duma nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ. É di'enek, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛdjekel bɛ naadum koŋ nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Bhis yenek, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ghaada Kapɛlnaum bɛ nɛ nyɛɛg, nɛ mɔn-nyɛɛg zɛnɔɔ bɛdjekel bɛ. Bɛ naadhaa ba bim mɛlu penek.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛsɔ bot ɛ di ebɔmsa esa pɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak e eYuda nabɛ ɛ́ ye moo ekunaa, Yezu eezɛtɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Nyɛ kazɛbela tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ́, bot ɛ nadi ebɔmsa engɔmbɛ, etaa, nɛ mɛghum, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ nadi eswoola epata ɔ mendiindil kɔ emesa bɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Tin, Yezu eezɛlóo ghwyɛs nɛ ekel, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛsɔ bɔɔ djas tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, dɔɔ nɛ etaa nɛ engɔmbɛ bɔɔ. Nyɛ eezɛmwas epata nɛ ɛwaaz emesa e bot ɛ nadi eswoola epata ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ bot ɛ nadi ebɔmsa mɛghum ɔ náá: «Diska esa bak wak! Nàliigka ndjaa Saagam náá, ye di zɛɛga bot ɛ di ebɔmsa esa ɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Tin, bɛdjekel bɛ eetaala náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Mɛkwyɛla mɛ mɛ di nɛ yɛ dum nɛ ndjaŋ'ɔ ɛ, yɛ ɛpegoo mɛ tɔ lyem dáa du<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.17 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:10">Mɛd 69.10</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Ekukuma eYuda eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Yaa kɔkɔ ndem mɛbwala wɔ aatel bis, étɛp bis neemyaal náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa dáa wɔ di esa'aak?» <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Bwakeka Ndjaa-ebuwa yak, bhii tak, tɔ mɛlu mɛlɛl, mɛ waabaawyɛl yɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Tin, ekukuma eYuda eezɛswonal, bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Dáa weee? Sonok étɛp ɛsum ɛ Ndjaa-ebuwa bak, ye nabɛ ɛ́, ye naabɔya membu mɛkam-mɛná nɛ etɛn nɛ wat. Wɔy lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsum yɛ tɔ mɛlu mɛlɛl e!»<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ghuna Ndjaa-ebuwa Yezu nadi elii ɛ, nabɛ ɛ́ nyel'ɛ met. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Bhis ɛgom ɛ Yezu, bɛdjekel bɛ naazɛtaala sa nyɛ nake ɛ. É di'enek, bɛ naazɛmyaal etɛp ee nadi kwyala tɔ Mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, nɛ etɛp ee Yezu nadi elɛɛ bɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu nɛ gu ebhum e elyem e bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />É sok Yezu nadi, nyɛ dinaa pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, é ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak, bot ɛbuɛpe naadyeebadum koŋ nɛ din ɛ lɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ebebee endem e mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ nadi esesa ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Tin, Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ɛbwaalel nɛ nɔɔ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi egu bɔɔ djas. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Bela náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ gwyes náá, mot zɛlɛɛ nyɛ sa bot binɔk di ɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi egu sa nadi tɔ lyem mot nɛ mot ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛmɔ ɛ Yezu bɛ nɛ Nikodhɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Tɔ sama eFalizyɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Nikodhɛm. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, ngɔt pɛ tɔ ekukuma eYuda. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokazɛzyɛ pɛ daa Yezu é pum. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Labhi, bis nɛ gu náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ nadhis wɔ pɛ daa les, étɛp wɔ neezɛlyo bis. Etɛɛ náá, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsa endem e mɛbwala mɛ wɔ di esa yenek, yɛ di ààbɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ nɛ nɛ sama ɔɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ́ náá: Mot ɛ di ààbyel-byelak na bes ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaabee Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodhɛm eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mot aabaabyel-byelak na bes dáa, mot moo yɛ tɔa-mot? Nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbaani tɔ mɔ nyɛɛg, da nyɛ ɛ́ baabyel-byelak sis é?» <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ́ náá, mot ɛ di ààbyel byela mɛdii nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaani tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Mot ɛ byel-byelak tɔ epuud ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot epuud. Mot ɛ byel-byelak tɔ Sisim na Dɛɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot sisim. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Nàdjoka, etɛɛ náá, mɛ eeke nɛ nɔ náá: “Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbyel ɛ́, byela na bes.” <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Pup kɛ ɛ́ é ze nyɛ di ekwyɛl ɛ. Tin, wɔy ɛpegwak ghuula tak. Deenek, kabela ɛ́ náá, wɔ ààgu pɛ yɛ di edus ɛ, nɛ pɛ yɛ di etɔ́ ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ bot ɛ zebyel tɔ Sisim Zɛɛb ɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodhɛm eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Yenek aasael dáa?» <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔy ɛ́ boo lyoel kɔ Yisalaɛl. Wɔ ààgu etɛp binek é? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ́ náá, bis dyeebalɛɛ ɛ́ etɛp ee bis di egu ɛ. Bis baŋa bot ɛ́ etɛp ee bis nabee nɛ mis mes ɛ. Tin, biyɔ, bi ààmyaal etɛp ee bis di elɛɛ bin ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Bi ɛ di ààmyaal mɛ, é sok mɛ di elyo bin etɛp e bɔs ɔɔ, haaa bi aamyaal dáa, yɛ bɛ náá, mɛ moo lɛɛ bin etɛp ee di tɔ gwoo ɔɔ? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Ye tok nɛ mot zebyet ni tɔ gwoo, yɛ di ààbɛ mot nadus tɔ gwoo ɔɔ, mot tak ɛ́, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ, dáa Moiiz nadi nyɛ dinaa tɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, nyɛ naatsel nyɔ é le<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nyɔ é le <char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Ɛla 21.9</ref> </char></char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyɔ tak nalulaa ɛ́ nɛ ghwooz di djóoaa blɔɔz ɛ. </char></note>. Tyee wat, ye goka ɛ́ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot tselaa é le. <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ mot kwaadum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ, nyɛ aabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Zɛɛb naadyeebakwyɛl bot kɔ bɔs, étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ ɛ́ nadhis sim Mɔn'ɛ met. Etɛɛ náá, mot aadum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ, needi ààgwyɛ, nyɛ neebela tsik na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààdhis Mɔn'ɛ kɔ bɔs étɛp ɛpɛ́ɛ bot. Nyɛ nadhis Mɔn'ɛ étɛp bot ɛ bɔs neebela tsik kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Mot aadum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ, yenɔk mot aanàkwaakwyeselaa ndjɛ sɔs. Tin, mot aadi ààdum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ, yenɔk eezelookwyeselaa ndjɛ sɔs, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eepɛɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ sim Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="JHN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Beeka dáa Zɛɛb aapɛ́ɛ bot ɛ: Mɛkas naazyɛ kɔ bɔs, tin, bot ɛ bɔs kakwyɛl yɔbɔ ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ ghooghom dhaa mɛkas. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ embee mɛsa. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Bot djas di esa embee mɛsa ɔ, bɛ ààkwyɛl mɛkas. Deenek, mot tak ààkwyɛl ɛtɔ́ pɛ gwyɛ di ɛ, etɛɛ náá nyɛ ɛpekaab náá, embee etɛp bɛ ɛzɛkɛnyen na “ngbɛlɛlɛ” é mis mɛ bot. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Tin, mot di ekɛ dáa etsɛɛtsɛ di elɛɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛpetiila tɔ ngel gwyɛ, étɛp mɛsa mɛ nyɛ di esa sama nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, neenyen popoopwon é mis mɛ bot djas.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zaŋ nduuel-bot nɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Yude bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. Bɛ eezɛbe di penek, tin, nyɛ nadi eduu bot Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />É ghɛŋ tak, pɛ dɛl Enɔn é ngwoob dɛl Salim, Zaŋ nabaadi pe ɛ́, eduu bot Zɛɛb penek etɛɛ náá, pɛ kyee dik tak nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛdhii ɛbuɛpe. Tin, bot ɛbuɛpe nadi ezezyɛ, zɛduwa Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Etɛp binek djas nasael ɛ́, Zaŋ dinaa ààkɔɔlaa é mbok.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Tin, bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel ɛ Zaŋ nadi ebe mɛso bɛ nɛ dhiiti mot mbyak eYuda. Mot tak nadi elii ɛ́ dum nɛ dáa mot di egoka nɛ ɛsa étɛp nyɛ needis edhuud, da bula dɛɛ é mis ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Wɔ gwaa bɛ zokazyɛ pɛ daa Zaŋ, bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Labhi, é sok mena nadika pɛ yii kyiid dii Yuldɛn ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, wɔ naalii nɛ nes kɔ ɛsu ɛ mot ngɔt. Beea! Mot tak ɛpeduu bot Zɛɛb, deenek bot djas katɔ́ ɛ penek pɛ daa lɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Zaŋ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dhiiti mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbela duu sis, bhis yii Zɛɛb zedjɛ nyɛ ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Biyɔ bɛmet nadi ɛ́ tak, esok mɛ nalɛɛ náá: “Mɛ tok Mɛsia ɛ. Mam ɛ́ mot Zɛɛb nanyɛl ɛdhis ɛsok nɛ nɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Mot di nakuma moma ɛba ɔ, yɛ ngom. Tin, mɔɔ sɔ mot ba moma ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ é ngwoob'ɛ étɛp nyɛ neegwak nyɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala ɛbuɛpe dáa nyɛ gwak gwood motom ba ɔ. Tyee wat mɛmyaala menek ɛ mɛ mɛmyaala mam. Mɛmyaala mɛ tak eebela ɛsuk. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Ye goka ɛ́ náá, duma ɛ Yezu byet, ɛbyet nɛ ɛbyet, da yam ɛ́ sila.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Mot dus pɛ ɛko ɔ, nyɛ eedhaa bot djas. Mot di kɔ bɔs ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot bɔs, nyɛ lii ɛ́, etɛp e bɔs. Deenek, mot dus pɛ ɛko ɔ, nyɛ eedhaa bot djas. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Nyɛ nɛ dyeebalɛɛ bot esesɛɛ ee nyɛ di ebee ɛ, nɛ yii nyɛ di egwak ɛ. Tin, bot ààkwyɛl ɛmyaal etɛp ee nyɛ di elii nɛ nɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Mot di myaal etɛp ee nyɛ di elɛɛ ɛ, baamyaal ɛ́ náá, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, Zɛɛb lɛɛ ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Mot Zɛɛb lwom ɔ, dyeebalii ɛ etɛp e Zɛɛb. Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb naadjɛ nyɛ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ djas.<verse eid="JHN 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Sɛɛg nɛ kwyɛl Mɔn. Étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ nadjɛ nyɛ eghɛŋ nɛ ghwyil kɔ esonok djas. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Mot ɛ dum koŋ nɛ Mɔn ɔ, yenɔk ɛ́ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm. Tin, mot di ààdum koŋ nɛ Mɔn ɔ, yenɔk aanàkwaabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm. Deenek, ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ pɛ kɔ lɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bhoma ɛ Yezu bɛ nɛ moma Samaali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1-2" />Bot ɛbuɛpe nadi esaa náá, Yezu duu bɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, Yezu nyɛ ɛmet nabɛ ààdi eduu bot ɛ tak Zɛɛb. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ́ nadi eduu bot Zɛɛb. É ghɛŋ sama bot ɛ eFalizyɛ nagwak náá, Yezu nadi eduu bot ɛbuɛpe dhaa Zaŋ ɛ, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛsa mbee lyem. <verse eid="JHN 4:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />É ghɛŋ Yezu nagwak bot elii deenek ɛ́, nyɛ naazɛdus pɛ kyee dik Yude, nyɛ ɛ́ eezɛsik pɛ kyee dik Ghalile.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />É di'enek, ye nazogoka ɛ́, nyɛ dhaa pɛ ze kyee dik Samaali. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Nyɛ eezɛkum é ngwoob dhiiti ghaada kyee dik Samaali nadi edjóoaa Sikaad ɛ. Ghaada tak nabɛ ɛ́ é ngwoob pyeeb Zakɔɔb nadjɛ mɔn Zozɛf ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />É di tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ guk mɛdii ɛ Zakɔɔb. Dáa nabela náá, Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eezewak nɛ kyeed ɛ, é di'enek, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel disi é ngwoob guk mɛdii. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ dwoo moo tyee kuku gwoo.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7-8" />Bɛdjekel eezɛtɔ́ pɛ dɛl kɛsaa edee. Bhii tak, dhiiti moma Samaali eezɛzyɛ zɛdaa mɛdii. Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Djɛ mɛ mɛdii mɛ dek.» <verse eid="JHN 4:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Moma tak eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔy ɛ́ mot mbyak eYuda. Ye kan dáa, étɛp wɔ neewaab mɛdii nɛ mam, moma mbyak Samaali?» Tinaak, nyɛ nake deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ààgwakel nɛ bot ɛ mbyak Samaali. <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus demande de l’eau à une femme de Samarie" file="Dn00433b.tif" size="col" loc="4.9" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="4.9">Yezu eewaab dhiiti moma dɛl ɛ Samaali mɛdii</figure><verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ ɛpedi ɛ́ di egu sa Zɛɛb aadjɛ wɔ ɛ, wɔ baadi egu mot di eke nɛ nɔ náá: “Djɛ mɛ mɛdii, mɛ dek” ɔɔ, pe wɔy ɛ́ waab mɛdii nɛ nɛ. É di'enek, nyɛ waadjɛ wɔ mɛdii mɛ di edjɛ tsik ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Moma yenɔk eezɛke: «Ghɛŋ! Wɔ tok nɛ sa wɔ aadaa mɛdii nɛ yɛ. Guk nɛ dim. Haaa wɔ aabela mɛdii mɛ di edjɛ tsik ɛ wo?<verse eid="JHN 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Wɔ kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ boo-mot dhaa bhaab'es Zakɔɔb, mot nadjɛ bis guk mɛdii mak ɔ? Tin, nyɛ naadɛ mɛdii mɛ tak nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet, zɛnɔɔ bɔn bɛ, nɛ mɛsaa mɛ bɛtit mɛ nyɛ nadi ebaal ɛ?»<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bot djas di edɛ mɛdii mak ɔ, bɛ waabaagwak gwyes ɛdɛ mɛdii. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Tin, mot aadɛ mɛdii mɛ mam aadjɛ nyɛ ɔ, mot tak aanàkwaabaagwak gwyes mɛdii. Etɛɛ náá, mɛdii mɛ mam aadjɛ nyɛ ɛ, yɛ aaliiza tɔ lɛ ɛ́, sɔɔgɔ mɛdii mɛ tsik na kɔm-kɔm mɛ di ààgel ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Moma yenɔk eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, djɛ mɛ mɛdii mɛ tak, étɛp mɛ needi ààbaagwak gwyes mɛdii, mɛ needi ààbaazezyɛ zɛdaa mɛdii wak.» <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ moma tak náá: «Tɔ́a, kɛdjóo ngom'ɔ, da bi ɛ́ zyɛ wak.»<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Tin, moma yenɔk eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Mɛ tok nɛ ngom.» É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ nɛ gham nɛ ɛke náá, wɔ tok nɛ ngom. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Etɛɛ náá, wɔ naaba botom ɛtɛn. Motom wɔ di nɛ nɛ mos'aak, nyɛ tok ngom'ɔ. É di'enek, wɔ bɛ ɛ́ wɔ eelɛɛ sa di náá, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Moma yenɔk eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, mɛ bee ɛ́ ɛkɛɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Bɛbhaab bis, bot ɛ Samaali naduwal Zɛɛb ɛ́ kɔ ɛtsok ɛlak. Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ eYuda ɔɔ, bi ke ɛ́ náá: “Di di egoka nɛ ɛdjaala Zɛɛb ɛ, pɛ Yeluzalɛm.”» <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔy moma, myaala sa mɛ di elɛɛ'aak. Ɛwala ɛpezyɛ, ɛwala di náá, bot aanàbaakɛduwal Zɛɛb Sɛɛg pɛ kɔ ɛtsok ɛlak nɛghu pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Biyɔ bot ɛ Samaali, bi dyeebaduwal ɛ́ Zɛɛb bi di ààgu ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ bisɔ eYuda ɔɔ, bis duwal ɛ́ Zɛɛb bis di egu ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, tsik dus ɛ́ pɛ daa bot ɛ mbyak eYuda. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Tin, guka náá, ɛwala ɛpezyɛ, ɛwala ɛ tak eezekum, ɛwala ɛ bɛtɛtɛ ɛ bɛduwalel aaduwal Sɛɛg pɛ tɔ sisim nɛ tɔ etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, binɔk ɛ́ mbi bɛduwalel ɛ Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Zɛɛb ɛ́ Sisim. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ ye di enyɔ náá, bot ɛ di eduwal nyɛ ɔ, duwal nyɛ pɛ tɔ sisim nɛ tɔ etsɛɛtsɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Moma eebaazɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Mɛ nɛ gu náá, Mɛsia di edjóoaa “Klisto” ɔ, nyɛ waazyɛ. É sok nyɛ aazyɛ ɛ, nyɛ waazɛlɛɛ bis esa binek djas». <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mam, mot di elii nɛ nɔ'aak, yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di Mɛsia.»<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />É di'enek, bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛtuula bɛ moo tin edjoka etɛɛ náá, bɛ naazɛbela Yezu elii nɛ moma tak. Tin, mot ngɔt pak'ɔɔ nabɛ ààdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ saa yé?» Nɛghu: «Kɔ ɛsu ɛ yé wɔ di elii bi nɛ moma yak?» <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Bhii tak, moma tak eezɛlik bhe nyɛ di edaa mɛdii mɛ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel'ɛ, sik pɛ ghaada. Nyɛ moo tin eke nɛ bot náá: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />«Dhabeeka dhiiti mot eelɛɛ mɛ etɛp ee mɛ di esa djas ɛ. Mɛ bee ɛ́ náá, mot'ak ɛ di Mɛsia!» <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Bot ɛ ghaada tak eezɛghɛɛ, tɔ́ kɛbee Yezu pɛ nyɛ nadi ɛ́.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />É di'enek, bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛbesal nyɛ náá, nyɛ dɛ edee. Bɔɔ náá: «Labhi, dɛa edee!» <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mam dɛ ɛ́ mbi edee ee di náá, bi ààgu ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Tin, bɛdjekel moo tin edjinel pak'ɔɔ náá: «Dhiiti mot bɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eezyɛ nyɛ nɛ edee bhii koŋ'enaka?»<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Edee bam ɛ́ ɛsa ɛkwosak ɛ mot nadhis mɛ ɔ. Nyɛ nadhis mɛ ɛ́, étɛp mɛ neesa mɛsa mɛ kɛkum ɛsik ɛ tak. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Biyɔ bɛmet bi nɛ dyeebakan kana yak: “Ye kalik ɛ́ bɛngɔn ɛná, étɛp ɛkɛdis edee ee zekwak tɔ epyeeb ɛ.” Mam kalɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, benka mis men, da bi ɛ́ gwyák mɛbhek men, yɛ eezewum, etɛɛ náá, ye neekɛdisaa tɔ epyeeb. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Mot di esa mɛsa mɛ ɛdis edee tɔ pyeeb ɔ, nyɛ nɛ bela yɛ efute djala nɛ mɛsa mɛ nyɛ sa ɛ. Nyɛ ɛpesɛɛg mɛbhek, mɛbhek mɛ tak ɛ, bot djas aabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm ɔ. Deenek etɛɛ náá, mot di ebɛ mɛbhek ɔ, nɛ mot di edis edee tɔ pyeeb ɔ, bɔɔ djas neemyaala sama. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ, kana di eke náá: “Dhiiti mot ɛpebɛ mɛbhek, nwyak tak kazyɛ ɛ́ zɛbɔk bhum tak”. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Etɛɛ náá, mɛ eelwom bin, bi tɔ́ kɛdis mɛbhek, tɔ edi di náá, bi nabɛ ààbɛ mɛbhek mɛ tak ɛ. Bɛdhiiti bot ɛ́ nazesa mɛsa, biyɔ kadi ɛ́ bot ɛ di ezyɛ zɛdɛ edee e mɛsa mɔɔ ɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ kyee dik Samaali nadi tɔ dɛl ɛlenek ɔ, naabaadum koŋ nɛ Yezu ɛbuɛpe. Bɛ namyaal nyɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ etɛp e moma yenɔk nalɛɛ bɛ ɛ. Nyɛ nadi eke ɛ́ náá: «Dhabeeka dhiiti mot eelɛɛ mɛ etɛp ee mɛ di esa djas ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Bhii tak, dáa bot ɛ kyee dik Samaali nazɛbela Yezu tin ɛ, bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Nàkabaadhaa. Zokadi wak.» Tin, nyɛ eezɛdjasi mɛlu mɛmbá bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Tin, bɛtɛ nɛ bot naazɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛbuɛpe, kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛkpa mɛ Yezu. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Tin, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ moma yenɔk náá: «É di mena kadi wak nenak'aak, bis ààpadum koŋ nɛ nɛ etɛɛ náá, wɔ nalɛɛ bis. Bis kamyaal ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bis eegwak nɛ mɛlɔ mes met. Bis eegu náá, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ Mɛtsik-bot kɔ bɔs.»<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik mɔn dhiiti boo kukuma esodja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Bhii mɛlu mɛmbá menek, Yezu eezɛdus kɔ dɛl ɛ tak, nyɛ eezɛsik pɛ kyee dik Ghalile. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Nyɛ nadi esa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet naalɛɛ náá: «Ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ààduwalaa kɔ dɛl ɛ nyɛ nabyel ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Dáa nyɛ nakum pɛ Ghalile ɛ, bot ɛ kyee dik tak naabe nyɛ ɛnyɔɛpe, etɛɛ náá, bɛ naabee esa djas nyɛ nasa é ghɛŋ ɛbyoŋ ɛ pak pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ pe naabaatɔ́ pɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ tak.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛsik pɛ ghaada Kana pɛ kyee dik Ghalile. Kana ɛ́ ghaada nyɛ naliig mɛdii moo mɛnyok ɛ. Pɛ ghaada Kapɛlnaum, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti boo kukuma lɔɔg esodja ɛ mɛkoozi. Mɔn'ɛ nadi ebɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Nyɛ naagwak náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́, Yezu eezedus pɛ kyee dik Yude, tɔ́ pɛ Ghalile. Nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ daa lɛ, nyɛ eezɛdjaala nɛ nɛ náá: «Geka mɛ ghoŋ! Dha! Mɔn'am mɔɔ motom ɛpebɛ́ ɛkpaŋɛpe. Nyɛ moo ɛ́ pak ɛsyee nɛ tsik. Dha tsik nyɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bi ɛ di ààbee endem e mɛbwala nɛ mɛvyɛkɛlɛ ɔɔ, bi aanàkwaadum koŋ nɛ nam!» <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Kukuma tak eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, lela ɛzyɛ pɛ daa lam ɛsok nɛ mɔn'am nɛ gwyɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Sika pɛ ndjaŋ'ɔ, mɔn'ɔ eezetsak.» Tin, mot'enɔk eezɛmyaal sa Yezu nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ. Nyɛ eezɛtɔ́.<verse eid="JHN 4:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Dáa nyɛ nadi, nyɛ dinaa é ze ɛ, wɔ gwaa bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ zɛboma nɛ nɛ, bɛ eezɛlɛɛ nyɛ náá: «Mɔn'ɔ ɛ́ nyel ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ tsik.» <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛdji bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ náá: «Nyɛ tsak é yaa ɛwala?» Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «É ɛwala ɛsok, bhis ɛwala ɛ dwoo di etyaa tɔ gwoo ɛ, mɛkosa naasi nyɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Tin, kukuma tak eezɛgwyak náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ é ɛwala Yezu nake nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɔn'ɔ ɛ́ nɛ tsik» ɛ. Tin, nyɛ eezɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, bɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ djas.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Yenek nabɛ ɛ́ ndem mɛbwala yii esok ebá Yezu nasa, bhii nyɛ nadus kɔ kyee dik Yude tɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Ghalile ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik dhiiti mot ɛbɛ́ nyel nazesɔɔb ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Bhii tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti ɛbyoŋ ɛ eYuda. Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boobyet tɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Pɛ Yeluzalɛm, é ngwoob ɛbɛ nadi edjóoaa «Eniel Bhata» ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti boo tok ɛgwyiia nadi edjóoaa tɔ lii ebhele, Bhetɛsdha ɛ. É di tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɔɔ mɛbhaaz mɛtɛn. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3-4" />Tɔ mɛbhaaz mɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ membel mendjaamesi. Bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ mɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́, bot ɛ edhim, bɛ na edjam, bot ɛ mɛnyel nazesɔɔb bɛ ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.3-4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɔ dhiiti Ekwyala, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛkpa mak: <char style="em">Bɛ nadi ebwood ɛ́, mɛdii dheegel. Etɛɛ náá, ye nabebɛ ɛ́ nɛ fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ ngɔt nadidi esul tin étɛp ɛzɛdhedheeg mɛdii. Tin, mot ɛbɛ́ aaleeghaaga tɔ tok ɛsok nɛ bɛsɔ, mɛdii dinaa edheegel ɔ, mot tak ɛpetsak, ye nakoozodi yak kwaambi ɛbɛ́.</char></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />É di'enek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot nabɔya nɛ ɛbɛ́ membu mɛkam-mɛlɛl nɛ membu mɛtɛn nɛ elɛl (38) ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Dáa Yezu nabee nyɛ ndjaasi ɛ, nɛ dáa nyɛ nagu náá, nyɛ eeloozebɔya nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ tak ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ ɛpekwyɛl ɛtsak é?» <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Tin, mot ɛbɛ́ ɛlɛnɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, mɛ tok nɛ mot ghɛɛg mɛ tɔ boo tok ɛgwyiia, é ghɛŋ mɛdii aadheegel ɛ. Esok djas mɛ di esaa náá, mɛ tɔ́ kɛghaaga ɛ, ye dyeebabela ɛ́ mot sis eezeghaaga ɛsok nɛ nam.» <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wyɛla, nɔŋa mwaala yɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />É di'enek, mot yenɔk eezɛtsak. Nyɛ eezɛghɛɛ mwaala yɛ, nyɛ moo ekɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Tin, etɛp binek nasael ɛ́ dwoo saba. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Bhii tak, ekukuma eYuda eezɛke nɛ mot natsikaa ɔ náá: «Wɔ ààgoka nɛ ɛghɛɛ mwaala yɔ mos. Etɛɛ náá, mos ɛ́ dwoo saba.» <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mot tsik mɛ ɔ, lɛɛ nɛ nam ɛ́ náá: “Ghɛɛa mwaala yɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛ!”» <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Bɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Yenɔk ɛ́ nwyaa mot lɛɛ wɔ náá: “Ghɛɛa mwaala yɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛ”?» <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Tin, mot natsikaa ɔ nabɛ ààgwyak mot natsik nyɛ ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́, Yezu naazesyela tɔ ɛdhuu bot ɛ nadi é di'enek ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Ba mɛwala bhii tak, Yezu eezɛboma nɛ nɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Beea! Wɔ eezetsak. Sa wɔ ààbaasa mesyem ekaab náá, dhiiti mbee sonok ɛzɛkɛbaabela wɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Tin, mot yenɔk eezɛtɔ́, wɔ gwaa nyɛ kɛlɛɛ nɛ ekukuma eYuda náá, yɛ ɛ́ Yezu ɛ natsik nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ ekukuma eYuda nadi esaa dáa bɛ sa étɛp bɛ neetiig Yezu. Bɛ nakwyɛl ɛsa deenek ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, Yezu natsik mot yenɔk ɛ dwoo saba. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Deenek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛlu djas, Saagam ɛpesa mɛsa, dɔɔ nɛ mam pe, mɛ ɛpesa mɛsa.» <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kɔ ɛsu ɛ etɛp binek, ekukuma eYuda nadi esaa dáa sa étɛp bɛ neegó nyɛ. Bɛ nadi esa deenek ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi eduwal dwoo saba, nyɛ baadi eke ɛ́ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ Sɛɛg met. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ nyɛ nadi egek náá, nyɛ tyee wat nɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zɛɛb eedjɛ Mɔn eghɛŋ bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yezu eezɛlii nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: Mɔn tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsa dhiiti sonok nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ lɛ. Nyɛ dyeebabee ɛ́ mɛsa mɛ Sɛɛg di ezyɛ nɛ sa sok ɛ. Sa Sɛɛg di esa ɛ, Mɔn pe nɛ sa yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Bela náá, Sɛɛg nɛ kwyɛl Mɔn. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boodi elyaal nyɛ esesɛɛ djas nyɛ di esa ɛ. Tin, nyɛ waalyaal nyɛ eboo esonok dhaa yii bi di bee'aak, étɛp bi needjoka ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛg nɛ gomal bot tɔ ɛsyee, da djɛ bɛ tsik. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ Mɔn'ɛ pe nɛ djɛ tsik nɛ mot nyɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Sɛɛg ààpɛ́ɛ bot, tin, nyɛ naadjɛ Mɔn eghɛŋ e ɛpɛ́ɛ ɛ bot. <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />Deenek, bot djas needuwal Mɔn, dáa Mɔn di eduwal Sɛɛg ɛ. Mot di ààduwal Mɔn'ɛ ɔ, nyɛ ààduwal Sɛɛg mot nadhis Mɔn ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mot di egwak mɛlyo mam, da nyɛ ɛ́ dum koŋ nɛ mot nadhis mɛ ɔ, nyɛ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm. Tin, yenɔk aanàkwaapɛ́ɛaa, deenek, nyɛ eezedus tɔ ɛsyee, ni pɛ tɔ tsik. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, ɛwala ɛpezyɛ, ɛwala ɛ tak eezekum, ɛwala bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ aagwak gwood Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, bot djas aagwak gwood tak ɔ, bɛ waabela tsik. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Yɛ waasael etɛɛ náá, tyee wat nɛ dáa Sɛɛg di ɛsuk ɛ tsik ɛ, deenek, nyɛ eesa náá, Mɔn pe di ɛsuk ɛ tsik. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Deenek, Zɛɛb naadjɛ nyɛ eghɛŋ yii ɛpɛ́ɛ ɛ bot, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Sa mot ààdjoka. Etɛɛ náá, ɛwala ɛpezyɛ, ɛwala di náá, bot ɛ nazegwyɛ, delaa tɔ mɛvit ɔ, bɛ aagwak gwood'ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />Bhii tak bɛ waawyis tɔ mɛvit mɔɔ. Bot ɛ nasa enɛm esa ɔ, bɛ waagom tɔ ɛsyee etɛp ɛdi tɔ tsik. Tin, bot nasa embee mɛsa ɔ waagom etɛp bɛ neezɛkwyeselaa ndjɛ sɔs.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Mam tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsa esonok dáa lyem'am di ekwos ɛ. Mɛ pɛ́ɛ ɛ́, dáa Saagam di lɛɛ ɛ náá, mɛ pɛ́ɛ ɛ. É di'enek, epɛ́ɛ mɛ aapɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, yɛ aadi ɛ́, tɔ epiki, etɛɛ náá, mam ààsa ɛkwosak ɛ lam. Mɛ sa ɛ́ ɛkwosak ɛ mot nalwom mɛ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin sa mɛ di egu kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam ɔɔ, bot aanàkwaamyaal sa mɛ aalɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Yɛ ɛ́ dhiiti mot ɛ di egoka nɛ ɛlɛɛ bot etɛp ee mɛ di esa ɛ. Tin, mɛ nɛ gu náá, etɛp ee nyɛ di elɛɛ bot kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi naalwom bot pɛ daa Zaŋ. Tin nyɛ naalɛɛ bin etɛp ee etsɛɛtsɛ dum nɛ nam. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Yɛ bɛ mam ɔɔ, mɛ tok nɛ gwyes náá, mot lɛɛ bot sa mɛ di ɛ, nɛ esa ee mɛ di esa ɛ. Tin, mɛ lii etɛp bak ɛ́, étɛp bi neetsak. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Zaŋ nabɛ ɛ́ dáa lama di etuubel, da yɛ ɛ́ wa bot djas tɔ eselele e gwyɛ ɛ. Deenek bi nabɛ ɛ́, bi eemyaala ba ɛwala wat tɔ eselele e gwyɛ yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Guka náá, mam ɛ́ nɛ boo lɛŋ ɛkaada dhaa Zaŋ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛsa mɛ Saagam djɛ mɛ náá mɛ sa kɛkum ɛsik ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ mɛsa mɛ tak ɛ di elyaal bot, mot mɛ di ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ di elyaal bot náá, Saagam ɛ́ nadhis mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Deenek, Saagam, mot nalwom mɛ ɔ, nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet ɛ di ekɛm nɛ ɛlyaal ɛ bot kɔkɔ mbi mot mɛ di ɛ. Bi dinaa ààpakogwak-gwakak gwood'ɛ. Bi dinaa ààpakobee-beeak bhwoob'ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Bi ààbaal mɛkpa mɛ tɔ len, étɛp tak ɛ bi di ààdum koŋ nɛ mot nyɛ nadhis ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Bi ɛpewa lyem tɔ ɛdjek ɛ mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb. Bi bwaal ɛ́ náá, tɔ ɛwa ɛ zii é mɛdjek mɛ bi di edjek ɛ, bi ɛ́ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm. Tin, guka náá, Ekwyala binek ɛ di elii nɛ ɛlɛɛ nɛ bot, mot mɛ di ɛ, nɛ mɛsa mam. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Tin, bi kadi ɛ́, ààkwyɛl ɛzyɛ pɛ daa lam, étɛp bi neebela tsik!<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Mam aanàsaa náá, bot djɛ mɛ duu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Tin, mɛ nɛ gu náá, kwyɛl Zɛɛb tok tɔ elyem bin. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Saagam ɛ́ nalwom mɛ, bi kadi ɛ́, ààmyaal mɛ. Tin, dhiiti mot ɛ zyɛ nɛ ghwyil'ɛ met ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ waamyaal nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Biyɔ ɛ́ di náá, mot nɛ mot saŋ ɛ́ yɛ duu nyɛ ɛmet yenek. Bi ààsaa duu di edus pɛ daa Zɛɛb nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet ɛ. Bi aakwak ɛdum koŋ nɛ nam dáa?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Sa mot ààgek náá, mam ɛ́ waakɛpit bin pɛ daa Saagam. Mot aakɛpit bin ɔ, yɛ aadi ɛ́ Moiiz, mot bi nawa ɛbwaalel ɛ len kɔ lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />É di'enek, guka náá, bi ɛpedi ɛ́ di emyaal Moiiz ɔɔ, pe bi eemyaal mɛ, etɛɛ náá, Moiiz nakwyal ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Tin, bi ɛ di ààmyaal sa Moiiz nakwyal ɔɔ, haaa bi aamyaal mɛlyo mam dáa?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛdjɛ botom bɛmil ɛtɛn edee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛtɔ́ pɛ yii kyeed boo soob na djato-djato kyee dik Ghalile. Boo soob tak baadjóoaa ɛ́ Tibeliaad. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Wɔ gwaa, zukamwaa nɛ mot zɛdu nyɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ebee endem e mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ nadi esa nɛ ɛtsik ɛ membel ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbyet kɔ ɛtsok. Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel disi bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ dwoo Pak, ɛbyoŋ ɛ eYuda eezekunaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Dáa Yezu naben mis, bee náá, ɛdhuu ɛ bot nadi ezyɛ pɛ pak nyɛ nadi ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ Filip náá: «Mena kɛbɔm emapa paa, étɛp bot bak needɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Nyɛ nake nɛ Filip deenek ɛ́, étɛp nyɛ neebee dáa nyɛ aasa ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet nadi egu dáa nyɛ aasa étɛp bɛ needɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filip eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Nɛ edhenye bɛdhet-ɛbá (200) e epata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">edhenye </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nabɛ ɛ́ epata ee bot ɛ kyee dik Ghalile nadi ebela é mɛsa mɛ mwos wat ɛ.</char></note> bis tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbɔm emapa ee aadjala nɛ dek bot bak djas ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Mot ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel bɛ, yɛ din nabɛ ɛ́ Andele. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ dhyeeb ɛ Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd, nyɛy zokazɛke nɛ Yezu náá: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />«Tɔ sama bot ɛ di wak'aak, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɔɔ ngbaaz ngɔt di nɛ emapa etɛn yii ɔɔghɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɔɔghɛ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɛ́ mbi dhiiti bhek bɛ di esa emapa nɛ yɛ ɛ.</char></note>, zɛnɔɔ bɔɔ bɛsu ɛ ɛbá. Yenek aakosa yé nɛ zukamwaa nɛ mot di wak'aak?» <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke náá: «Dilka bɛ si mendiindil.» É di tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nɛ mɛso-mɛgwyii ɛbuɛpe. Tin, bɛ eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel, disi kɔ tak. Bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ nabɛ ɛ́ tyee botom bɛmil ɛtɛn (5 000). <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Bhii tak, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛnɔɔ mapa, ghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ, kaa bot binɔk yɛ ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eebaazɛnɔɔ bɛsu, kaa bot binɔk yɛ ɛ. Bot djas naadɛ dáa elyem bɔɔ kwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Dáa bot nadɛ djil ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Bulaka nɛ epes lik ɛ, ekaab náá, yɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛpulel.» <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Tin, bɛdjekel moo tin etek ebhil e tak. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazɛlwoodal mɛbhwaa kam nɛ ebá nɛ mɛbhubhwak mɛ ebil e emapa etɛn bot nakat ɛdɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Dáa bot nabee endem e mɛbwala mɛ Yezu nasa ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛke náá: «Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, nwyak ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nakeaa náá, nyɛ waazyɛ kɔ bɔs'ak ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Tin, Yezu naazɛgu náá, bɛ nadi esuu ɛzɛ mɛt nyɛ nɛ ghwyil, étɛp ɛkɛdil nyɛ kɔ bóó mɛkoozi nɛ bhel. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛkaab, byet kɔ ɛtsok, nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛkɛ kɔ boo soob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Dáa dwoo nabɛ ye moo sila ɛ, bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛwyeed, tɔ́ pɛ ɛboŋ ɛ boo soob na djato-djato. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛni tɔ boo elɛɛd. Tin, bɛ moo tsaal dii tɔ́ pɛ yii kyiid pɛ kyee Kapɛlnaum. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, ɛgwyitok eezegwyiidela. Yezu nadi ɛ́, nyɛ dinaa ààzɛbela bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Tin, boo ghuu moo tin epupal kɔ boo soob na djato-djato, bhuuge moo tin eghɛɛ mɛdii ɛlyelɛpe. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Bhii bɛ naduk tyee enɛŋ etɛn ɛ, bɛ kabee ɛ́ Yezu ekɛ kɔ dii. Nyɛy ezyɛ pɛ kyee bɛ nadi tɔ elɛɛd ɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bwoo nɛ bɛbebwol naamɛt bɔɔ djas. <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus marche sur la mer" file="cn01722C.tif" size="col" loc="6.19" copy="David C. Cook" ref="6.19">Yezu eekɛ kɔ boo dii</figure><verse eid="JHN 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mam, nàbemka ba!» <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛniigal nyɛ tɔ boo elɛɛd tak. É di tak wat, elɛɛd eezɛkum é ɛboŋ ɛ bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛsɛɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛpesaa Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Yak dwoo bhii tak, ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nalik pɛ yii kyiid boo soob na djato-djato ɔ, bɛ eezɛbee náá, ye nazokalik é ɛboŋ ɛ́, elɛɛd wat. Bɛ nadi egu náá, Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ ààtɔ́ tɔ elɛɛd wat bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. Bɛ natɔ́ ɛ́ bɔɔ bɛmet. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Edhiiti elɛɛd nadi edus pɛ ghaada Tibeliaad. Yɛ eezɛkum pɛ pak bɛ nadi edɛ emapa bhii mendjaala mɛ Ghɛŋ naghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />É ghɛŋ mɛdhuu mɛ bot binɔk nabee náá, Yezu nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ tin ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛni tɔ mɛlɛɛd kɛsaa Yezu bɔɔ bɛmet pɛ kyee dik Kapɛlnaum.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ɛ́ mapa tsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Bot naazɛboma nɛ Yezu pɛ nyɛ nadi pɛ yii kyiid boo soob na djato-djato ɛ. Bɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Labhi, wɔ kaleezyɛ kak é yaa ɛwala?» <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: Bi ààsaa mɛ etɛɛ náá, bi naabee endem e mɛbwala mam. Bi saa mɛ ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bi naadɛ emapa, bi naadjil ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Nàsaka mɛsa étɛp ɛsaŋ ɛ edee ee di náá, yɛ waapulel ɛ. Saka mɛsa étɛp ɛbela edee di ebɔya ɛ, edee di edjɛ tsik na kɔm-kɔm ɛ, edee Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aadjɛ bin ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb Sɛɛg nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet naadjɛ nyɛ ze ɛsa mɛsa mɛ nyɛ di esa yenek.» <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Bɛ eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Bis goka nɛ ɛsa dáa étɛp bis neesa etɛp Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Sa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ náá, bi dum koŋ nɛ mot nyɛ nadhis ɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Bot binɔk eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyaala bis dhiiti ndem mɛbwala, étɛp bis needum koŋ nɛ nɔ. Yaa embɛɛ mɛsa mɛ wɔ di esa? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Bɛbhaab binaka naadɛ emapa ee nadus tɔ gwoo ɛ, pɛ tɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ. Dáa ye nakwyalel náá: “Zɛɛb naadjɛ bɛ emapa ee nadus tɔ gwoo ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.31 <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Ɛwy 16.4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Mɛd 78.24</ref></char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zɛɛb naadjɛ bot ɛ Yisalaɛl emapa ee nadus tɔ gwoo ɛ étɛp bɛ needɛ. </char></note>.”» <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ mɛ eelɛɛ bin etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, ye tok Moiiz nadjɛ bin mapa nadus pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ Saagam ɛ di edjɛ bin tɛtɛ mapa di edus pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Etɛɛ náá, mapa Zɛɛb di edjɛ bot ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ mapa di edus pɛ ɛko ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ di edjɛ tsik nɛ bot ɛ bɔs djas.» <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Tin, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, gheedjedjɛ bis mapa tak mɛlu djas!» <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yezu eezɛbaake nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di mapa di edjɛ tsik ɛ. Mot aazyɛ pɛ daa lam ɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaabaagwak za. Deenek, mot aadum koŋ nɛ nam ɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaabaagwak gwyes mɛdii. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Tin, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, bi eebee mɛ, saabɛgɔs kabɛ ɛ́ náá, bi ààdum koŋ nɛ nam. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Bot djas Saagam di edjɛ mɛ ɔ, bɛ waazyɛ pɛ daa lam. Deenek, mam, mɛ àànakwaasɔ mot aazyɛ pɛ daa lam ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdus pɛ tɔ gwoo, sul kɔ bɔs étɛp ɛsa ɛkwosak ɛ lam. Tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ nadus pɛ tɔ gwoo, sul kɔ bɔs ɛ, étɛp ɛsa ɛkwosak ɛ Saagam mot nadhis mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Tinaak, ɛkwosak ɛ mot nadhis mɛ ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ náá, sa mɛ ààdiibal mot ngɔt, pak bot ɛ nyɛ nadjɛ mɛ ɔ. Ɛkwosak ɛ lɛ ɛ́ náá, mɛ gomal bot bhis ɛsyee é dwoo mɛsik. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Etɛɛ náá, ɛkwosak ɛ Saagam ɛ́ náá, mot nɛ mot aabee Mɔn, da bhii tak nyɛ ɛ́ dum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ, mot tak ɛ́ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm. Tin, mɛ waagomal nyɛ bhis ɛsyee ɛ lɛ é dwoo mɛsik.»<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Tin, ekukuma eYuda moo nyiiŋela pak'ɔɔ dum nɛ nɛ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naake náá: «Mapa nadus pɛ ɛko, sul kɔ bɔs ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ mam.» <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Tin, bɛ eebaazɛbil náá: «Mot'ak tok wak Yezu mɔn ɛ Zozɛf, mot mena di eguka sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg ɔ? Kɔ ɛsu ɛ yé nyɛ di eke nenak náá: mɛ nadus ɛ́ pɛ ɛko, sul kɔ bɔs?» <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Nànyiiŋelaka pak'en! <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Etɛɛ náá, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛzyɛ pɛ daa lam, yɛ di ààbɛ náá, Saagam mot nadhis mɛ ɔɔ, dhis nyɛ pɛ daa lam. Mɛ waagomal nyɛ bis ɛsyee ɛ lɛ é dwoo mɛsik. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Tɔ mɛkana mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Zɛɛb ɛ́ waalyo bɔɔ djas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.45 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zɛɛb ɛ́ waalyo bɔɔ djas. <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Eza 54.13</ref></char></char></note>.” Tinaak bot aagwak Sɛɛg, da bɛ ɛ́ myaal mɛlyo mɛ ɔɔ, bɛ ɛ́ waazyɛ pɛ daa lam. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Yɛ ààkwyɛl ɛlɛɛ náá, dhiiti mot eezebee Sɛɛg, yɛ di ààbɛ mot nadus pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɔɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet ɛ zebee Sɛɛg.<verse eid="JHN 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mot ɛ dum koŋ nɛ nam ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di mapa di edjɛ tsik ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Bɛsɛɛg bin naadɛ mapa nadus tɔ gwoo ɛ́ bɔɔ tɔ bal. Saabɛgɔs ɛ́ náá, bɛ naagwyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Tin, mot aadɛ mapa dus pɛ tɔ gwoo, sul kɔ bɔs ɔ, mot tak aanàkwaagwyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di mapa di edjɛ tsik nɛ bot ɛ, mapa di edus pɛ tɔ gwoo, sul kɔ bɔs ɛ. Mot ɛ dɛ mapa tak ɔ, nyɛ ɛpebela tsik na kɔm-kɔm. Tinaak, mapa mɛ aadjɛ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ epuud e nyel'am. Mɛ waadjɛ epuud e nyel'am étɛp ɛtsik ɛ bot ɛ bɔs.»<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Dáa bɛ nagwak deenek ɛ́, eYuda eezɛbe mɛso pak'ɔɔ ɛlyelɛpe. Bɛ nadi ekeke ɛ́ náá: «Mot'ak aasa dáa, étɛp nyɛ needjɛ mena nyel'ɛ, mena needɛka?» <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Gwakeka ɛnyɔɛpe sa mɛ di lɛɛ bin'aak. Bi ɛ di ààdɛ epuud e nyel nɛ ghiya ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɔɔ, bi tok nɛ tsik tɔ len. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Mot aadɛ epuud e nyel nɛ ghiya yam ɔ, mot tak ɛ́ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm. Tin, mɛ waagomal nyɛ bhis ɛsyee ɛ lɛ é dwoo mɛsik. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Etɛɛ náá, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, epuud e nyel ɛ́ mbɛɛ edee, da ghiya yam ɛ́ kadi, mbɛɛ mɛnyok. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Mot ɛ dɛ epuud e nyel'am, nɛ ghiya yam ɔɔ, bis nɛ yenɔk aakadi ɛ́, mot ngɔt. Nyɛy tɔ lam, mam tɔ lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ tsik ɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Saagam, mot nadhis mɛ ɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ di nɛ tsik. Tyee wat, mot aadɛ mɛ ɔ, nyɛ aadi nɛ tsik kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Beeka mapa dus pɛ ɛko, sul kɔ bɔs ɛ. Nyɛ tok dáa mapa nadus tɔ gwoo, yii bɛsɛɛg bin nadɛ ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bhii bɛ nadɛ yɛ ɛ, bɛ naagwyɛ. Yɛ kabɛ yak mapa ɔɔ, mot ɛ dɛ yɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛpebela tsik na kɔm-kɔm.» <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Etɛp binek djas naliiel ɛ́, tɔ mɛlyo mɛ Yezu nalyo bot tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda pɛ Kapɛlnaum ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel eezɛkaab Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Bhii bɛtɛ nɛ bɛdjekel nazegwak etɛp ee Yezu nadi elii ɛ, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛke náá: «Mɛlyo mɛ nɛ lyel. Nwyaa mot aakwaagwak yɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Dáa Yezu nyɛ ɛmet nagu náá, bɛdjekel bɛ nadi elii ɛbiyoɛpe dum nɛ mɛlyo mɛ nyɛ nalyo ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boodji bɛ náá: «Haaa etɛp yé, mɛlyo mam di ekpaa bin tɔ lyem? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Bha bi ɛ́ bee Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ebyet tɔ gwoo pɛ kyee nyɛ nadi sok ɛ, bi aasa dáa? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Yɛ ɛ́ Sisim Zɛɛb ɛ di edjɛ tsik. Epuud e mot ààval dhiiti sonok. Etɛp ee mɛ di elɛɛ bin ɛ́, yɛ ɛ́ etɛp e Sisim. Yɛ ɛ́ etɛp di edjɛ bot tsik ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Tin, pak'en, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ di ààdum koŋ nɛ nam ɔ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 6:64">Yezu nake deenek ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi egu bot aaboodi ààdum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ. Nyɛ nabaadi egu mot aakɛka nyɛ gha ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Nyɛ eebaazɛbil ɛkpa náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di elɛɛ bin náá: “Mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛzyɛ pɛ daa lam, Saagam ɛ di ààmyaal náá, nyɛ zyɛ ɔɔ.”»<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kana dwoo tak, bɛtɛ nɛ bɛdjekel zokazɛdus yɔbɔ. Bɛ eezɛkat ɛgyee nɛ Yezu lɔɔg. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Tin, Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá náá: «Haaa biyɔ, bi ààpatɔ́?» <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />É di'enek, Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Ghɛŋ, bis aatɔ́ paa? Wɔy ɛ́ di nɛ mɛkpa mɛ di edjɛ tsik na kɔm-kɔm ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Bisɔ, bis eedum koŋ nɛ nɔ. Tin, bis nɛ gu náá, wɔy ɛ di Mot na Dɛɛ Zɛɛb nadhis ɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />É di'enek, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ nasɛ́ɛ bin, biyɔ bot ɛ lɔɔg kam nɛ bɛbá. Deenek, mot ngɔt tɔ sama yen ɛ́ lyeeb.» <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Nyɛ nalii deenek ɛ́ nɛ Yudas, mɔn Simɔŋ Iskaliɔt. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛy ɛ́ kwaakɛka nyɛ gha. Ye nakoozodi náá, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ sama bɛdjekel kam nɛ bɛbá.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Bɔn-nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu eebyen ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛdjaad kɔ kyee dik Ghalile. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛl ɛgyee pɛ kyee dik Yude, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ dik eYuda nadi ekwyɛl ɛgó ɛ nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Ghuna mɛlu mɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ eYuda nadi edjóoaa ɛbyoŋ ɛ Epɛt<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɛbyoŋ ɛ Epɛt </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yɛ ɛ́ ɛbyoŋ ɛ eYuda nadi ededɛ si epɛt ee bɛ nadi esusum nɛ elɛɛ e ele ɛ.</char></note> ɛ, nabɛ ɛ́ yɛ eezekunaa. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Tin, bɔn-nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Dusa wak, da wɔ ɛ́ tɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Yude etɛɛ náá, bɛdjekel bɔ neebee mɛsa mɛ wɔ di esa ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Mot ɛ kwyɛl nyɛ neeguaa ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaasa mɛsa mɛ sɔ. Dáa ye di náá, wɔ ɛpesa eboo etɛp ɛ, wɔ goka ɛ́ wɔ lyaal nyel é mis mɛ bot ɛ bɔs.» <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Bɛ nadi elii deenek ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bɔn-nyɛɛg bɛ met nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi dum koŋ nɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yezu eebɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yam ɛwala dinaa ààpadjala, yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, mɛwala djas ɛ́, ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ nen. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Biyɔ, bot ɛ bɔs'ak tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbhina bin. Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, bot ɛpebhina mɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛpelɛɛ bot náá, mɛsa mɛ bɛ di esa ɛ, yɛ àànyɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Biyɔ, bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛtɔ́ kɛbɔl ɛbyoŋ. Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, é ɛwala ɛlak, mam aanàkwaatɔ́. Etɛɛ náá, tɛtɛ ɛwala mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛtɔ́ ɛ dinaa ààpakum.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Bhii nyɛ nazelii nɛ nɔɔ deenek ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛlik yɛ pɛ Ghalile.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Tin, dáa nabela náá, bɔn-nyɛɛg nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ eezetɔ́ pɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛtɔ́ yɛ pe pɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ tak tyee syaab, bot ààgu.<verse eid="JHN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu pɛ Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Tin, tɔ ɛbyoŋ, eYuda moo tin esaa nyɛ. Bɔɔ náá: «Nyɛ ɛ́ wo?» <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Tɔ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ nadi elii kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɔ. Bak bot náá: «Nyɛ ɛ́ mbɛɛ mot.» Bɛdhiiti náá: «Nyɛ ɛpeful bot elo nɛ mɛlyo mɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Tin, bot nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi elii kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ é mis mɛ bot, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ekaab ekukuma eYuda.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Dáa ɛbyoŋ nabɛ é moo kuku tak ɛ, Yezu eezɛtɔ́ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, é di'enek, nyɛ moo tin elyo bot. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Tin, eYuda moo djoka. Bɔɔ náá: «Nyɛ gu Ekwyala e Zɛɛb dáa, nyɛy ààbɛ náá, nyɛ naakɛdjek mɛdjek?» <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ye tok mam nakus mɛlyo mɛ mɛ di elyo'aak. Yɛ ɛ́ mot nadhis mɛ ɔ di nakuma tak. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Mot di nɛ lyem ɛsa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ waagu náá, mɛlyo mam ɛ́ yii Zɛɛb, nyɛ waabaagu nɛghu mɛlyo mɛ tak dus ɛ́ pɛ daa lam. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Mot ɛ di elii dum nɛ nyel'ɛ met ɔɔ, nyɛ saŋ ɛ́ duu étɛp nyel'ɛ met. Tin, mot di esaa duu mot nadhis nyɛ ɔ, yenɔk lɛɛ ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ, yenɔk mot tok nɛ etsal tɔ lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Moiiz nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛ bin etsi? Tin, ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt pak'en di ekɛ dáa etsi e tak di elɛɛ ɛ. Étɛp yé bi di ekwyɛl ɛgó ɛ mɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ zokazɛbɔɔza náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ nɛ mbee sisim tɔ lɔ! Ɛzɛ di esaŋ ɛgó ɛ wɔ?»<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ eesa ndem mɛbwala mɛ ngɔt wak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ biyɔ djas naadjoka. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Moiiz naadjɛ bin ze ɛniigal mengbaaz men beka. Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, ye tok náá, Moiiz ɛ́ nakus beka tak. Ye nadus ɛ́ pɛ daa bɛbhaab bin. Dɔɔ nɛ dwoo saba bi ɛpemyaal ɛniigal bot beka. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Bi sa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, etsi ɛ Moiiz ɛzɛkɛkat ɛduwalaa. Dwoo saba, bi ɛpeniigal mengbaaz men beka. Haaa étɛp yé bi di ebiyo nɛ nam etɛɛ náá, mɛ eetsik mot é dwoo saba? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Nàmwaapɛ́ɛka etɛp dáa biyɔ di ebee nɛ mis ɛ. Pɛ́ɛka dáa di egoka tɔ epiki ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, Yezu ɛ́ Mɛsia?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Bɛdhiiti bot pak bot ɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm moo tin eke náá: «Mot'ak tok mot ekukuma bis di esaŋ ɛgó ɛ nyɛ ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Beeka, nyɛ ɛpelii é mis mɛ bot djas, ààbɛ nɛ mot lyak nyɛ. Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, ekukuma bina eemyaal náá, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ Mɛsia? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Zobela náá, nwyak mot, bis nɛ gu pɛ nyɛ dus ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ, é ghɛŋ Mɛsia aazyɛ ɔ, ye tok mot aagu pɛ pak nyɛ aadus ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />É di'enek, dáa Yezu nadi elyo bot tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ, nyɛ naazɛben gwood, ke náá: «Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ bi nɛ gu mɛ, bi nɛ baagu pɛ kyee mɛ nadus ɛ. Tin guka náá, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ lam met. Tin, mot nadhis mɛ ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot etsɛɛtsɛ. Saabɛgɔs kabɛ ɛ́, bi ààgu nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Mɛ nɛ gu nyɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ nadus ɛ́ pɛ daa lɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ nadhis mɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Deenek, bot moo esaa mɛpek mɛ ɛmɛt ɛ Yezu. Tin, ye tok nɛ mot nàkomɛt nyɛ, etɛɛ náá, ɛwala ɛ nakoobelaa étɛp ɛmɛt ɛ nyɛ ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́, ye dinaa ààpakum. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Bot ɛbuɛpe tɔ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, naadyeebadum koŋ nɛ nɛ. Bɔɔ náá: «É ghɛŋ Mɛsia aazyɛ ɛ, nyɛ waasa eboo endem mɛbwala dhaa mot'ak é?»<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Wɔ gwaa, eFalizyɛ zokagwak dáa bot nadi elii pak'ɔɔ dum nɛ Yezu ɛ. Deenek, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ eFalizyɛ eezɛkyeed esodja di ebaal kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ, bɛ kɛmɛt nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ dinaa wak ɛ́ menabɛlka, ba bim bɔɔ mɛlu, bhii tak, da mɛ ɛ́ sik pɛ daa mot nadhis mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Bi ɛ́ waasaa mɛ, kabela ɛ́ náá, bi aanàkwaabela mɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛzyɛ pɛ pak mɛ aadi ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />É di'enek, ekukuma eYuda moo tin edjinel pak'ɔɔ náá: «Nyɛ aatɔ́ paa? Pɛ di náá, mena aanàkwaabela nyɛ ɛ? Nyɛ aatɔ́ ɛ́ pɛ daa bot ɛ mbyak eYuda di é di wat nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eGhɛlɛk, étɛp ɛ́ baakɛlyo bot ɛ yiizaag mbyak é? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ yé, mɛkpa mɛ nyɛ di eke náá: “Bi ɛ́ waasaa mɛ, kabela ɛ́ náá, bi aanàkwaabela mɛ. Bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee mɛ di tɔ́ ɛ?”»<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Dwoo mɛsik mɛ ɛbyoŋ, dwoo nabɛ nɛ boo mɛtaŋ ɛ, Yezu tetel, wɔ gwaa nyɛ zokabaazɛben gwood, etuud náá: «Mot ɛ di nɛ gwyes mɛdii ɔɔ, nyɛ zyɛ pɛ daa lam, nyɛ neezɛdɛ mɛdii. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Mot ɛ dum koŋ nɛ nam ɔɔ, “mɛdhii mɛ di edjɛ tsik ɛ waawyis tɔ lyem'ɛ, da yɛ ɛ́ wo”, dáa Ekwyala di elɛɛ ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.38 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mɛdhii mɛ di edjɛ tsik ɛ waawyis tɔ lyem'ɛ, da yɛ ɛ́ wo <char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Ɛze 47.1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zal 14.8</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yezu nadi eke deenek ɛ́, étɛp Sisim Zɛɛb. Bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Yezu ɔ waabela Sisim tak. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Sisim na Dɛɛ dinaa ààzyɛ. Etɛɛ náá, Yezu nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ dinaa ààpasik tɔ gwoo étɛp ɛbela duu.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛdhuu ɛ bot eesyaala kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Dáa mɛdhuu mɛ bot nadi egwak etɛp binek ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mot'ak ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb!» <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Bak bot náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ Mɛsia.» Bɛdhiiti kake ɛ́ tyee sis náá: «Mɛsia tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdus pɛ kyee dik Ghalile! <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Tinaak, mena dyeebalaaka tɔ Ekwyala e Mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb náá: “Mɛsia aadus ɛ́ tɔ bɔɔ bɛdha ɛ mɛkoozi Dhavid. Mɛsia aadus ɛ́ pɛ Bheteleɛm, dɛl ɛ Dhavid.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.42 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mɛsia aadus ɛ́ tɔ bɔɔ bɛdha ɛ mɛkoozi Dhavid. Mɛsia aadus ɛ́ pɛ Bheteleɛm, dɛl ɛ Dhavid. <char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">Sm2 7.12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:1">Mis 5.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:5">Mat 2.5</ref></char></char></note>”» <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Tin, kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ zyaala naani tɔ bot ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bɛdhiiti bot nadi ekwyɛl náá, bɛ mɛt nyɛ. Tin, ye tok nɛ mot namɛt nyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />É di'enek, bot ɛ di ebaal kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ, eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel, sik pɛ pak eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ eFalizyɛ nadi ɛ. Dáa bɛ nakakum ɛ, ekukuma eezɛdji bɛmbaalel náá: «Bi di ààzyɛ nɛ nɛ étɛp yé?» <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Bɛmbaalel binɔk eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Bis dinaa ààpabee mot di elii dáa mot yenɔk!» <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />EFalizyɛ eezɛbaalii nɛ bot binɔk náá: «Bis bee ɛ́ náá, biyɔ pe, bi eezemyaal mɛkɔŋ mɛ! <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti kukuma, nɛghu dhiiti Falizyɛ, di edum koŋ nɛ nɛ? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Etɛɛ náá, mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ di ààgu etsi ɛ Moiiz ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ zelekaa ɛbiyoɛpe ɔ!»<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodhɛm, mot nazyɛ ɛsok zɛbela Yezu é pum ɔ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ sama eFalizyɛ. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ bɛsɔ náá: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />«Etsi bina lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, mot ɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛmɛtaa, bot dinaa ààgwak taŋal'ɛ, bot dinaa ààgu, sa mot tak di esa ɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Tin, bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔy pe, wɔ ɛ́ mot Ghalile? Laŋa Ekwyala ɛnyɔɛpe. Wɔ aabee náá, Ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtuula, da dus pɛ Ghalile.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:52">[ <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Bhii tak, mot nɛ mot eezɛsik pɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Moma mɛzɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Yezu eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ɛtsok pyeeb oliv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pyeeb oliv </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yɛ ɛ́ pyeeb ele di djɛ bhum di djóoaa «oliv» ɛ.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Kɛɛŋ tɔ mɛlem, nyɛ eebaazɛsik pɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Tin, bot ɛbuɛpe eezɛzyɛ pɛ daa lɛ. Nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, disi, nyɛ moo tin elyo bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />É di'enek, bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, nɛ eFalizyɛ eezɛzyɛ nyɛ nɛ dhiiti moma ngɔt namɛtaa esa ɛzɔ ɔ. Bɛ eezɛnɛɛg nyɛ kuku ɛbwak, <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />bɛ eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel, bis mɛt moma yak ɛ́, nyɛy esa ɛzɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Tɔ etsi ɛ Moiiz, ye lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, ye goka ɛ́ náá, moma yak góaa nɛ mɛkok<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tɔ etsi ɛ Moiiz, ye lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, ye goka ɛ́ náá, moma yak góaa nɛ mɛkok <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Msa 20.10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Dɛt 22.22-24</ref></char></char></note>. Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔɔ, wɔ ke náá, bɛ sa moma yak dáa?»<verse eid="JHN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Bɛ nadi eke deenek ɛ́, étɛp ɛlóo ɛ́ nyɛ pɛ ɛko, da bwood nyɛ pɛ kyɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bhii tak bɛ neekɛpit nyɛ. É di'enek, Yezu eezɛsil mis si, nyɛ moo ekwyal é bɔs nɛ djin. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Dáa bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, nɛ eFalizyɛ nadi ebelal nyɛ nɛ mɛdjin ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ booben lo, gwyák bɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Pak biyɔ djas di tin yenek, mot di náá, nyɛ dinaa ààpasa mesyem ɔ, nyɛ di mot mɛkɛn e ɛwus moma yak ɛkok!» <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Bhii tak nyɛ eebaazɛmalal, tin nyɛ eebaakan ɛkwyal é bɔs. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Dáa bɛ nagwak deenek ɛ́, tin kili, mot nɛ mot naazɛliig mis, sik, kan nɛ eboo bot, zɛnɔɔ mengbaaz nɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb. Bhii tak, Yezu nazokalik ɛ́ bɔɔ bɛbá, bɛ nɛ moma nadi tetel sok bhwoob'ɛ ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛben lo bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ moma tak náá: «Wɛn moma, bot ɛ zɛpit wɔ ɔ moo wo? Tɔ sama yɔɔ, ye tok nɛ mot kwyesal wɔ ndjɛ sɔs é?» <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Moma tak eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Ààbɛ, Ghɛŋ! Mot ààpakwyesal mɛ ndjɛ sɔs.» Deenek Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ mam pe, mɛ ààpakwyesal wɔ ndjɛ sɔs. Tɔ́a yɔ, sa wɔ ààbaasa mesyem.»]<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ɛ́ gwyɛ ngel bot ɛ bɔs djas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Bhii tak, Yezu eebaazɛlii nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di gwyɛ ngel bot ɛ bɔs djas. Mot aadu mɛ ɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaabaakɛ tɔ ghooghom. Nyɛ waabela gwyɛ ngel di edjɛ tsik ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />EFalizyɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ lɛɛ etɛp e nyel'ɔ wɔy wɔ ɛmet ɔɔ, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, etɛp ee wɔ di elɛɛ ɛ, ye tok nɛ ghwyil ɛmyaalaa.» <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ kobɛ náá, mɛ ɛpelɛɛ etɛp e nyel'am mam ɛmet ɔɔ, etɛp mɛ di elɛɛ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nɛ gu pɛ pak mɛ dus ɛ, nɛ pɛ pak mɛ di etɔ́ ɛ. Deenek, biyɔ, bi ààgu pɛ pak mɛ nadus ɛ, nɛ pɛ pak mɛ di etɔ́ ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Bi pɛ́ɛ mɛ ɛ́ nɛ etsoŋ ee bi di epɛ́ɛ bot ɛ bɔs ɛ. Mam ààpɛ́ɛ bot. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Guka náá, mam ɛ pɛ́ɛ bot ɔɔ, epɛ́ɛ bam aadi ɛ́, tɛtɛ epɛ́ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, tɔ epɛ́ɛ bam, mɛ tok mam mɛ ɛmet. Mɛ pɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, bis nɛ Saagam, mot nadhis mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Tɔ etsi bin, yɛ ɛ́ kwyala náá, bot ɛbá ɛ di ekaada tɛp tyee wat ɔɔ, tɛp tak ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tɔ etsi bin, yɛ ɛ́ kwyala náá, bot ɛbá ɛ di ekaada tɛp tyee wat ɔɔ, tɛp tak ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ. <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Dɛt 17.6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19.15</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 35:30">Ɛla 35.30</ref></char></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam nakuma nyel ɛ di elɛɛ bin etɛp bam. Dɔɔ nɛ Saagam, mot nadhis mɛ ɔ, nyɛ ɛpebaalɛɛ etɛp bam.» <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Tin, wɔ gwaa eFalizyɛ zɛdji nyɛ náá: «Soog ɛ́ wo?» Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Bi ààgu mɛ. Bi ààbaagu pe Saagam. Bi ɛpedi ɛ́ di egu mɛ ɔɔ, pe bi nɛ gu pe Saagam.»<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yezu nadi edjɛ bot mɛlyo deenek ɛ́, nyɛy tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ é ngwoob ɛbɔɔl ɛ bot nawewa epata e ɛkɛɛ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Tin, Yezu nabɛ ààmɛtaa etɛɛ náá, ɛwala nabɛ náá, nyɛ aamɛtaa ɛ, nabɛ ɛ́ ye dinaa ààkum.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eelɛɛ bot náá, nyɛ waasik pɛ daa Sɛɛg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yezu eebaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ waatɔ́, bi ɛ́ waasaa mɛ. Tin, bi ɛ́ waagwyɛ tɔ esyem bin. Bi aanàkum pɛ pak mɛ aatɔ́ ɛ́.» <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Tin, ekukuma eYuda eezɛdjinel pak'ɔɔ náá: «Nyɛ aatɔ́ bilak ɛ́, kɛyeeda, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ke ɛ́ náá: “Bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtɔ́ pɛ pak mam aatɔ́ ɛ́”.» <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ, bi ɛ́ bot ɛ si, mam ɛ́ mot ɛko. Bi ɛ́ bot ɛ bɔs'ak, mam tok mot bɔs'ak. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Etɛp tak ɛ́ mɛ ke nɛ nen náá, bi aagwyɛ tɔ mesyem men. Bi ɛ di ààmyaal náá, yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di mot mɛ di elɛɛ náá, “yɛ ɛ́ mam ɔɔ”, tsɛɛtsɛ bi ɛ́ waagwyɛ tɔ mesyem men.» <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />EFalizyɛ zokabaazɛdji Yezu náá: «Wɔy ɛ́ yɔ zɛ?» Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Mɛ ɛ́ mot mɛ nanyɛl ɛlɛɛ bin é mɛkɛn mɛ mɛlyo mam ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ etɛp kɔ ɛsu ɛ len, nɛ yii ɛpɛ́ɛ bin. Tin, mot nalwom mɛ ɔ lɛɛ ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ, etɛp ee mɛ nadjek pɛ daa lɛ ɔ, mɛ ɛpegoola yɛ nɛ bot kɔ bɔs.»<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />É ghɛŋ nyɛ nadi elii deenek ɛ́, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààsiiza náá, nyɛ nadi elii ɛ́, dum nɛ Sɛɛg. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «É sok bi aakan ɛben Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ, é di'enek ɛ bi aagwyak náá, mam ɛ́ di mot mɛ di elɛɛ náá, “mam ɛ́ mot di ɔ”. Bi ɛ́ waagu náá, mam ààsa esonok nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ lyem'am. Mɛ lɛɛ ɛ́ etɛp ee Saagam nalyo mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Mot nalwom mɛ ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ lɔɔg wat bis nɛ nɛ. Nyɛ ààpabet mɛ mam ɛmet, etɛɛ náá, mɛ dyeebasa ɛ́, esa ee lyem'ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Dáa Yezu nadi elii deenek ɛ́, bot ɛbuɛpe naadum koŋ nɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tɛtɛ bɔn Abalaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ eYuda nadum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ náá: «Bi ɛ kɛ tɔ esosoob dáa mɛkpa mam di ekwyɛl ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ bɛdjekel bam nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, bi ɛ́ waagu etsɛɛtsɛ, bhii tak, etsɛɛtsɛ waapɛk bin tɔ ekwom.» <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Bis ɛ́ bɔn bɛdha ɛ Abalaam, bis dinaa ààpakodi ekwom e mot dhiiti dwoo. Étɛp yé wɔ di eke náá: “Bi ɛ́ waapɛkaa tɔ ekwom”?» <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá, «Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, bot djas di esa mesyem ɔ, bɛ ɛ́ ekwom e mesyem. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Deenek, mot di kwom ɔ, tok nɛ ghwyil ɛliiza mot mɛbyel na kɔm-kɔm. Tin, mɔn di mot mɛbyel ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot mɛbyel na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />É di'enek, yɛ bɛ náá, mɔn eepɛk wɔ tɔ ekwom ɔɔ, wɔ moo ɛ́ pɛka nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ.<verse eid="JHN 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Mɛ nɛ gu náá, bi ɛ́ bɔɔ bɛdha ɛ Abalaam. Haaa étɛp yé bi di esaŋ ɛgó ɛ mɛ? Yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bi ààmyaal etɛp ee mɛ di elɛɛ bin ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Mam lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp ee mɛ nabee pɛ daa Saagam ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, bi sa ɛ́ etɛp sɛɛg'en nalɛɛ bin ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ baazɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu: «Yesɔ sɛɛg ɛ́ Abalaam.» Deenek, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛpedi ɛ́ bɔn ɛ Abalaam nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ ɔɔ, pe bi sa etɛp ɛ dáa nyɛy. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Mɛ eelɛɛ bin etsɛɛtsɛ ee Zɛɛb nalyaal mɛ ɛ. Tin, bi kakwyɛl ɛ́ ɛgó ɛ mɛ. Abalaam nabɛ ɛ́ ààsa deenek. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Biyɔ, bi sa ɛ́ mɛsa mɛ wat bi nɛ sɛɛg'en.» Bɛ eezɛbaayala nɛ Yezu náá: «Bis tok bɔn mbel, bis ɛ́ bɔn du etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛg'es ɛ́ Zɛɛb nyɛ ɛmet.» <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yezu eebaazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Zɛɛb ɛpedi Sɛɛg'en ɔɔ, pe bi ɛpekwyɛl mɛ. Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ nadhis mɛ. Mɛ di wak ɛ́ é di ɛ Zɛɛb. Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ kɔ ɛkwosak ɛ lam. Yɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ nadhis mɛ.<verse eid="JHN 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Étɛp yé bi di ààmɛt etɛp ee mɛ di elɛɛ bin ɛ? Yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛgwak mɛkpa mam. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Deenek sɛɛg'en ɛ́ dim mot mɛkɔŋ. Tin, bi dyeebasa ɛ́, mɛsa mɛ sɛɛg'en di ekwyɛl ɛ. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, mot ɛgó ɛ bot, kana bɔs nakusaa ɛ. Nyɛ dinaa ààpakokɛ tɔ etsɛɛtsɛ etɛɛ náá, etsɛɛtsɛ tok tɔ lɛ. É sok nyɛ di, nyɛ moo elɛɛ elɛŋ etsal ɛ, nyɛ lɛɛ yɛ ɛ́ nɛ lyem wat. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot etsal, nyɛ ɛ́ sɛɛg mɛkɔŋ. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Tin, yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, mɛ dyeebalɛɛ ɛ́ etɛp ee di tsɛɛtsɛ ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ bi di ààmyaal mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Tɔ lɔɔg'en, ɛzɛ aaben djin náá, mɛ eesa mesyem? Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛ eelɛɛ etɛp ee di náá, yɛ ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ ɔɔ, étɛp yé bi di ààmyaal mɛ? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Mot di mot Zɛɛb ɔ, nɛ gwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, dáa bi di ààgwak mɛkpa mam ɛ, ye lyaal ɛ́ náá, bi tok bot ɛ nadus pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abalaam bɛ nɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Tinaak eYuda zokazɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Bis ɛ́ nɛ gham nɛ ɛke ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ mot kyee dik Samaali, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ mbee sisim tɔ lɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ààbɛ! Mɛ tok nɛ mbee sisim tɔ lam. Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ ɛdjɛ duu nɛ Saagam. Kabela ɛ́ náá, biyɔ, bi ààkwyɛl ɛdjɛ mɛ duu. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Mam ààsaa duu kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam met. Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mot ngɔt di esaa duu'am ɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ di epɛ́ɛ bot tɔ epiki. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Tsɛɛtsɛ mɛ lɛɛ bin etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ ɛ́ náá, mot di ekɛ dáa mɛkpa mam di elɛɛ ɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaagwyɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />EYuda eebaazɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Tin, bis eemyaal tsɛɛtsɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mbee sisim ɛ di edhek wɔ! Etɛɛ náá, Abalaam naazegwyɛ. Bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb naabaazegwyɛ yɔbɔ pe. Bɔɔ djas naazegwyɛ, wɔ kabaake ɛ́ náá: “Mot di ekɛ dáa mɛkpa mam di elɛɛ ɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaagwyɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Abalaam, sɛɛg'es, naazegwyɛ. Wɔ kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ boo-mot nɛ nɛ? Bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb naabaazegwyɛ yɔbɔ. Wɔ gek náá, wɔ ɛ́ zɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛ duwal nyel'am ɛ́ mam ɛmet ɔɔ, yenek duu tak ààval sonok wat. Mot di edjɛ mɛ duu ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ Saagam. Bi dyeebake kɔ ɛsu ɛ́ lɛ náá: “Nyɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb'es”. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Ghuna bi ààgu nyɛ. Tin, bela náá, mam nɛ gu nyɛ. Mɛ pe di ɛ́ ke náá: “Mɛ ààgu nyɛ” ɔɔ, pe mɛ ɛ́ mot etsal dáa biyɔ. Tin, ye tok deenek, etɛɛ náá, mam nɛ gu nyɛ, mɛ nɛ looba nɛ mɛkpa mɛ nyɛ di elyo ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Abalaam sɛɛg'en naamyaala, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi ebwood dwoo ɛzyɛ ɛ lam. Nyɛ naabee yɛ, bhii tak, lyem'ɛ naadyeebamyaala ɛbuɛpe.» <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Tin, eYuda eebaazɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Wɔ dinaa ààpakokum-kumak membu mɛkam-mɛtɛn. Wɔ lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, wɔ naabee Abalaam é?» <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Iyooo, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, ɛsok nɛ Abalaam nɛ byel, “mam ɛ́ mot di ɔ”.» <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />É di'enek, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛtek mɛkok etɛp ɛwus ɛ́ Yezu. Nyɛ eezɛsɔwa, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛwyis tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik dhiiti mot edhim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Dáa nyɛ nadi etɔ́ gba-gba ɛ, Yezu eezɛbee mot ngɔt nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ edhim mbyela mɔ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛdji nyɛ náá: «Labhi, haaa étɛp yé mot'ak nabyel nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ edhim? Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp mesyem mɛ met ohoo, nɛghu etɛɛ náá, sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg naasyem?» <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Ye tok tɛp mesyem mɛ met, nɛghu yii sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg. Nyɛ bɛ́ edhim ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, mɛsa mɛ mɛbwala mɛ Zɛɛb neewyis kel kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />É sok di náá, ye dinaa é mwos dwoo ɛ, ye goka ɛ́ mena saka mɛsa mɛ mot nadhis mɛ ɔ. Pum moo ɛ́ ɛkunaaɛpe, é sok yɛ aadi náá, mot aanàkwaabaakwak ɛsa mɛsa ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />É sok mɛ di, mɛ dinaa kɔ bɔs'ak ɛ, mɛ ɛ́ gwyɛ ngel kɔ bɔs.»<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Bhii nyɛ nazelii deenek ɛ́, Yezu eezɛsɛɛ mɛtel é bɔs. Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛpul bɔs nɛ yɛ, nɔɔ bhɔtɔ tak, zɛlɔɔb é mis mɛ mot edhim yenɔk. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Tɔ́a kɛgwyii mis pɛ tok mɛdii mɛ Silowe.» Ɛkpa ɛ Silowe kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ «Mot-lwoma». Tin, mot edhim yenɔk eezɛnɔɔ nyel, tɔ́, kɛgwyii mis. Dáa nyɛ nabula ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ moo ebee ɛnyɔɛpe.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Bot ɛ di é mengwoob ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ nadi ebee dáa nyɛ nadi sok ebɔɔ esa nɛ bot ɛ, bot ɛ tak eezɛni edjinel pak'ɔɔ náá: «Ye tok mot nadidi ndiindel é ngwoob gba ebɔɔ esa nɛ bot'aak é?» <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Tin, bak bot náá: «Hɛɛɛ, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy.» Yak kyee bot náá: «Ààbɛ! Ye tok nyɛy. Bɛ nɔŋel ɛ́ nɔŋelak.» Tin, mot'enɔk eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mam.» <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Bɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Haaa mis mɔ kabɛŋel dáa?» <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Mot'enɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mot di edjóoaa Yezu yenɔk ɛ́ sɛɛ mɛtel é bɔs. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ bhɔtɔ tak, lɔɔb mɛ yɛ é mis. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nam náá: “Tɔ́a, kɛgwyii mis pɛ tɔ tok mɛdii mɛ Silowe.” É di'enek, mɛ eezɛtɔ́ kɛgwyii mis. Tin, mɛ moo ebee ɛnyɔɛpe!» <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Bɛ eebaazɛdji nyɛ náá: «Mot tak moo wo?» Tin, nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Mam ààgu.»<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">EFalizyɛ eedji mot edhim natsak ɔ mɛdjin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Tin, bɛ eezɛzyɛ nɛ mot nadi sok nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ edhim ɔ, pɛ daa eFalizyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Ghuna, Yezu nasa bhɔtɔ, da bɛɛ nyɛ mis nɛ yɛ ɛ dwoo saba. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ eFalizyɛ pɛ yɔbɔ kyee nabaadji nyɛ dum nɛ sa nasael étɛp mis mɛ neebɛŋel ɛ. Deenek, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Nyɛ eelɔɔb mɛ bhɔtɔ é mis. Bhii tak, mɛ eetɔ́, kɛgwyii mis. Tin, mɛ moo nenak ɛ́, ebee ɛnyɔɛpe.» <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Bɛdhiiti bot pak eFalizyɛ moo tin eke pak'ɔɔ náá: «Mot sa kwaambi etɛp dáak ɔ tok lwoma ɛ Zɛɛb. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ààduwal etsi e Zɛɛb dum nɛ dwoo saba.» Yak kyee bot pak'ɔɔ náá: «Mot mesyem tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsa endem e mɛbwala mak.» Deenek, eFalizyɛ moo ɛ́, bɛ eezesyaala pak'ɔɔ dum nɛ tɛp tak. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Wɔ gwaa, eFalizyɛ tak baazɛdji mot edhim natsak ɔ náá: «Mba wɔy wɔ ɛmet, wɔ ke dáa dum nɛ mot bɛɛ wɔ mis ɔ?» É di'enek, nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Nyɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Bela tin náá, ekukuma eYuda nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛl ɛmyaal náá, nyɛ nadi sok ɛ́, nɛ edhim, mos nyɛ moo enyaasok. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ bɛ nabaadal sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg mot tak náá, bɛ zyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Bɛ eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, nwyak ɛ́ mɔn'en é? Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, nyɛ byel ɛ́ nɛ ɛbɛ́ edhim é? Ye sa dáa, etɛɛ náá, nenak, mis mɛ nyaasok?» <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Bis eegwyak náá, yɛ ɛ́ mɔn'es. Nyɛ nabyel ɛ́ nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ edhim. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Nenak nyɛ moo bee ɛnyɔɛpe. Tin, dáa nyɛ tsak ɛ, mot tsik nyɛ ɔ, di náá, bis ààgu yesɔ. Djika nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ moo ɛ́ nɛ membu mɛ di náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛlɛɛ bin nyɛ ɛmet dáa ye sael ɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg nalii deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ekaab ekukuma eYuda. Etɛɛ náá, eYuda nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ eezeke náá, mot aake náá, Yezu ɛ́ Mɛsia ɔ, mot tak ɛ́ waasɔaa tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg nake náá: «Nyɛ moo ɛ́ nɛ membu di náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛlɛɛ bin nyɛ ɛmet dáa ye sael ɛ. Djika nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet!»<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Wɔ gwaa, eFalizyɛ zokabaadjóo mot edhim natsak ɔ, djóoa sis. Bɛ eebaazɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Lɛɛa bis nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ é mis ɛ Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, bis nɛ gu náá, mot yenɔk ɛ́ mot mesyem.» <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mam ààgu yam, nɛghu nyɛ ɛ́ mot mesyem. Mam gu ɛ́ sa wat náá, mɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ edhim nenak, mɛ moo ebee ɛnyɔɛpe.» <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />EFalizyɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Nyɛ sa wɔ yé? Nyɛ tsik mis mɔ dáa?» <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Mot yenɔk eebaazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ eezelɛɛ bin, bi ààkwyɛl ɛgwak. Étɛp yé bi di ekwyɛl náá, mɛ baabasal bin yɛ esok ebá? Bi kwyɛl bilak ɛ́ náá, biyɔ pe bi di bɛdjekel bɛ?»<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Tin, bɛ eezɛlee nyɛ, bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ di djekel mot tak! Bisɔ ɛ́ bɛdjekel ɛ Moiiz. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Bisɔ nɛ gu náá, Zɛɛb naalii nɛ Moiiz. Yɛ kabɛ nyɛy ɔ, bis ààgu nyɛ, ààbaagu pe pɛ kyee nyɛ nadus ɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Mot edhim natsikaa ɔ, zokabaake nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Beeka, sa mɛ di edjoka ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ yenek: Bi ààbaagu pɛ kyee nyɛ nadus ɛ, dhi biyɔ ebee náá, nyɛ eebɛɛ mɛ mis! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Bela náá, mena nɛ guka náá, Zɛɛb ààgwak bot ɛ mesyem. Nyɛ dyeebagwak ɛ́ bot ɛ di eduwal nyɛ nɛ ɛsa ɛkwosak ɛ lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Bot dinaa ààpagwak sok náá, dhiiti mot ɛpetsik mis mɛ mot nabyel nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ edhim ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Mot'ak ɛpedi ɛ́ ààdus pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɔɔ, pe nyɛ aanàkwaasa etɛp e mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ di esa'aak.» <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />EFalizyɛ eezɛke nɛ mot yenɔk náá: «Kana dwoo mɛbyel mɔ, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo pan mos'ak, wɔ ɛ́ tɔp tɔ mesyem, da mbi mot dáa wɔy ɛ́ zɛlyo bis é?» Bhii nyɛ nake deenek ɛ́, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛsɔ nyɛ tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edhim e sisim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Dáa Yezu nagwak náá, eFalizyɛ naasɔ mot yenɔk tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛboma nɛ nɛ. Nyɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ nɛ dum koŋ nɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot é?» <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Tin, mot yenɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Lɛɛa mɛ, Ghɛŋ, yɛ ɛ́ ɛzɛ, étɛp mɛ needum koŋ nɛ nɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá, «Wɔ ɛpebee nyɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛy ɛ di sok bhwoob'ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ di elii nɛ nɔ nenak'aak.» <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Tin, mot yenɔk eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Ghɛŋ, mɛ eedum koŋ nɛ nɔ!» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si sok bhwoob ɛ Yezu, étɛp ɛduwal nyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yezu eezɛbil ɛkpa náá: «Mɛ nazyɛ kɔ bɔs'ak ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bot neezɛpɛ́ɛaa, étɛp mis mɛ bot ɛ edhim neebɛŋel, tin, bot ɛ nadi enyaasok ɔ, neebela edhim.» <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Bɛdhiiti eFalizyɛ nadi é bhaaz'ɛ ɔ, naagwak dáa nyɛ nalii deenek ɛ́. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛdji nyɛ náá: «Bot ɛ edhim tak ɛ́, dɔɔ nɛ bisɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛpedi ɛ́ bot ɛ edhim ɔɔ, pe bi ààpasa mesyem. Tin, dáa bi di eke náá: “Bis ɛpebee” ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ bi di tɔ ndjɛ sɔs dáa bot ɛ mesyem.»<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Kana mbɛɛ mbaalel mɛsaa mɛ ebhata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yezu eezɛke náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mot ɛ di ààni tɔ beeba ebhata pɛ ɛniel ɔɔ, nyɛ tsel peeb tselak é dhiiti di ɔɔ, yenɔk mot ɛ mot djii, nyɛ ɛ́ mot ɛzɛm. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Deenek, mot di eni pɛ ɛbɛ ɛ beeba ebhata ɔ, nyɛy ɛ́ di mbaalel ebhata. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />É di'enek, mbaalel beeba ebhata ɛ́ waadii nyɛ ɛbɛ ɛ beeba. Deenek, ebhata ɛ́ waagwak gwood'ɛ, nyɛ kadjóo bɛ ɛ́, ngɔt-ngɔt nɛ min mɔɔ. Bhii tak, nyɛ ɛ́ wyisal bɛ pɛ kel. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Bhii nyɛ aazewyisal bɔɔ djas pɛ kel ɛ, nyɛ kakɛ ɛ́ pɛ sok, ebhata edu nyɛ pɛ bhis, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nɛ gu gwood'ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Tin, ebhata tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdu ndjoŋ mot. Deenek, bɛ waakaab nyɛ, tɔ́ ɛtsetaɛpe, etɛɛ náá, bɛ ààgu gwood'ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />É sok Yezu di elɛɛ bɛ kana yenek ɛ, bot ɛ nadi egwak nyɛ ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́ àànyɔ ɛmɛt ɛsuk ɛ kana tak.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu, mbɛɛ mbaalel ɛsaa ɛ ebhata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yezu eebaazɛke náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di ɛbɛ ɛ ɛniel beeba ebhata. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Bot djas nazyɛ ɛsok nɛ nam ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ djii, bot ɛ ɛzɛm. Deenek, ebhata nabɛ ɛ́ ààgwak bɛ.<figure style="fig" alt="Le bon berger" file="WA03830b.tif" size="col" loc="10.8" copy="Graham Wade" ref="10.8">Mbɛɛ mbaalel mɛsaa</figure><verse eid="JHN 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa. Mot aadhaa pɛ daa lam etɛp nyɛ neeni ɔ, nyɛ waabela tsik. Nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛni nɛ ɛwyis dáa nyɛ kwyɛl ɛ. Nyɛ waabela edee e dek. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Etɛɛ náá, mot djii zyɛ ɛ́ étɛp ɛzɛdjii, nɛ ɛzɛgó, nɛ ɛzɛsaab. Mam nazyɛ ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bot neebela tsik, bɛ neebela esa djas di egoka nɛ nɔɔ étɛp bɛ needi tɔ mbɛɛ tsik ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di mbɛɛ mbaalel ebhata, mbɛɛ mbaalel ka tsik'ɛ gha ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ebhata bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Mot di ebaal ebhata, étɛp nyɛ neetuudaa nɛ epata ɔ, nyɛ tok mbaalel ebhata nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, etɛɛ náá, ebhata tok bɛ. Nyɛ bee eben ezyɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdhuugal ɛsaŋ ɛ ebhata, da nyɛ ɛ́ kpaa nɛ kaab. É di'enek, eben ɛ́ waaghaaga ɛsaa ebhata binɔk é nyel, nɔɔ bɛ, dɛ bɛ nɛ ɛtwak ɛ bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Beeka, ye sael deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, mot tak sa mɛsa ɛ, etɛp nyɛ neetuudaa. Nyɛ ààbem ba nɛ tɛp ebhata.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di mbɛɛ mbaalel ebhata. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nɛ gu ebhata bam, ebhata bam pe nɛ gu mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Tyee wat nɛ dáa Saagam di egu mɛ ɛ, mam pe nɛ gu Saagam. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ mɛ di eka tsik'am gha kɔ ɛsu ɛ ebhata bam. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ edhiiti ebhata di náá, bɛ dinaa ààpani tɔ beeba ɛ. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, mɛ kɛnɔɔ bɛ, etɛp ɛdjɛɛd ɛ́ bɛ. Bɛ waagwak gwood'am. Bhii tak bɛ waazyɛ bɔɔ bɛmet zɛsɛɛga nɛ bɔɔ bɛsɔ bɔɔ, si mɛko mɛ mbaalel ngɔt.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Saagam dyeebakwyɛl mɛ ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, mɛ nɛ ka tsik'am gha, bhii tak da mɛ ɛ́ baanɔɔ yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛnɔɔ tsik'am. Yɛ ɛ́ mam mɛ ɛmet ɛ di eka yɛ nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ lyem'am. Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ yɛ, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbaanɔɔ yɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ ɛtiŋ ɛ Saagam nadjɛ mɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Mɛkpa menek ɛ́ nabaazɛwa mɛbɛka ɛlyelɛpe pak eYuda. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Kyee wat eYuda náá: «Mot'ak ɛ́ nɛ mbee sisim tɔ lɛ! Nyɛ ɛ́ mot mɛlyet! Étɛp yé bi di egwak etɛp bɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Yak kyee náá: «Mot di nɛ embee esisim tɔ lɛ ɔ, tok nɛ ghwyil ɛlii dáa nyɛ di elii'aak. Embee sisim ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛtsik mot edhim nyɛ nyaasok é?»<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">EYuda eeswonal Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, é mbu kwol, pɛ Yeluzalɛm bɛ nadi ebɔl ɛbyoŋ ɛ bɛ nadi etaala dwoo Ndjaa-ebuwa nadiiaa ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yezu nadi eduula si mɛbhaaz mɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa nagetaa din «bhaaz ɛ Salomɔŋ» ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Tin, wɔ gwaa eYuda zɛsɛɛga é ngwoob'ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bis di é bhwood kɛkum yaa ɛwala? Nɛghu wɔ ɛ́ Mɛsia ɔɔ, lɛɛa bis ɛnyɔɛpe, étɛp bis neegwak.» <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́, mɛ eezelɛɛ bin, bi ààkwyɛl ɛmyaal ɛ mɛ. Sonok esa e mɛbwala mɛ mɛ di esa nɛ din ɛ Saagam ɛ, yɛ ɛpetaŋal é di yam. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Tin, bi di ààmyaal mɛ ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bi tok tɔ ɛsaa ɛ ebhata bam. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ɛsaŋ ɛ ebhata bam nɛ gwak gwood'am, mɛ nɛ gu bɛ, bɛ nɛ du mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Mɛ ɛpedjɛ bɛ tsik na kɔm-kɔm, bɛ aanàkwaadiib dhiiti dwoo. Mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdɛk mɛ bak. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Sa Saagam nadjɛ mɛ ɛ, eedhaa esonok djas. Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, dhiiti mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdɛk sa tak tɔ mbɔ Saagam. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Mam nɛ Saagam, bis ɛ́ mot ngɔt.»<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Tin, wɔ gwaa eYuda baazɛtek mɛkok, étɛp bɛ neegó nyɛ nɛ yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ eedyeebazelyaal bin embɛɛ mɛsa mɛ Saagam. Tɔ mɛsa menek djas, kɔ esu ɛ yaa mɛsa, bi di ekwyɛl ɛgó ɛ́ mɛ nɛ mɛkok?» <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Tin, eYuda eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bis ààsaŋ ɛgó ɛ́ wɔ nɛ mɛkok étɛp embɛɛ mɛsa. Bis saŋ ɛgó ɛ́ wɔ etɛɛ náá, wɔ ɛpebyasal Zɛɛb! Dhi wɔ di mot, wɔ kwyɛl ɛlyaal bot ɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Zɛɛb!» <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ etsi bin, Ekwyala ke náá: “Mɛ ke ɛ́ náá, bi ɛ́ bɛzɛɛb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.34 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Mɛd 82.6</ref></char></char></note>.” <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Mena nɛ guka náá, mena tokeka nɛ ghwyil ɛdis sa Ekwyala di elɛɛ ɛ. Deenek, Zɛɛb djóo bot ɛ di egwak mɛkpa mɛ ɔ, “bɛzɛɛb”. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, Saagam naazetɔ mɛ, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛlwom mɛ kɔ bɔs. Étɛp yé bi di eke náá, mɛ eelee Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, mɛ eelɛɛ náá: “Mɛ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb” é? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛsa mɛ mɛ di esa ɛ, tok mɛsa mɛ Saagam ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bi aadi ààdum koŋ nɛ nam. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Tin, mɛ kosa mɛsa mɛ Saagam ɔɔ, bi aanàdum koŋ nɛ nam. Dumka koŋ dum nɛ endem e mɛbwala mɛ mɛ di esa ɛ. Étɛp bi neegu gua wat náá, Saagam ɛ́ tɔ lam, deenek mam ɛ́ tɔ Saagam.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Deenek, bɛ nabaadi ɛ́, esaa dáa bɛ mɛt nyɛ. Tin, nyɛ naadus bɛ é mɛmbɔ.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Bhii tak, Yezu eebaazɛtɔ́ pɛ yii kyiid dii Yuldɛn, é di Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nadi eduu bot Zɛɛb sok ɔ. Nyɛ eekɛdi ba mɛlu penek. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Tin, wɔ gwaa mɛdhuu mɛ bot zokazyɛ pɛ nyɛ nadi ɛ́. Bot ɛ tak eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Zaŋ nabɛ ɛ́ ààsa dhiiti ndem mɛbwala mɛ wat. Beeka náá, etɛp djas nyɛ nadi elɛɛ dum nɛ mot tak ɛ, djas ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />É di'enek, bot ɛbuɛpe naazɛdum koŋ nɛ Yezu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛsyee ɛ Lazaad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Dhiiti mot ngɔt din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Lazaad, nyɛy zokazɛbɛ́, nyɛ nadidi ɛ́ kɔ ghaada di edjóoaa Bhetani ɛ, dɛl ɛ Maali bɛ nɛ mɔn-nyɛɛg Maat. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Maali ɛ́ moma naso ɛlas ɛ mɛnanas kɔ mɛko ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu ɔ, da bhii tak nyɛ ɛ́ zɛsuŋal nɛ bhoo'ɛ ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ dhem, Lazaad ɛ́ nadi ebɛ́. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Boa binɔk bɛbá zokazɛlwom mot, nyɛ kɛlɛɛ nɛ Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, sɔ'ɔ wɔ di ekwyɛl ɔ ɛpebɛ́.» <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Dáa Yezu nagwak bhaadal tak ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ booke náá: «Lazaad ɛpebɛ́. Ɛbɛ́ ɛ́ tak tok étɛp nyɛ neegwyɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, duma ɛ Zɛɛb neenyen é mis mɛ bot. Deenek, Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb neebaabela duma é mis mɛ bot, dum nɛ tɛp tak.»<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Bela tin náá, Yezu naadyeebakwyɛl Maali, nɛ Maat zɛnɔɔ dhem'ɔɔ Lazaad. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ghuna, dáa nyɛ nagwak bhaadal náá Lazaad ɛpebɛ́ ɛ, nyɛ naabaadjaasi mɛlu mɛmbá bhii tak kɔ dɛl ɛ nyɛ nadi ɛ, nyɛy ààtɔ́. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Djhoosikeka pɛ kyee dik Yude.» <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Tin, bɛdjekel eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Labhi, ekukuma eYuda aaloo nɛ saŋ ɛgó ɛ́ wɔ nɛ mɛkok penek koko ɛ koko. Mos wɔ baakwyɛl ɛ́ ɛtɔ́ penek é?» <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mwos wat ɛ́ mɛwala kam nɛ ebá, ààbɛ deenek é? Mot ɛ kɛ tɔ gwyɛ mwos ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaabema ɛbɛk. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛpebee gwyɛ bɔs'ak ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Tin, mot ɛ kɛ é pum ɔɔ, nyɛ waabema ɛbɛk. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ tok nɛ sa aasa náá, nyɛ bee ze ɛnyɔɛpe.»<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Bhii Yezu nake deenek ɛ́, nyɛ ɛ́ boobaakɛl náá: «Mɔɔ sɔ yena Lazaad eedja gɔ́. Mɛ ɛpetɔ́, kɛdjem nyɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Bɛdjekel eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Ghɛŋ, yɛ bɛ náá, nyɛ eedja gɔ́ ɔɔ, nyɛ waatsak.» <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yezu nadi elii deenek ɛ́, étɛp ɛsyee ɛ Lazaad. Bɛdjekel bɛ nagek ɛ́ náá, nyɛ nadi elii ɛ́, dum nɛ tɛtɛ gɔ́. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ bɛ popoopwon ààsyeeba náá: «Lazaad eegwyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Mɛ ɛpemyaala, etɛɛ náá, mɛ bɛ ɛ́ ààdi penek, etɛɛ náá, deenek ɛ́ bi aadum koŋ nɛ nam. Tin, djhookaka pɛ kyee nyɛ di ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tin, Toma nagetaa din ɛ Ɛwas ɔ, eezɛke nɛ bak bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel náá: «Djhootɔ́ka, yɛ bɛ ɛsyee ɔɔ, bɛ gó menabɛlka djas!»<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maat eemyaal náá Yezu ɛ́ Mɛsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Dáa Yezu nakum ɛ, nyɛ eezɛgwak náá, Lazaad moo ɛ́ nɛ mɛlu mɛná tɔ ɛvit. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Tinaak, nɛŋ pak dɛl ɛ Bhetani nɛ Yeluzalɛm nabɛ ɛ́ tyee ekilomɛtɛlɛ elɛl. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />É di'enek, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ eezyɛ pɛ daa Maali nɛ Maat étɛp ɛzɛdjɛ bɛ mɛghaaz kɔ ɛsyee ɛ dhem'ɔɔ.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Dáa Maat nagwak náá, Yezu eetuula ɛ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛtɔ́ kɛboma nɛ nɛ. Tin, Maali eezɛlik yɛ ndiidel pɛ ndjaa. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Maat eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, wɔ ɛpedi wak ɔɔ, pe dhem'am ààpagwyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Deenek, mɛ nɛ gu náá, dɔɔ nɛ nenak, esonok djas wɔ aawaab nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, nyɛ waadjɛ wɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Tin, Yezu zɛbɔɔza náá: «Dhem'ɔ ɛ́ waagom tɔ ɛsyee.» <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Maat eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Mɛ nɛ gu náá, nyɛ waagom tɔ ɛsyee é dwoo mɛsik, é sok bot djas aazɛgom tɔ ɛsyee ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yezu zokabaazɛbɔɔza náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di gomel bot ɛ nagwyɛ ɔ. Mam ɛ́ di tsik. Mot ɛ dum koŋ nɛ nam ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela tsik, ye nakoozodi náá, nyɛ naazegwyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Tin, mot ɛ di nɛ tsik, da dum koŋ nɛ nam ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaagwyɛ. Wɔ eemyaal é?» <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Maat eezɛmyaal náá: «Iyooo Ghɛŋ, mɛ nɛ gu náá, wɔ ɛ́ Mɛsia, Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb. Wɔy ɛ́ di mot Zɛɛb nakɛk náá, nyɛ ɛpezyɛ kɔ bɔs ɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛgom ɛ Lazaad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Bhii mɛkpa menek, Maat eezɛsik pɛ ndjaa kɛdjóo mɔn-nyɛɛg Maali. Tin, nyɛ eezɛnyeŋal nyɛ tɔ ɛlɔ náá: «Lyoel eetuula, nyɛ ke ɛ́ náá, wɔ kɛboma nɛ nɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Dáa Maali nagwak deenek ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛwyɛl ngbat, nɔɔ nyel, tɔ́ pɛ pak Yezu nadi ɛ́. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Ghuna Yezu nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ dinaa ààkotuula-tuulak kɔ dɛl ɛ tak. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ dinaa é di bɛ nɛ Maat naboma ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Dáa eYuda ee nazɛmɔ nɛ Maali tɔ ndjaa étɛp ɛdjɛ nyɛ mɛghaaz kɔ ɛsyee ɛ nabee dáa nyɛ nawyɛl deenek ngbat, wyis pɛ kel ɛ, bɛ eezɛdu nyɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ nagek ɛ́ náá, nyɛ natɔ́ ɛ́ pɛ ɛvit kɛdje. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Bhii tak, Maali eezɛkum pɛ Yezu nadi ɛ́. Dáa nyɛ nabee nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛghaaga si mɛko mɛ. Nyɛy nɛ Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, wɔ ɛpedi ɛ́ di wak ɔɔ, pe dhem'am ààpagwyɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Dáa, Yezu nabee nyɛ edje, bɛ nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nadu nyɛ ɔ, ye naazɛsa nyɛ ghoŋ nɛ etuŋ dhaa nyel. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />É di'enek, nyɛ eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi kɛnɛɛg muu ɛ́ paa?» Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, dha, wɔ neezɛbee.» <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Tin, Yezu eezɛdje. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Deenek, eYuda eezɛke náá: «Beeka dáa nyɛ nadi ekwyɛl nyɛ ɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Tin, bɛdhiiti bot pak eYuda binɔk moo tin eke náá: «Nyɛy mot di eebɛɛ bot ɛ edhim mis ɔ, nyɛ ààpakwak ɛlu náá, Lazaad nàgwyɛ?»<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yɛ eebaazɛsa Yezu boo ghoŋ tɔ lyem, wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛtɔ́ pɛ ɛvit. Ɛvit ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ tɔ gho ɛkok kpaka. Ye nadi ɛ́ nɛ boo ɛkok nadi ediyal ɛniel ɛ tak ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Diska ɛkok!» Wɔ gwaa Maat, kɛl mot nagwyɛ ɔ, zɛpesal náá: «Ghɛŋ, nyɛ moo mos ɛ́ nɛ mɛlu mɛná bhii nyɛ nazedelaa ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛka nuub ɛlyelɛpe.» <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ bɛ ɛ́ ààlɛɛ wɔ náá, wɔ dum koŋ nɛ nam ɔɔ, wɔ aabee duma ɛ Zɛɛb é?»<verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdis ɛkok nadi é ɛbɛ ɛ ɛvit ɛ. É di'enek, Yezu eezɛben mis pɛ ɛko, wɔ gwaa nyɛ ke náá: «Saagam, mɛ eeghaapɛɛ wɔ, etɛɛ náá, wɔ nɛ gwak mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Mɛ nɛ gu náá, wɔ eeloozyɛ nɛ ɛgwak ɛ mɛ. Tinaak, mɛ lii deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ di wak'aak neemyaal náá, wɔy ɛ́ nadhis mɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Dáa nyɛ nazɛke deenek ɛ́, wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛbam ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Lazaad, wyisa!» <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus a ressuscité Lazare" file="WA03869b.tif" size="col" loc="11.43" copy="Graham Wade" ref="11.43">Yezu eegomal Lazaad</figure><verse eid="JHN 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />É di'enek, mot nagwyɛ ɔ eezɛwyis tɔ ɛvit. Nyɛ eezɛwyis nɛ mɛmbɔ nɛ mɛko ewola nɛ epes e kaad nyɛ napilaa tɔ tak ɛ, dɔɔ nɛ bhwoob dipela nɛ epes e kaad e tak. Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tiika nyɛ epes e kaad binek é nyel, nyɛ neekɛ ɛnyɔɛpe, da bi ɛ́ bet nyɛ, nyɛ tɔ́.»<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boob kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />EYuda ɛbuɛpe tɔ sama bot ɛ nazyɛ zɛmɔ nɛ Maali kɔ ɛsyee ɔ, naabee endem e mɛbwala mɛ Yezu nasa ɛ. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazɛdum koŋ nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Tinaak, bɛdhiiti bot tɔ sama eYuda tak eezɛtɔ́, pɛ daa eFalizyɛ. Bɛ eekɛlɛɛ bɛ etɛp djas nasael ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Tin, wɔ gwaa eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ eFalizyɛ zokazɛsɛɛga tɔ boo kwan eYuda. Bɔɔ náá: «Mena saka dáa? Mot'ak dinaa esa bɛtɛ nɛ eboo endem e mɛbwala yenek! <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Mena betka nyɛ, nyɛ gheesa endem e mɛbwala menek ɔɔ, bot djas ɛ́ waadum koŋ nɛ nɛ. Tin, ekukuma e Lɔm ɛ́ waazyɛ zɛwaaz Ndjaa-ebuwa bena nɛ mbyak yena.»<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Mot ngɔt pak'ɔɔ, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Kayif. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb é mbu tak. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ààtiibal ɛnyɔɛpe! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Bi ààgu sa di enyɔ nɛ nena ɛ? Ye goka ɛ́ mot ngɔt gwyɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot djas. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bot ɛ mbyak yena djas aadi ààwyɛɛza.»<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Ghuna nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi eke deenek nɛ mɛtselal mɛ met. Ye nabela ɛ́ náá, nyɛy ɛ́ nadi boo ghaa-Zɛɛb é mbu tak. Nyɛ nadi egoola etɛp binek ɛ́ tɔ Sisim. Nyɛ nadi eke ɛ́ náá, Yezu ɛ́ waagwyɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Tin, ɛsuk ɛsyee ɛ Yezu tak nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ étɛp eYuda bɔɔ bɛmet. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ étɛp ɛsɛɛg é nyel wat bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb djas zewyɛɛza «lapa-lapa» kɔ bɔs ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Kana dwoo tak, ekukuma eYuda naamyam ɛgó ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ Yezu nakat ɛduula é mis mɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda. Tin, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ dhiiti dɛl é ngwoob bal. Din ɛ dɛl ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ Efalayim. Penek ɛ́ nyɛ nakɛkwɛɛg ba mɛlu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, ɛbyoŋ ɛ eYuda di edjóoaa «Pak» ɛ eezekunaa. Bot ɛbuɛpe nadi edus pɛ mɛl mɔɔ, tɔ pɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm. Bɛ natɔ́ ɛ́ étɛp bɛ neekɛsa mɛzel mɛ ɛdis ɛ edhuud ɛsok nɛ dwoo ɛbyoŋ kum. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />É di'enek, bɛ moo tin esaa Yezu, ààbee nyɛ. Bɛ moo tin tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa edjinel pak'ɔɔ náá: «Bi ke ɛ́ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛzyɛ é ɛbyoŋ ɛlak mos é?» <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Kabela ɛ́ náá, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ eFalizyɛ naazedjɛ ɛlee náá, mot ɛ bee Yezu ɔɔ, da nyɛ ɛ́ zɛlɛɛ bɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ neemɛt nyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Maali eezɛso Yezu mɛnanas é mɛko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Mɛlu mɛtɛn nɛ wat ɛsok nɛ dwoo ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak kum, Yezu eezɛtɔ́ pɛ Bhetani, dɛl ɛ Lazaad, mot nagwyɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ gomal nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Tin, bɛ eezɛdjaab edee étɛp Yezu. Maat ɛ́ nadi esa mɛsa mɛ ɛkɛkaa edee. Lazaad nadi ɛ́ tɔ sama bot ɛ nadi kɔ mesa nɛ Yezu ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Wɔ gwaa, Maali zokanɔɔ pes litɛlɛ tɔɔɔ nɛ mɛnanas na boo mɛtaŋ nadi edjóoaa naad<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">naad </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɛnanas mɛ tak nasael ɛ́, nɛ mɛdii mɛ dhiiti le na mbɛɛ mɛnuub di edjóoaa «naad» ɛ, ààpuuzaa nɛ dhiiti sonok.</char></note> ɛ. Nyɛ eezɛkɔ ɛlas ɛ tak, so kɔ mɛko ɛ Yezu. Bhii tak, nyɛ moo esuŋal yɛ nɛ bhoo lo'ɛ. Tin, mɛnuub mɛ mɛnanas menek zokadjala ndjaa djas. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Mot ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu, Yudas Iskaliɔt, mot aakɛka Yezu ɔ, eezɛke náá: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />«Étɛp yé mena di ààbɔmsa mɛnanas mɛ tak nɛ boo mɛtaŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Étɛp yé mena di ààbɔmsa mɛnanas mɛ tak nɛ boo mɛtaŋ? </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɛtaŋ mɛ bɛ di etuud mot sa mɛsa di edjala nɛ mɛsa mɛ mbu wat ɛ.</char></note> da nɔɔ edhenye bɛdhet-ɛtɛn nɛ wat e epata (300) tak, djɛ nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot?» <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààke deenek, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi egek bɛdjel ɛ bot ghoŋ. Nyɛ nadi eke deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ mot djii. Nyɛy ɛ́ nadi emɛt kpa epata. Nyɛ nadi edjii epata ee bot nadi ewa tɔ tak ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boobɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Betka moma yak gwyem, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nakwom mɛnanas menek ɛ étɛp dwoo mɛdela mam. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot ɛ́ waadi é di wat mɛlu djas. Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, bi aanàkwaakabaadi sama nɛ nam mɛlu djas.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Bɛtɛ nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda zokazɛgwak náá, Yezu nadi ɛ́ pɛ Bhetani. Bɛ naazɛtɔ́, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààtɔ́ étɛp ɛkɛboma nɛ Yezu nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet. Bɛ nabaatɔ́ ɛ́, étɛp ɛkɛbee Lazaad, mot Yezu nagomal ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Tin, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb zokabaagwakel náá, ye goka ɛ́, bɛ gó dɔɔ nɛ Lazaad. <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ eYuda ɛbuɛpe nadi edus tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ lɔɔ étɛp ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Yezu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eeni tɔ ghaada Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Tɔ yii mɛlem, zukamwaa nɛ mot nazyɛ étɛp ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak ɔ zokagwak náá, Yezu nadi ezyɛ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokawyis nɛ mɛmbɔ mɛ mɛbhi é mɛmbɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mɛmbɔ mɛ mɛbhi é mɛmbɔ. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɔ mɛfulu mɛ eYuda, ɛkɛ kɔ ghaada nɛ mɛmbɔ mɛ mɛbhi é mɛmbɔ kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ mɛmyaala.</char></note> Bɛ eezɛdus kɔ ghaada, étɛp ɛkɛboma nɛ Yezu. <figure style="fig" alt="L’entréé de Jésus à Jérusalem comme un roi" file="DN00487b.tif" size="col" loc="12.13" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="12.13">Ɛni ɛ Yezu tɔ Yeluzalɛm dáa mɛkoozi</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:13">Bɛ eezɛni tɔ ghaada sok bhwoob ɛ Yezu, é tsim náá: «Duu nɛ Zɛɛb! Zɛɛb goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsɛɛ mot di ezyɛ nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ mɛtel. Zɛɛb sɛɛ mbɛɛ mɛtel pɛ kɔ Mɛkoozi mɛ Yisalaɛl!»<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbela mɔɔ swooz an. Nyɛ eezɛdisi kɔ lɛ dáa Ekwyala e Mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb di elɛɛ ɛ:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />«Nàbem ba, wɔy, ɛsyees ɛ ghaada Siyɔŋ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Beea, mɛkoozi mɔ ɛpezyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">ndiindel kɔ mɔɔ swooz an<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.15 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zal 9.9</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />É di'enek, bɛdjekel bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ àànyɔ ɛtiibal etɛp binek. É sok Zɛɛb naniigal Yezu tɔ duma ɛ, tin ɛ bɛ nakazɛtaala náá, Ekwyala naazelɛɛ etɛp binek kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ. Bɛ nasa ɛ́ esa ee nagoka nɛ ɛsael dum nɛ nɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Bot ɛ nadi lɔɔg wat bɛ nɛ Yezu ɔ, é sok nyɛ nadjóo Lazaad wyis tɔ ɛvit, da nyɛ ɛ́ gomal nyɛ ɛ, bot ɛ tak moo tin elɛɛ bot esesɛɛ djas nadhaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot nazyɛ, zɛboma nɛ nɛ. Bot naagwak náá, nyɛ naasa ndem e mɛbwala menek. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Tin, eFalizyɛ moo esɔs pak'ɔɔ náá: «Bot eebee náá, bot tokapɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛbaasa dhiiti sonok, etɛɛ náá, bot djas moo ɛ́ bhii koŋ'ɛ!»<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bot ɛ mbyak eGhɛlɛk ɛpesaŋ ɛboma nɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Bɛdhiiti bot ɛ mbyak eGhɛlɛk, nadi ɛ́ tɔ sama bot ɛ nazyɛ pɛ Yeluzalɛm zɛduwal Zɛɛb tɔ ɛbyoŋ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Tin, bɛ eezɛtiila pɛ daa Filip mot dɛl Bhɛtsaida pɛ kyee dik Ghalile. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, bis ɛpekwyɛl ɛbee Yezu.»<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Tin, Filip eekɛlɛɛ Andele, bhii tak, bɔɔ djas bɛbá eezɛtɔ́, kɛlɛɛ Yezu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />É di'enek, Yezu zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ɛwala ɛ Zɛɛb aadjɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot duma ɛ, eezedjala. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ, ndu bhisa ɛ kwyit é bɔs, da yɛ di ààbɔ ɔɔ, yɛ aazodi ɛ́ deenek ààdjɛ ebhum. Yɛ bɛ náá, yɛ eewaaa tɔ bɔs ɔɔ, yɛ waabɔ, da bhii tak, yɛ ɛ́ djɛ ebhum ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Mot di ekwyɛl tsik'ɛ ɔ, nyɛ waasu yɛ. Tin, mot ɛ kwyɛl Zɛɛb dhaa dáa nyɛ di ekwyɛl tsik'ɛ kɔ bɔs'ak ɔɔ, mot yenɔk ɛ́ waabaal tsik'ɛ. Nyɛ waadi é di wat bɛ nɛ Zɛɛb kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Mot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛsa mɛsa mam ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, mot tak du mɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ mot-mɛsa mam aadi, é di mɛ di ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ Saagam aadjɛ duu nɛ mot di esa mɛsa mam ɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eelii dum nɛ ɛsyee ɛ lɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />«É di mena kadi wak nenak'aak, lo'am moo ɛ́ zɛm-zɛm nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ esiiza ɛbuɛpe. Mɛ goka nɛ ɛke dáa? Mɛ ke náá: “Saagam, pɛka mɛ é sa di ekwyɛl ɛzyɛ mɛ é nyel é ɛwala ɛlak nenak'aak?” Tin, yɛ ɛ́ étɛp ɛwala ɛlak ɛ mɛ nazyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Saagam, djɛa din ɛ lɔ duu!» É di'enek, wɔ gwaa gwood wat zɛgék tɔ gwoo náá: «Mɛ naaloozedjɛ yɛ duu. Mɛ ɛpebaadjɛ yɛ duu djɛa sis.» <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin, nakwak gwood tak ɔ, moo tin eke náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ ndum bhi!» Bak bot náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ dhiiti fofop ngɔt ɛ lii nɛ Yezu!» <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Gwood yenek ààpagék étɛp'am. Gwood tak gék ɛ́ étɛp'en. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Mena mooka ɛ́ é ɛwala bot ɛ bɔs'ak aapɛ́ɛaa ɛ. Deenek, mɛkoozi mɛ bɔs'ak moo zɛsɔaa. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Tin, é sok mam aadus kɔ bɔs, da mɛ ɛ́ benaa ɛ, mɛ waadul bot ɛ bɔs djas pɛ daa lam.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Tɔ mɛkpa menek, Yezu nadi elɛɛ ɛ́ kɔkɔ ɛsyee nabɛ náá, nyɛ waagwyɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Tin, mɛdhuu mɛ bot binɔk eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Bis djek tɔ mɛkana mɛ etsi bis ɛ́ náá, Mɛsia aadi ɛ́ nɛ tsik na kɔm-kɔm. Haaa étɛp ye wɔ ke náá, “Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aadus kɔ bɔs, da nyɛ ɛ́ benaa pɛ ɛko”? Yenɔk “Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot” ɛ́ zɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Gwyɛ ngel dinaa pak'en, étɛp ba mɔɔ ɛwala batsa. Kɛka é di bi dinaa tɔ gwyɛ ngel yenek, ekaab náá, ɛgwyitok ɛzɛkɛbela bin zaka. Etɛɛ náá, mot di ekɛ tɔ ɛgwyitok ɔ, nyɛ ààgu ze nyɛ di etɔ́ ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Dumka koŋ nɛ gwyɛ ngel é sok bi dinaa, bi nɛ yɛ é di wat yenek, etɛɛ náá, bi needi bɔn gwyɛ ngel.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 12:36">EYuda nabɛ ɛ́ ààdum koŋ nɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Bhii nyɛ nalii nɛ nɔɔ deenek ɛ́, Yezu eezɛnɔɔ nyel, tɔ́, kɛsɔwa ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Bela náá, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, nyɛ naasa bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala é mis mɔɔ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdum koŋ nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ etɛp ee ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nalɛɛ ɛ, aabela ɛsuk. Nyɛ nake ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Ghɛŋ, ɛzɛ myaal Mbɛɛ Bhaadal bis goola ɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Ghɛŋ lyaal zɛ ghwyil'ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.38 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Eza 53.1</ref></char></char></note>?»<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi naalɛɛ étɛp yé bot bak di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />«Zɛɛb naasa náá, bɛ di bot ɛ edhim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Nyɛ naadiyal etsoŋ bɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">etɛɛ náá, mis mɔɔ needi àànyaasok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Etsoŋ bɔɔ aanàkwaadjɛ ghwyil ɛmɛt etɛp djas mɛ nasa nɛ nɔɔ ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Bɛ ààbula dum koŋ nɛ nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">étɛp mɛ neetsik bɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.40 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Eza 6.9-10</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nake deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eebee duma ɛ Yezu. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ nadi elii kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Ghuna tɔ sama ekukuma eYuda, bɛtɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti nadi edum koŋ nɛ Yezu. Tin, dáa bɛ nadi ekaab náá, eFalizyɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛsɔ bɛ tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɛ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi elyaal ɛmyaal ɛ lɔɔ popoopwon. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Deenek etɛɛ náá, bɛ naadyeebakwyɛl náá, bot duwal bɛ ɛbuɛpe, dhaa-dhaŋak duu Zɛɛb di edjɛ bot ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛpɛ́ɛ ɛ bot kɔ mɛkpa ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yezu eezɛben gwood tuud náá: «Mot ɛ́ dum koŋ nɛ nam ɔɔ, nyɛ ààpadum koŋ nɛ mam mɛ ɛmet. Tin, nyɛ baadum koŋ ɛ́ nɛ mot lwom mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Mot ɛ́ bee mɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ eebee mot lwom mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Mam zyɛ kɔ bɔs ɛ́ dáa gwyɛ ngel. Deenek etɛɛ náá, mot aadum koŋ nɛ nam ɔ needi ààdi tɔ ghooghom.<verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Mot ɛ di egwak mɛlyo mam da nyɛ ɛ́ di, ààkɛ dáa mɛkpa mɛ tak di ekwos ɔɔ, ye tok mam di ekwyesal nyɛ ndjɛ sɔs. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nazyɛ, zɛtsik bot ɛ bɔs. Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ, zɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ bɔs'ak. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Mot ɛ byen mɛ, nyɛ pɛɛ ɛmyaal mɛkpa mam ɔɔ, nyɛ eebela lo mɛsɔ mɛ nyɛ aapɛ́ɛaa dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ mɛlyo mɛ mɛ di elyo ɛ, aapakwyesal nyɛ ndjɛ sɔs é dwoo Zɛɛb aapɛ́ɛ bot ɛ bɔs ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />É di'enek, mɛ aanàkwaalii kɔ ɛkwosak ɛ lam. Etɛɛ náá, Saagam mot nadhis mɛ ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eedjɛ mɛ ɛlee dum nɛ mɛkpa mɛ mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛlɛɛ ɛ, nɛ etɛp mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛlyo ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Deenek, mɛ nɛ gu náá, mɛtiŋ mɛ nyɛ di edjɛ bot ɛ, djɛ ɛ́ tsik na kɔm-kɔm. Etɛp tak ɛ́ di náá, etɛp ee mɛ di elɛɛ bin ɛ, mɛ dyeebalɛɛ ɛ́ dáa Saagam nalɛɛ mɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eegwyii mɛko mɛ bɛdjekel bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ é ges ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak. Yezu nadi egu náá, ɛwala ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́, eezekum. Ɛwala nyɛ aadus kɔ bɔs, tɔ́ pɛ daa Sɛɛg tɔ gwoo ɛ. Nyɛ nadi ekwyekwyɛl bɛsɔ bɛ di kɔ bɔs ɔ. Nyɛ naakwyɛl bɛ kɛkum mɛsik.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nadi edɛ edee e bikoko. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, dim mot mɛkɔŋ eezewa tɔ lyem ɛ Yudas Iskaliɔt, mɔn ɛ Simɔŋ, gwyes ɛkɛka Yezu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Tin, Yezu nadi egu náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ nadhis nyɛ, nyɛ nawaabaazosik ɛ́ pɛ daa lɛ. Nyɛ nɛ baagu náá, Sɛɛg naadjɛ nyɛ eghɛŋ kɔ esa e bɔs djas. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Bɔɔ edɛ kɔ mesa, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛwyɛl ngbat. Nyɛ eezɛdis kuwa é nyel. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ pes kaad pil é kuu dáa dhut. <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus lave les pieds des disciples" file="WA03912b.tif" size="span" loc="13.4" copy="Graham Wade" ref="13.1-17">Yezu eegwyii bɛdjekel bɛ mɛko</figure><verse eid="JHN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛso mɛdii tɔ kongo. É di'enek, nyɛ moo egwyii bɛdjekel bɛ mɛko. Nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ pes kaad nyɛ napil é kuu dáa dhut ɛ, nyɛ moo tin esuŋal bɛ mɛko nɛ yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Dáa nyɛ nakum pɛ daa Simɔŋ di ebaadjóoaa Pyɛɛd ɛ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, wɔ kwyɛl ɛ wɔ neegwyii mɛ mɛko?» <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Sa mɛ di esa nenak'aak, wɔ aanàkwaaleenyɔ ɛmɛt ɛsuk ɛ tak. Wɔ aaboomɛt ɛsuk ɛ tak ɛ́ ɛbhis.» <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Ààbɛ, wɔy tok nɛ ghwyil gwyii mɛ mɛko!» É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ di ààgwyii wɔ mɛko ɔɔ, wɔ tok mot'am.» <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Tin, Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ bɛ deenek ɔɔ, Ghɛŋ, nàgwyii mɛ mɛko nɛ mɛko. Zokagwyii mɛ dɔɔ nɛ mɛmbɔ nɛ lo!» <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yezu eebaazɛbɔɔza náá: «Mot di náá, nyɛ eezegwyiia ɔɔ, nyɛ tokapɛ nɛ gwyes ɛbaagwyiia, nyɛ aazokagwyii ɛ́ mɛko. Biyɔ, mɛnyel men djas moo ɛ́ dɛɛ. Tin, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mot ngɔt tɔ len di ààbɛ dɛɛ ɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yezu nadi egu, mot aakɛka nyɛ ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ nake náá: «Ye tok biyɔ djas di edɛɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Bhii nyɛ nazesilal ɛgwyii ɛ́ bɛ mɛko ɛ, Yezu eezɛnɔɔ kuwa yɛ sɔm é nyel. Nyɛ eebula zɛdisi é ngwoob mesa. Tin, nyɛ eebaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi eemɛt ɛsuk ɛ sa mɛ sa bin ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Bi dyeebadjóo mɛ ɛ́ “Lyoel” nɛ “Ghɛŋ”. Bi ɛ́ nɛ gham etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛ́ yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Yɛ bɛ náá, mam Ghɛŋ, Lyoel'en, mɛ eegwyii bin mɛko ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bi gwyiiel mɛko pak'en. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Mɛ lyaal bin tin ɛ, dáa bi di egoka nɛ ɛbe bɔn-nyɛɛg bin pak'en ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Mɛ eelɛɛ bin étɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, ye tok nɛ mot-mɛsa ngɔt di edhaa kukuma yɛ. Zɛbaanɔɔ náá, ye tok nɛ ngoola-ngoola di edhaa mot nalwom nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Tin nenak yak, bi eezegu náá, yɛ ɛ́ deenek, bi aadi tɔ mɛmyaala ɛ́ bi ɛ́ di esa dáa mɛ lyaal bin ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Mɛ ààlii deenek nɛ biyɔ djas. Mɛ lii ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ mɛ zesɛ́ɛ ɔ. Tin, ye goka ɛ́ náá, mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb di elɛɛ náá: “Mot bis nɛ nɛ nadi epyaala pes tsim ɔ, nyɛ eeliig mɛ ɛkoŋ ɛ wak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.18 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 41:10">Mɛd 41.10</ref></char></char></note>” neebela ɛsuk. <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Ɛsok nɛ etɛp bak nɛ sael, mɛ eezenyɛl ɛlɛɛ bin, etɛɛ náá, é sok esesɛɛ tak aazɛsael ɛ, bi neemyaal náá: “Mɛ ɛ́ Mɛsia.” <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mot aamyaal mot mam dhis ɔ, nyɛ myaal ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ mam. Deenek, mot aamyaal mɛ ɔ, nyɛ myaal ɛ́ mot nadhis mɛ ɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eelɛɛ náá, Yudas ɛ́ waakɛka nyɛ gha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Bhii Yezu nazelii deenek ɛ́, ye nabɛ ɛ́, ghoŋ naazɛmɛt nyɛ ɛbuɛpe. Nyɛ ɛ́ booke náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mot ngɔt pak'en ɛ́ waaka mɛ gha.» <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Bɛdjekel moo tin zibiliii egwyákel pak'ɔɔ, ààgu mot nyɛ nadi eke deenek kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel, mot Yezu nadi ekwyɛl ɛbuɛpe ɔ, nadisi ɛ́, é ngwoob ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd eezɛtut nyɛ dis, étɛp nyɛ needji Yezu mot nyɛ nadi elii deenek kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Tin, djekel yenɔk eezɛsil lo, kɛl kɔ bet ɛ Yezu. Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, mot tak ɛ́ zɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ ɛpeduu pes mapa tɔ saan. Mot mɛ aadjɛ nyɛ pes mapa tak ɔ, mot tak ɛ́ yenɔk.» Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛnɔɔ pes mapa, duu tɔ saan, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ yɛ, djɛ Yudas Iskaliɔt, mɔn ɛ Simɔŋ. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Dáa Yudas nanɔɔ pes mapa tak, dɛ ɛ, é di tak wat, Satan eezɛni tɔ lɛ. Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Lela ɛsa, sa wɔ di ekwyɛl ɛsa ɛ!»<verse eid="JHN 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Tɔ sama bot ɛ nadi kɔ mɛsa ɔ, mot ngɔt pak'ɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́ ààmɛt ɛsuk ɛ etɛp ee nyɛ nadi elii deenek ɛ́. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Dáa nabela náá, Yudas ɛ nadi emɛt kpa epata ɛ, bɛsɔ nagu ɛ náá, Yezu naalwom nyɛ, nyɛ kɛɛbɔm dhiiti esa ee bɛ nadi nɛ gwyes tak etɛp ɛbyoŋ ɛ. Nɛghu bɛ kɛɛdjɛ dhiiti esonok nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Tin, Yudas eezɛnɔɔ pes mapa yenek zɛwyɛl ngbat, nyɛ eezɛwyis tɔ́. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ɛgwyitok eezegwyiidela.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eedjɛ bɛdjekel bɛ ɛtiŋ ɛ na bes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Bhii Yudas nakawyis ɛ, Yezu eezɛke náá: «É di mena kadi wak nenak'aak, duu ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot eezenyen, deenek, Zɛɛb ɛpelyaal duu yɛ pɛ tɔ lɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />[Yɛ bɛ náá, duu ɛ Zɛɛb ɛpenyen tɔ mɔn ɔɔ,] Zɛɛb nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet pe ɛ́ waalyaal duu ɛ mɔn. Ye kalik ɛ́ batsa, nyɛ aalyaal yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Bɔn bam, mɛ kalik nɛ nen mos ɛ́ ba bɔɔ mɛlu batsa. Bi ɛ́ waasaa mɛ, dáa mɛ nalɛɛ nɛ ekukuma eYuda ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ mɛ baadi elɛɛ nɛ nen'aak. Bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtɔ́ pɛ pak mɛ di tɔ́ ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Yɛ ɛ́ mɛ di edjɛ bin ɛtiŋ ɛ na bes náá: Kwyɛlaka pak'en. Ye goka bi kwyɛlel pak'en dáa mɛ nakwyɛl bin ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Bi ɛ kwyɛlel pak'en ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bot aagu náá, bi ɛ́ bɛdjekel bam.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eelɛɛ náá, Pyɛɛd ɛ́ waaswonal nyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd zokazɛdji Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, wɔ tɔ́ paa?» Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Nenak yak, wɔ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdu mɛ pɛ pak mɛ di etɔ́ ɛ. Tin, wɔ waaboodi ɛ́ du mɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, étɛp yé mɛ di ààgoka nɛ ɛdu ɛ́ wɔ nenak? É di mɛ di'aak, mɛ eezemyam ɛdjɛ tsik'am é di yɔ!» <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yezu eezɛdji nɛ náá: «Wɔ eezemyam ɛdjɛ tsik'ɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam é? Tin, beta mɛ lɛɛ wɔ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, ɛsok nɛ kuu nɛ kɔk, yɛ aakabela ɛ́, wɔ eezeswonal mɛ tyee esok elɛl.»<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu ɛ́ ze di edul bot pɛ daa Sɛɛg ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa mot ààbem ba. Dumka koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, da bi ɛ́ baadum koŋ nɛ nam. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Mɛdhɛŋ nɛ bu tɔ ndjaa Saagam. Yɛ ɛpedi ɛ́, ààbɛ tak ɔɔ, pe mɛ eelɛɛ bin. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di etɔ́, étɛp ɛkɛkoobal bin di bi aakɛdi ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Tin, bhii mɛ aatɔ́ kɛkoobal bin di ɛ, mɛ aakazyɛ zɛsaa bin étɛp bi needi é ngwoob'am. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bi aadi é di mam aadi ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Bi nɛ gu ze di edul bot pɛ pak mɛ di ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tin, Toma eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, bis ààgu pɛ pak wɔ di tɔ́ ɛ. Haaa bis aagu ze dáa?» <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di ze, mɛ ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ, mam ɛ́ di tsik. Mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtɔ́ pɛ daa Saagam, nyɛ di ààdhaa pɛ daa lam ɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Dáa ye di náá, bi nɛ gu mɛ ɛ, bi nɛ baagu pe Saagam. Deenek, di mena kadi nenak'aak, bi nɛ gu nyɛ etɛɛ náá, bi eebee nyɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Tin, Filip eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ! Lyaala bis Soog, deenek, elyem ɛ́ waasila bis.» <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Mena eezebɔya mɛlu ɛbuɛpe é di wat, wɔ dinaa ààpagu mɛ, Filip? Mot bee mɛ ɔ, nyɛ eezebee Saagam. Étɛp yé wɔ di baake náá: “Lyaala bis Soog”? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Wɔ ààmyaal náá, mɛ ɛ́ pɛ tɔ Saagam, dáa Saagam ɛ́ baadi pɛ tɔ lam ɛ? Etɛp ee mɛ di elɛɛ nɛ biyɔ djas'aak, yɛ ààdus pɛ daa lam, yɛ ɛ́ Saagam, mot di tɔ lam ɔ, di esa náá, esesɛɛ binek djas sael. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Myaalka mɛ é sok mɛ di eke náá, mɛ ɛ́ tɔ Saagam, Saagam ɛ́ pɛ tɔ lam pe ɛ. Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ààmyaal ɔɔ, zomyaalka, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛpebee endem e mɛbwala mam.<verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mot ɛ dum koŋ'ɛ nɛ nam ɔɔ, nyɛ waasa endem e mɛbwala. Nyɛ waasa eboo endem e mɛbwala dhaa tyɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛpetɔ́ pɛ daa Saagam. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Tin, mɛ waasa esa djas yii bi aawaab nɛ din ɛ lam ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, Mɔn neelyaal bot duu ɛ Sɛɛg. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Bi ɛ́ waab sonok nɛ din ɛ lam ɔɔ, mɛ waasa sa tak.»<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eekɛk bot Sisim na Dɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />«Yɛ bɛ náá, bi nɛ kwyɛl mɛ ɔɔ, kɛka dáa mɛtiŋ mam di elyaal ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Mɛ waawaab nɛ Saagam nyɛ dhis bin Mot-Mɛghɛm, étɛp nyɛ neezɛkɛm bin, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ needi sama wat nɛ nen kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Mot tak ɛ́ Sisim e etsɛɛtsɛ. Tinaak, bot ɛ bɔs'ak aanàkwaabela Sisim tak. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbee nyɛ, bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛgu nyɛ. Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ waagu nyɛ etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ nen sama, nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ len.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Mɛ aanàkwaalik bin biyɔ bɛmet tyee bɔn nyel. Mɛ waabula pɛ daa len. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Ye kalik ɛ́ batsa etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ bɔs'ak needi ààbaabee mɛ. Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ waabebee mɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ tsik, dɔɔ nɛ biyɔ pe, bi ɛ́ waadi nɛ tsik. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Dwoo tak bi ɛ́ waagu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, bis nɛ Saagam ɛ́ mot ngɔt. Dáa biyɔ baadi mot ngɔt nɛ nam ɛ, mam ɛ́ mot ngɔt nɛ nen.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Mot di emɛt mɛtiŋ mam, da nyɛ ɛ́ kɛ dáa ɛkwosak ɛ tak di elɛɛ ɛ, mot di ekwyɛl mam ɛ́ yenɔk. Saagam aakwyɛl nyɛ, mam pe, mɛ waakwyɛl nyɛ. Mɛ waatel nyɛ nyel'am.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Zuud, ààkabɛ Yudas Iskaliɔt, zokazɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, étɛp yé wɔ aalyaal bis nyel'ɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ kadi ɛ́, ààlyaal bot ɛ bɔs di ààmyaal wɔ ɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mot di ekwyɛl mɛ ɔ, nyɛ waakɛ dáa mɛ di elɛɛ ɛ. Tin, Saagam ɛ́ waakwyɛl nyɛ. Bis nɛ Saagam ɛ́ waazyɛ pɛ daa lɛ, bis aadi nɛ nɛ sama. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Mot di ààkwyɛl mɛ ɔ, nyɛ ààkɛ dáa mɛkpa mam di elɛɛ ɛ. Bela náá, etɛp ee mɛ di elii nɛ nen ɛ ààdus pɛ daa lam, ye dus ɛ́ pɛ daa Saagam, mot nadhis mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Mɛ bɛ ɛ́, mɛ eelɛɛ bin etɛp binek, é sok mena dika é di wat ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Mot-Mɛghɛm aazyɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ nyɛ ɛ di Sisim na Dɛɛ Saagam aadhis nɛ din ɛ lam ɛ, étɛp nyɛ neelyaal bin esonok djas. Nyɛ waasa náá, bi siiza etɛp djas mɛ nadi elelɛɛ bin ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Mɛ lik bin ɛ́ egwyem. Yɛ ɛ́ egwyem bam ɛ mɛ di edjɛ bin. Mam ààpadjɛ bin yɛ dáa bot ɛ bɔs'ak di djɛ ɛ. Sa mot ààbem ba. Sa mot ààdi nɛ bwoo. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Bi eegwak dáa mɛ ke náá: “Mɛ ɛpetɔ́, tin, mɛ waabula pak'en”. Bi ɛ kwyɛl mɛ ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ waadi tɔ mɛmyaala étɛp mɛ ke náá, mɛ ɛpetɔ́ pɛ daa Saagam ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, Saagam eedhaa mɛ boo dhaŋak. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Mɛ eelɛɛ bin yɛ nenak, ɛsok nɛ esesɛɛ bak djas nɛ sael. É sok esonok binek djas aazyɛ ɛ, bi ɛ́ waadum koŋ nɛ nam. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Mɛ aanàkwaabaalii ɛbuɛpe nɛ nen etɛɛ náá, mɛkoozi mɛ bɔs'ak moo aazyɛ. Nyɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsa mɛ dhiiti sonok. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Tin, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bot ɛ bɔs'ak gu náá, mɛ nɛ kwyɛl Saagam. Deenek, mɛ sa mɛsa mam ɛ, dáa Saagam nalwom mɛ náá, mɛ sa ɛ. Wyɛlka. Djhooduska wak.»<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu ɛ́ tɛtɛ le vin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />«Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di tɛtɛ le vin. Saagam ɛ́ nakuma pyeeb tak. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Nyɛ waatsaal elɛɛ di ààdjɛ bhum ɛ djas. Tinaak, elɛɛ di edjɛ bhum ɛ, nyɛ kakoobal yɛ ɛ́ koobelak, etɛɛ náá, yɛ needjɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bhum. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Bi moo mos ɛ́ bot ɛ na dɛɛ dum nɛ mɛlyo mɛ mɛ djɛ bin ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Dika mot ngɔt nɛ nam, dáa mɛ di mot ngɔt bis nɛ Saagam ɛ. Lɛɛ le vin tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbya bhum, yɛ di ààdi naada é kuu le ɔɔ. Tyee wat nɛ nen, bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbya bhum, bi ɛ di ààdi nɛ nam sama wat ɔɔ. <figure style="fig" alt="Arbre de vigne et le grape des fruits" file="hk00109c.tif" size="col" loc="5.4" copy="Horace Knowles. © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1954. 1967.1972. Additions and amendments by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994" ref="15.4">Kel vin nɛ sɛŋ tak</figure><verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di le vin, biyɔ ɛ́ elɛɛ. Mot di tɔ lam ɔ, mot mɛ di nɛ nɛ sama wat ɔ. Nyɛ waabya bɛtɛ nɛ bhum, etɛɛ náá, ye tok nɛ sa bi aasa, mam ààbɛ tak. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Mot di ààdi tɔ lam ɔ, nyɛ waamwasaa pɛ kel dáa esɔsela elɛɛ e le, nyɛ waatekaa, da mwasaa tɔ du, da nyɛ ɛ́ dyak. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Bi ɛ be di tɔ lam, da mɛkpa mam ɛ́ di tɔ len ɔɔ, waabka esonok djas bi aadi nɛ gwyes tak ɛ, deenek bi ɛ́ waabela yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />É ghɛŋ bi aadjɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bhum ɛ, yɛ waalyaal nɛ bot náá, bi ɛ́ bɛdjekel bam. Deenek, bi ɛ́ waadjɛ Saagam boo duu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Mɛ nɛ kwyɛl bin dáa Saagam di ekwyɛl mɛ ɛ. Dika tɔ kwyɛl'am. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Bi ɛ duwal mɛtiŋ mam dáa mam di eduwal mɛtiŋ Saagam ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ waadi tɔ kwyɛl'am, dáa mam di tɔ kwyɛl Saagam ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin etɛp binek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, mɛmyaala mam needi mɛmyaala men, da mɛmyaala men ɛ́ di yii tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ lyem wat. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Beeka yam ɛtiŋ: Gheekwyekwyɛlaka pak'en. Kwyɛlaka pak'en dáa mɛ di eboozyɛ nɛ ɛkwyɛl bin ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Boo mɛkwyɛla mɛ mot di egoka nɛ ɛlyaal ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ ɛdjɛ nyel'ɛ ɛmet étɛp bɛsɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Bi ɛ di esa etɛp ee mɛ di ekwyɛl náá bi sa ɔɔ, deenek, bi ɛ́ waadi bɛsɔ bam. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Tin, mɛ aanàkwaabaadjóo bin bot ɛ mɛsa, etɛɛ náá, mot-mɛsa ààgu sa kukuma yɛ di esa ɛ. Mɛ djóo bin ɛ́ bɛsɔ bam, etɛɛ náá, mɛ eezelyaal bin esa ee Saagam nalyaal mɛ ɛ djas. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Ye tok biyɔ natɔ mɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ natɔ bin. Mɛ eedjɛ bin lwomel bi tɔ́, bi kɛdjɛ bhum, bi kɛdjɛ bhum aabɔya ɛ. Deenek, Saagam ɛ́ waadjɛ bin esonok djas ee bi aawaab nɛ din ɛ lam ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Mɛ djɛ bin mɛtiŋ menek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bi neegheekwyekwyɛla pak'en.»<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bot ɛ bɔs'ak ɛpebhina Yezu nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />«Yɛ bɛ náá, bot ɛ bɔs'ak ɛpebhina bin ɔɔ, guka náá, bɛ naaloozebhina mɛ ɛsok nɛ biyɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Bi ɛpedi bot ɛ bɔs'ak ɔɔ, pe bot ɛ bɔs'ak ɛpekwyɛl bin, dáa bot bɔɔ. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́, mam eesɛ́ɛ bin, mɛ eebɛk bin nɛ bot ɛ bɔs'ak. Deenek, bi tokapɛ bot ɛ bɔs'ak, yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ bot ɛ bɔs'ak di ebhina bin. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Gheetaalaka sa mɛ nalɛɛ bin ɛ: “Ye tok nɛ mot-mɛsa ngɔt di edhaa kukuma yɛ.” Etɛɛ náá, yɛ bɛ náá, bot naatiigal mɛ ɔɔ, guka náá, bɛ waatiigal bin pe. Yɛ bɛ náá, bɛ naawa elyem tɔ mɛlyo mam ɔɔ, bɛ waabaawa elyem tɔ mɛlyo men pe. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Tinaak, bɛ aasa bin etɛp binek djas ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam, etɛɛ náá, bɛ ààgu mot nadhis mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Mɛ ɛpedi ààzyɛ, étɛp ɛzɛlii nɛ nɔɔ etɛp bak ɔɔ, pe bɛ tok ekwyɛ ndjɛ sɔs. Tin, dáa bɛ di náá, bɛ naazegwak mɛ ɛ, mesyem mɔɔ aanàpelaa.<verse eid="JHN 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Mot di ebhina mɛ ɔ, nyɛ baabhina ɛ́ Saagam. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Ye ɛpedi ɛ́ náá, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààsa endem e mɛbwala di náá, dhiiti mot dinaa ààpakosa sok é mis mɔɔ ɛ, é di'enek, pe bɛ tok nɛ mesyem. Tin, é dwoo pan mos'ak, bɛ eezebee endem e mɛbwala mɛ mɛ nasa ɛ, bhii tak, bɛ ɛ́ kadi ebhina bis nɛ Saagam. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Tin, etɛp binek sael ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, esa ee di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ, neebela ɛsuk ɛ tak. Yɛ ɛ́ kwyala náá: “Bɛ eebhina mɛ, ààbɛ nɛ lo tɛp<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.25 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Mɛd 35.19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:5">69.5</ref></char></char></note>.”<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Mot-Mɛghɛm ɛ́ ɛpezyɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ Sisim e etsɛɛtsɛ Saagam aadhis ɛ. Sisim tak aadus ɛ́ pɛ daa Saagam, mɛ waadhis bin yɛ ɛ. Nyɛ waalyaal bin etsɛɛtsɛ dum nɛ mbi mot mɛ di ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Tin, dɔɔ nɛ biyɔ pe, bi ɛ́ waalɛɛ bot esa ee bi di egu kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mena eebɔyaka nɛ ɛgyee sama wat, kana mɛkɛn mɛ mɛsa mam.»<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />«Mɛ lɛɛ bin etɛp bak djas ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bi needi ààkat ɛdum ɛ koŋ'en nɛ nam. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Bi ɛ́ waasɔaa tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Deenek, ɛwala ɛ́ waazyɛ, ɛwala di náá bot aagó bin ɔ, waake náá, yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bɛ di esa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Bɛ aasa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bɛ ààgu Saagam, ààgu mɛ pe. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Tin, mɛ lɛɛ bin etɛp binek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, é sok ɛwala ɛ tak aakum ɛ, bi neegheesisimza náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́, mɛ naaloozelɛɛ bin.»</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Mɛsa mɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">«Mɛ nadi ààleelɛɛ bin yɛ sok ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, mena nadika ɛ́ mena dinaa é di wat. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Nenak, mɛ moo tɔ́ pɛ daa mot nadhis mɛ ɔ. Tin, ye tok nɛ mot pak'en aabaadji mɛ náá: “Wɔ tɔ́ paa”? <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Deenek, elyem bin moo ɛ́ tɔɔɔ nɛ ghoŋ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ etɛp mɛ di elɛɛ bin'aak. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Ghuna mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, kɔ ɛsu ɛ len, ɛnyɔ náá, mɛ tɔ́. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ di ààtɔ́ ɔɔ, Mot-Mɛghɛm di egoka nɛ ɛzyɛ ɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaabaazyɛ pɛ daa len. Tin, mɛ tɔ́ ɔɔ, mɛ ɛpedhis bin nwyak. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Tin, é sok nyɛ aazyɛ ɛ, nyɛ waalyaal bot ɛ di kɔ bɔs'ak ɔ, ɛdjak ɛ lɔɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ mesyem, ɛdjak ɛ lɔɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ epiki e Zɛɛb, zɛnɔɔ epɛ́ɛ e Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Mesyem mɛ bot ɛ bɔs ɛ́ náá, bot ɛpebyen ɛdum koŋ nɛ nam. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Yɛ bɛ dum nɛ epiki e Zɛɛb ɔɔ, bot ɛ́ tɔ ɛdjak, etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛpetɔ́ pɛ daa Saagam. Tin, bi aanàkabaabee mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Yɛ kabɛ dum nɛ epɛ́ɛ ɔ, bot ɛ́ tɔ ɛdjak, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb eezepɛ́ɛ mɛkoozi mɛ bɔs'ak.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Mɛ dinaa nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ etɛp ee mɛ aalɛɛ bin ɛ, saabɛgɔs ɛ́ náá, bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtiibal yɛ nenak. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />É sok Sisim etsɛɛtsɛ aazyɛ ɛ, nyɛ waadjɛɛd bin tɔ etsɛɛtsɛ djas. Nyɛ aanàkwaalii nɛ nen kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ met. Nyɛ aalɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp ee nyɛ nagwak ɛ. Nyɛ waalɛɛ bin etɛp ee di ezyɛ pɛ sok ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Nyɛ waalyaal duu'am, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ waabela etɛp ee mɛ di nɛ yɛ ɛ djas. Bhii tak, nyɛ kazyɛ, zɛbaŋa bin yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Esa e Saagam djas ɛ́ esa bam. Kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ́, mɛ di eke náá, Sisim na tsɛɛtsɛ waanɔɔ sa di náá, yɛ ɛ́ yam ɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ zɛgoola bin yɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ghoŋ bɛdjekel ɛ́ waaliiza mɛmyaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />«Ye kalik ɛ́ ba ɛwala, bi aanàbaabee mɛ. Tin, ba ɛwala batsa bhii tak, bi ɛ́ waabaabee mɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Bɛdhiiti bot tɔ sama bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛdjinel pak'ɔɔ náá: «Nyɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɛlɛɛ yé, é sok nyɛ di eke náá: “Ye kalik ɛ́ ba ɛwala batsa, bi aanàkabaabee mɛ, bhii ba ɛwala, bi ɛ́ waabaabee mɛ” ɛ? Dɔɔ nɛ é sok nyɛ di eke náá: “Mɛ ɛpetɔ́ pɛ daa Saagam” ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />“Ba ɛwala batsa” nyɛ di elɛɛ wak ɛ, ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal yé? Mena ààmɛtka ɛsuk ɛ sa nyɛ di elɛɛ mena ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Tinaak, Yezu eezɛgu náá, bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛdji nyɛ edhiiti etɛp. Wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ eelɛɛ bin tsɛɛtsɛ náá: “Ye kalik ɛ ba ɛwala batsa, bi aanàbaabee mɛ. Bhii ba ɛwala, bi ɛ́ waabaabee mɛ.” Yɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ bi di edjinel pak'en é? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bi ɛ́ waadje mɛgwyɛ, bi ɛ́ waadi tɔ́ mezuk. É di'enek, bot ɛ bɔs'ak aadi ɛ́, tɔ mɛmyaala ɛbuɛpe. Bi aadi ɛ́, tɔ ghoŋ. Tin, ghoŋ'en ɛ́ waaliiza mɛmyaala.<verse eid="JHN 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />É sok moma di ekɛbya ɛ, nyɛ bya ɛ́ tɔ mezuk nɛ mɛkpaa. Etɛɛ náá, ɛwala ɛ mezuk mɛ dyeebadi ɛ́, eezedjala. Tin, yɛ kabɛ náá, mɔn eebyel ɔ, nyɛ eedjisa mezuk menek. Nyɛ moo tɔ mɛmyaala etɛɛ náá, dhiiti mot na bes eezyɛ kɔ bɔs'ak. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Tyee wat nɛ nen, é di mena mooka nenak'aak, bi ɛ́ tɔ ghoŋ nɛ mezuk. Tin, mɛ waabaaboma nɛ nen. É di'enek, elyem bin aadi ɛ́, tɔ mɛmyaala. Deenek, ye tokapɛ nɛ mot aadis mɛmyaala menek tɔ elyem bin.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />É sok ɛlu ɛ tak aakum ɛ, bi aanàkwaabaadji mam kiya dum nɛ dhiiti tɛp. Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: Saagam ɛ́ waadjɛ bin esonok djas ee bi aawaab nɛ din ɛ lam ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Kɛyaka nɛ dwoo pan mos'ak, bi dinaa ààpawaab sonok nɛ din ɛ lam. Tin, waabka, bi ɛ́ waadjɛaa. Deenek mɛmyaala men ɛ́ waadi tɛtɛ mɛmyaala nɛ lyem wat.»<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ɛ́ Ghɛŋ kɔ esa e bɔs'ak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />«Mɛ lɛɛ bin etɛp bak djas ɛ́, tɔ ekana. Ɛwala ɛ mɛ aadi ààkabaalii nɛ nen tɔ ekana ɛ, yɛ ɛpezyɛ. Tin ɛ́, mɛ aazɛlɛɛ bin etɛp mɛpyɛmɛ dum nɛ Saagam. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Dwoo tak, bi ɛ́ waawaab esonok nɛ Saagam nɛ din ɛ lam. Tin, mɛ ààpalɛɛ bin náá, mɛ waadjaala nɛ Saagam kɔ ɛsu ɛ len. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Mɛ aanàdjaala nɛ Saagam étɛp'en, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛmet nɛ kwyɛl bin. Nyɛ kwyɛl bin ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ kwyɛl mɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ myaal náá, mɛ nadus ɛ́ pɛ daa Zɛɛb. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Mɛ nadus ɛ́ pɛ daa Saagam, bhii tak, mɛ eezɛzyɛ kɔ bɔs'ak. Nenak, mɛ moo zɛdus kɔ bɔs'ak, étɛp ɛsik pɛ daa Saagam.»<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Wɔ gwaa bɛdjekel bɛ zɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Beea! Nenak wɔ moo lii mɛpyɛmɛ, ààbɛ tɔ ekana. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Deenek, ye di mena kadi wak nenak'aak, bis nɛ gu náá, wɔ nɛ gu djas. Tin, wɔ tok nɛ gwyes ɛbwood náá, bis dji wɔ dhiiti tɛp. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ bis di emyaal náá, wɔ nadus ɛ́ pɛ daa Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «É di'enek, bi moo myaal é? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Deenek, beeka ɛwala ɛpezyɛ, ɛwala ɛ tak eezezyɛ, ɛwala ɛ biyɔ djas aawyɛɛza na “gwyeeeŋ” ɛ, mot nɛ mot ɛ́ waasik pɛ daa lɛ. Bi ɛ́ waalik mɛ mam mɛ ɛmet. Ààbɛ, ye tok tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mɛ aalik ɛ́ mam mɛ ɛmet etɛɛ náá, bis nɛ Saagam ɛ́ di sama. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin etɛp bak djas ɛ́, étɛp bi needi tɔ egwyem, é ghɛŋ bi aadi tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ nam ɛ. Bi ɛ́ waazukaa nɛ ɛtiigaa kɔ bɔs'ak. Tin, saka mɛghaaz, etɛɛ náá, mɛ naazekwak etɛp e bɔs'ak djas.»<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eedjaala Zɛɛb étɛp bɛdjekel bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Bhii nyɛ zelii deenek ɛ́, Yezu eezɛben mis pɛ ɛko, nyɛ eezɛke náá: «Saagam, ɛwala ɛ tak eezedjala. Djɛa Mɔn'ɔ duu etɛɛ náá, Mɔn'ɔ needjɛ wɔ duu pe. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Wɔy naadjɛ nyɛ eghɛŋ kɔ bot ɛ bɔs djas, étɛp nyɛ needjɛ bot ɛ wɔ nadjɛ nyɛ ɔ, tsik na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Tsik na kɔm-kɔm ɛ́ náá, bot gu wɔ, wɔy ɛ́ Zɛɛb etsɛɛtsɛ, Zɛɛb ngɔt, dɔɔ nɛ ɛgu ɛ́ Yezu Klisto, mot wɔ nadhis ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Mɛ eelyaal duma yɔ kɔ bɔs. Mɛ eesilal ɛsa mɛsa mɛ wɔ nalwom mɛ náá, mɛ zɛsa ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Nenak, Saagam, djɛ mɛ duma mɛ nadi nɛ yɛ sok bhwoob'ɔ é sok mɛ nadi é ngwoob'ɔ ɛ, ɛsok nɛ bɔs nɛ kusel.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Mɛ eelyaal wɔ nɛ bot ɛ wɔ nasɛ́ɛ tɔ sama bot ɛ di kɔ bɔs, da wɔ ɛ́ djɛ mɛ bak ɔ. Bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ bot bɔ, wɔ naadjɛ mɛ bak. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ tak eegwak mɛkpa mɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Nenak bɛ eezegu náá, esonok djas wɔ nadjɛ mɛ ɛ nadus ɛ́ pɛ daa lɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Etɛɛ náá, mɛ eezelɛɛ bɛ mɛkpa mɛ wɔ nadjɛ mɛ ɛ. Tin, bɛ naamyaal yɛ, bɛ eegu náá, tsɛɛtsɛ mɛ nadus ɛ́ pɛ daa lɔ, bɛ eemyaal náá, wɔy ɛ nadhis mɛ.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Mɛ djaala nɛ nɔ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔɔ. Mɛ ààdjaala nɛ nɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ bɔs'ak. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp bot ɛ wɔ nadjɛ mɛ ɔ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot bɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Tin, bot djas mɛ di nɛ nɔɔ ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ bɔ. Deenek bot djas di bɔ ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ bam. Tin, bɛ eedjɛ mɛ duu.<verse eid="JHN 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Mɛ tokapɛ kɔ bɔs. Tin, yɛ kabɛ bɔɔ ɔɔ, bɛ ɛ́ kɔ bɔs. Yɛ bɛ mam ɔɔ, mɛ ɛpetɔ́ pɛ daa lɔ. Saagam na Dɛɛ, baala bɛ tɔ ghwyil din ɛ lɔ, din ɛ wɔ nadjɛ mɛ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ needi mot ngɔt dáa wɔy nɛ mam di mot ngɔt ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />É sok bis nɛ bɛnɔɔ nadi, bis dinaa é di wat ɛ, mɛ nadi ebaal bɛ nɛ ghwyil mɛbwala mɛ din ɛ lɔ, din ɛ wɔ nadjɛ mɛ ɛ. Mɛ nabebaal bɛ ɛ́ nɛ yɛ. Ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt diib tɔ lɔɔ, bhii mot nabɛ náá, nyɛ waadiib, etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala e Mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb neebela ɛsuk ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Deenek, nenak mɛ moo ezyɛ pɛ daa lɔ. Mɛ lii etɛp bak ɛ́, é sok mɛ di, mɛ dinaa kɔ bɔs ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ bɛmet needi nɛ mɛmyaala mam, da bɛ ɛ́ di nɛ mɛmyaala na tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ lyem wat. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Mɛ naadjɛ bɛ mɛkpa mɔ. Tin, bot ɛ bɔs ɛpebhina bɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bɛdjekel bam tok bot ɛ bɔs'ak, dáa mam di ààdi mot bɔs'ak ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Mɛ ààpawaab náá, wɔ dis bɛ kɔ bɔs'ak. Tin, mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́, wɔ baal bɛ sok bhwoob Mbee mot. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Bɛ tok bot ɛ bɔs'ak, dáa mam pe di ààdi mot bɔs'ak ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Lyaala bɛ etsɛɛtsɛ, bɛ needi bot bɔ nɛ lyem wat. Mɛkpa mɔ ɛ́ di etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Mɛ eelwom bɛ pɛ kɔ bɔs, dáa wɔy nalwom mɛ kɔ bɔs ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Mɛ eedjɛ wɔ tsik'am djas kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔɔ. Etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ pe bɛ needi bot bɔ na dɛɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Mendjaala mam tok étɛp bɔɔ bɛmet. Mɛ djaala ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ étɛp bot ɛ aadi egwak mɛlyo mɔ, da bɛ ɛ́ dum koŋ nɛ nam ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Mendjaala mam ɛ́ náá, bɔɔ djas di mot ngɔt. Saagam, bɛ di mot ngɔt nɛ nena, dáa wɔ di pɛ tɔ lam, mam tɔ lɔ ɛ. Bɛ di mot ngɔt etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ bɔs neemyaal náá, yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ nadhis mɛ.<verse eid="JHN 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Mɛ eedjɛ bɛ duu wɔ nadjɛ mɛ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ needi mot ngɔt dáa mena di mot ngɔt ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Mɛ eebe di tɔ lɔɔ, wɔy tɔ lam. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bɛ aakwak ɛdi nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ mot ngɔt. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bot ɛ bɔs'ak aagu náá, wɔy ɛ́ nadhis mɛ. Wɔ nɛ kwyɛl bɛ, dáa wɔ di ekwyɛl mɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Saagam, wɔ naadjɛ mɛ bak. Ɛkwosak ɛ lam ɛ́ náá, bɛ di bis nɛ nɔɔ é di mɛ aadi ɛ, étɛp bɛ neebee duu'am. Yɛ ɛ́ duu wɔ nadjɛ mɛ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, wɔ nakwyɛl mɛ ɛ́ ɛsok nɛ bɔs nɛ kusel. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Saagam, wɔ mot epiki. Bot ɛ bɔs'ak nabɛ ɛ́ ààgu wɔ, yɛ ɛ́ kabɛ mam ɔ, mam naagu wɔ. Deenek, bɛdjekel bam bak eegu náá, yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ nadhis mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Mɛ naasa náá, bɛ gu din ɛ lɔ. Tin, mɛ waabaasa náá bɛ gu yɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ neekwyɛla pak'ɔɔ dáa wɔ di ekwyɛl mɛ ɛ, deenek, mam ɛ́ waadi tɔ elyem bɔɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Esodja eezɛmɛt Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Bhii nyɛ nazelii deenek ɛ́, Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pe yii kyiid dii Sedelɔn. É di tak ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti bok, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛni tɔ tak, bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Tin, Yudas, mot naka nyɛ ɔ, nadi egu di tak etɛɛ náá, Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nadi ezezyɛ sok zɛsɛɛga é di tak. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Deenek, Yudas zokazɛtɔ́ pɛ bok tak, bɛ nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ esodja. Tɔ sama esodja é tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛmbaalel ɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nalwom ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛdhuu ɛ eFalizyɛ. Bot binɔk djas nadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛkɔɔ mɛ dɛɛb, nɛ etwol nɛ elama é mɛmbɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Tin, dáa Yezu nadi egu sa nadi ekwyɛl ɛsael dum nɛ nɛ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛtiila pɛ kyee bɛ nadi ɛ́. Tin, nyɛ eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi saa zɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />É di'enek, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yezu mot Nazalɛt.» Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mam.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yudas mot naka bɛ nwyak ɔ nadi ɛ́ tin, bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Dáa Yezu nake nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mam» ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ bula pɛ bhis, zɛghaaga si. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu baadji bɛ yak sok náá: «Bi saa zɛ é?» Bɛ eebaazɛbɔɔza náá: «Yezu mot Nazalɛt.» <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ye bɛ ɛ́ mɛ eezelɛɛ bin náá, yɛ ɛ́ mam. Yɛ bɛ náá, bi saŋ ɛ mam ɔɔ, betka bot ɛ sis bɛ tɔ́ yɔbɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Nyɛ nake deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, etɛp ee nyɛ nalɛɛ náá: «Saagam, mɛ ààpadiibal mot ngɔt tɔ bot ɛ wɔ nadjɛ mɛ ɔ» neebela mɛsuk. <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ pɛl. Tin, nyɛ eezɛwaal yɛ tɔ pɛp, nyɛ eezɛkwyal mot-mɛsa ɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb. <figure style="fig" alt="Pierre coupe l’oreille d’un soldat" file="WA03915b.tif" size="col" loc="18.10" copy="Graham Wade" ref="18.10">Pyɛɛd eetsaal ɛlɔ ɛ dhiiti sodja</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:10">Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛtsaal nyɛ ɛlɔ pɛ kyee mbɔ eghɛŋ. Din ɛ mot-mɛsa mɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ Malkus. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛke nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: «Bulela pɛl'ɔ tɔ pɛp! Wɔ ke ɛ́ náá, mɛ aanàkwaadɛ bɛɛlɛ mezuk mɛ Saagam zedjɛ mɛ ɛ?»<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Deenek, ɛdhuu ɛ esodja nɛ mot nadi kɔ elo bɔɔ ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bɛmbaalel ɛ ekukuma eYuda, zokazɛmɛt Yezu. Bɛ eezɛkɔl nyɛ mɛmbɔ nɛ ekel.<verse eid="JHN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esodja eezɛtɔ́ nɛ Yezu pɛ daa An</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ sok pɛ daa An. An nabɛ ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ mwaa Kayif, mot nadi boo ghaa-Zɛɛb é mbu tak ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Ghuna, Kayif ɛ nadjɛ mɛlyo menek nɛ ekukuma eYuda, náá: «Ye nyɔ náá, mot ngɔt gwyɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot djas.»<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyɛɛd eezɛswonal Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd bɛ nɛ dhiiti djekel nadi edu Yezu pɛ bhis. Tin, dhiiti djekel'enɔk nadi egunel nɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb. Deenek, ye naasa náá, nyɛ ni tɔ kok ndjaŋ ɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb lɔɔg wat bɛ nɛ Yezu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />É di'enek, Pyɛɛd eezɛlik pɛ kel, é ngwoob ɛniel. Tin, wɔ gwaa dhiiti djekel nadi egunel nɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ zɛwyis, tɔ́, kɛlii nɛ moma mɛsa nadi ebaal ɛniel ɔ. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛniigal Pyɛɛd. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Moma nadi ebaal ɛniel tak eezɛke nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ wɔy pe, wɔ nadi ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ sama bɛdjekel ɛ mot yenɔk é?» Wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd zɛswonal. Nyɛy náá: «Ààbɛ! Mɛ ààgunel nɛ nɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Dáa ɛgwyiyo nadi epupal ɛbuɛpe ɛ. Wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ mɛsa nɛ bɛmbaalel kok Ndjaa-ebuwa zokazɛpaada du. Bɛ moo tin egɔɔl bɔɔ djas. Dɔɔ nɛ Pyɛɛd pe nadi ɛ́ tin, bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ egɔɔl du.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boo ghaa-Zɛɛb eezɛdji Yezu mɛdjin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Tin, boo ghaa-Zɛɛb eezɛdji Yezu mɛdjin dum nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ, nɛ dum nɛ mɛlyo mɛ nyɛ di elyo ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mam nalelyo ɛ́, popoopwon é mis mɛ bot djas, ààbɛ tɔ syaab. Mɛ nalelyo ɛ́, tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda nɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, é edi bot ɛ mbyak eYuda djas nadidi é sesɛɛga ɔ. Ye tok nɛ tɛp mɛ nalii tɔ syaab. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Étɛp yé wɔ di edji mɛ yenek mɛdjin? Djia bot ɛ nadi egwak mɛ ɔ etɛp ee mɛ nadi elelɛɛ bɛ ɛ. Bɔɔ, bɛ nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe sa mɛ nadi elɛɛ bɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Dáa Yezu nabɔɔza deenek ɛ́, wɔ gwaa, mot ngɔt tɔ bɛmbaalel ɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa nadi tin ɔ zokazɛnyuu nyɛ bɛɛz. Nyɛy nɛ Yezu náá: «Bɛ lii nɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɛ́ deenek é?» <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛ eelii ɛbiyoɛpe ɔɔ, lyaala mɛ tɛp ɛbiyo ɛ tak. Yɛ kabɛ náá, mɛ eelii etsɛɛtsɛ ɔɔ, haaa wɔ kamyak mɛ etɛp yé?»<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Tin, An eezɛkyeed Yezu pɛ daa Kayif boo ghaa-Zɛɛb, mɛmbɔ ekɔla.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyɛɛd eebaazɛswonal Yezu swonela sis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />É ɛwala ɛlenek djas Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd nadi ɛ́ tin tɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ kok ndjaŋ ɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb é gɔɔl du. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛdji nyɛ náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ wɔy pe, wɔ tok ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel ɛ mot tak é?» É di'enek, Pyɛɛd eezɛswonal, nyɛy náá: «Ààbɛ! Mam ààgyee bis nɛ nɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Tin, mot ngɔt tɔ sama bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb, mot nadi ebyel nɛ mot Pyɛɛd natsaal ɛlɔ ɔ, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: «Wɔ ke ɛ́ náá, mɛ bɛ mbembɛ ɛ́ ààbee wɔ tɔ bok é?» <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eebaazɛswonal nyɛ swonela sis. Deenek, é di tak wat kuu eezɛkɔk.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu sok bhwoob ɛ Pilat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Tin, bɛ eezɛdus nɛ Yezu pɛ daa Kayif, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ kukuma mot kyee dik Lɔm. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ tɔ mɛlem kɛɛŋ. Tin, ekukuma eYuda nabɛ ɛ́ ààni yɔbɔ pɛ daa kukuma mot kyee dik Lɔm. Bɛ nasa deenek ɛ́ étɛp bɛ nadi ekaab náá, bɛ ɛzɛkɛbela edhuud, da bɛ di ààdɛ edee e ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ Pilat nazɛboma nɛ nɔɔ pɛ kel. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛ náá: «Lo mɛsɔ mɛ bi zɛpit mot tak ɛ yé?» <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Tin, bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Nyɛ ɛpedi ɛ́, ààdi mbee mot ɔɔ, pe bis ààpazyɛ nɛ nɛ pɛ daa lɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Tin, wɔ gwaa Pilat zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ bɛ deenek ɔɔ, nɔɔka nyɛ, da bi ɛ́ kɛpɛ́ɛ nyɛ dáa etsi bin di elɛɛ ɛ.» É di'enek, ekukuma eYuda eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Bisɔ eYuda, bis tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ mot epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee.»<verse eid="JHN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Ye nasael deenek ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, mɛkpa mɛ Yezu nalɛɛ dum nɛ kɔkɔ mbi ɛsyee ɛ nyɛ aagwyɛ ɛ, neebela ɛsuk. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Tin, Pilat eezɛni tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdjóo Yezu. Nyɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Deenek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ esiiza bɔ met ɛ di eke náá, wɔ dji mɛ deenek ohoo, wɔ dji deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ sis ɛlɛɛ wɔ deenek kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam?» <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Tin, Pilat eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Wɔ bee mɛ ɛ́ mot mbyak eYuda? Bot ɛ mbyak'ɔ nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɛ́ zɛpit wɔ pɛ daa lam. Wɔ sa yé?» <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ lam tok yii bɔs'ak. Ɛyɔŋ ɛ lam ɛpedi ɛ́ di yii bɔs'ak ɔɔ, pe bot ɛ di ebaal mɛ ɔ, ɛpelumla dɛɛb nɛ nen, ekaab náá, eYuda ɛzɛkɛmɛt mɛ, kɛka mɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ ekukuma bɔɔ. Ààbɛ! Ye tok deenek, ɛyoŋ ɛ lam tok ɛyoŋ ɛ bɔs'ak.» <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Tin, Pilat eebaazɛdji nyɛ náá: «Deenek, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ mɛkoozi?» É di'enek, Yezu eebaazɛbɔɔza náá: «Wɔy wɔ ɛmet eeke náá, mɛ ɛ́ mɛkoozi. Mɛ eezebyel, tin, mɛ nazyɛ kɔ bɔs ɛ́ etɛp mɛ neezɛbaŋa bot sa etsɛɛtsɛ di ɛ. Mot di emyaal etsɛɛtsɛ ɔ, nɛ gwak etɛp ee mɛ di elii ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />É di'enek Pilat eezɛdji náá: «Etsɛɛtsɛ kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ yé?»</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yezu eepɛ́ɛaa epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Bhii Pilat nadji Yezu deenek ɛ́, nyɛ eebaazɛsik, kɛboma nɛ eYuda pɛ kel. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mam ààbee lo mɛsɔ mɛ mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛpɛ́ɛ mot'ak epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee dum nɛ tak ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Tin, dáa bi di náá: «Bi nɛ gu dáa mena di ezyɛka nɛ ɛsesa sok, é mɛbyoŋ mɛ Pak djas ɛ, mɛ nɛ dyeebapel bin mot membok ngɔt. Bi kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, mɛ wyisal mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ Pilat nɛ etsim náá: «Hooo! Ààbɛ nyɛy! Bis kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, wɔ wyisal Bhaalabhas!» Ghuna Bhaalabhas nabɛ ɛ́ mot ɛzɛm nɛ ebhooba.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Deenek, Pilat eezɛlwom náá, bɛ nɔɔ Yezu, da bɛ ɛ́ nyuu nyɛ nɛ eghwyɛs. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Tin, wɔ gwaa esodja zokazɛsa kɔtɔ nɛ kel mɛgɔk, sɔm Yezu yɛ ɛ́ é lo. Bɛ eezɛbét nyɛ ndjookuwa na tɔɔbelaa. <figure style="fig" alt="Chapeau d’épines" file="44_John19.2_CrownOfThorns.tif" size="col" loc="19.2" copy="Gordon Thompson" ref="19.2">Kɔtɔ nɛ kel mɛgɔk</figure><verse eid="JHN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Bɛ moo tin etiila sok bhwoob'ɛ. Bɛ moo eswos nyɛ mɛswosel mɛ mɛduka náá: «Mɛ eeswos wɔ, mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda!» Tin bɛ moo epak nyɛ mɛbhɛɛz.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Tin, Pilat eebaazɛwyis pɛ kel wyisa sis. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot náá: «Gwakeka, mɛ ɛpezyɛ nɛ nɛ wak étɛp bi neegu náá, mɛ ààpabela lo mɛsɔ mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛdjɛ mot'ak epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee dum nɛ tak ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Tin, Yezu eezɛwyis, nyɛ eebɔt kɔtɔ mɛgɔk nɛ ndjookuwa na tɔɔbelaa é nyel. Tin, Pilat eezɛke náá: «Beeka mot tak é!»<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Tin, é ghɛŋ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛmbaalel ɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa nabee nyɛ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛtsim náá: «Bemka nyɛ é mɛlaaba! Bemka nyɛ é mɛlaaba!» É di'enek, Pilat eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Kɛbemka nyɛ é mɛlaaba, biyɔ bɛmet. Etɛɛ náá, tɔ yam beea, mam ààbee lo mɛsɔ mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛdjɛ mot'ak epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee dum nɛ tak ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />É di'enek, ekukuma eYuda eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Bis ɛ́ nɛ etsi, dum nɛ etsi tak, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsyee. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ke ɛ́ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Dáa Pilat nagwak elii bot binɔk ɛ, bwoo nabaazɛsa nyɛ ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Nyɛ eezɛsik tɔ ndjaa, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdji Yezu náá: «Wɔ dus paa?» Tin, Yezu nabɛ ɛ́, ààbɔɔza nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilat eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ ààkwyɛl ɛbɔɔza mɛdjin mam é? Wɔ ààgu náá, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa náá, wɔ betaa, nɛ ɛlwom ɛ́ náá, bɛ bem wɔ é mɛlaaba?» <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ tok nɛ dhiiti ghwyil wat kɔ lam, bhii yii Zɛɛb nadjɛ wɔ ɛ. Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, mot zɛka mɛ é mɛmbɔ mɔ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo ndjɛ dhaa-dhaŋak yɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />É di'enek, Pilat nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ moo saa mɛpek etɛɛ nyɛ neebet Yezu. Tin, eYuda eebaazɛni é tsim náá: «Wɔ bet mot yenɔk ɔɔ, wɔ tok sɔ ɛ Sezaad boo mɛkoozi. Etɛɛ náá, mot ɛ ke wak náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mɛkoozi ɔɔ, yenɔk ɛ́ mot mɛbhuka ɛ Sezaad!» <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Dáa Pilat nagwak mɛkpa menek ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛwyisal Yezu pɛ kel. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdisi kɔ bóó bɛtetɛp, é di bɛ nadi edjóo tɔ lii ebhele: «Ghabhata» ɛ, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ: Ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ mɛkok.<verse eid="JHN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ é ges dwoo saba, é ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak, ye moo tɔ́ tyee ɛwala kuku mwos. Pilat eezɛke nɛ eYuda náá: «Beeka mɛkoozi men é!» <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />É di'enek bɔɔ djas eezɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Góa nyɛ! Góa nyɛ! Bema nyɛ é mɛlaaba!» Pilat eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, mɛ bem mɛkoozi men é mɛlaaba?» Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Bis tok nɛ dhiiti mɛkoozi bhii mɛkoozi Sezaad!» <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Tin, Pilat eezɛka bɛ Yezu, étɛp bɛ neekɛbem nyɛ é mɛlaaba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yezu eebemaa é mɛlaaba</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ Yezu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Tin, Yezu nyɛ ɛmet eezɛbɛp mɛlaaba mɛ, étɛp ɛwyis kɔ dɛl, da nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ́ pɛ dhiiti di bɛ nadi edjóo tɔ lii eBhele, «Ghologhota» ɛ. Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ: «Di Bhoobo Lo.» <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />É di tak ɛ esodja nabem Yezu é mɛlaaba. É ɛwala ɛ tak wat, bɛ zokabaabem bɛdhiiti bot ɛbá é mɛlaaba, nwyak pɛ yak kyee, nwyak ngɔt pɛ yii kyee. Yezu nadi ɛ́, kuku tak.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilat zokalwom náá, bɛ nɔɔ mɔɔ pɛt ɛbaya, da bɛ ɛ́ tsel kɔ mɛlaaba mɛ tak. Kɔ mɔɔ pɛt ɛbaya ɛ tak, bɛ nakwyal ɛ́ náá: «Yezu, mot Nazalɛt, mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda.» <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda naalaa Ekwyala e tak etɛɛ náá, di bɛ nabem Yezu é mɛlaaba ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́, é ngwoob dɛl, deenek, Ekwyala e tak nabɛ ɛ́ tɔ lii eBhele, nɛ tɔ lii bot ɛ mbyak Lɔm, dɔɔ nɛ tɔ lii eGhɛlɛk. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Tin, wɔ gwaa eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb zokazɛke nɛ Pilat náá: «Ye bɛ ààgoka náá, wɔ kwyal náá: “Mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda.” Tin, wɔ goka nɛ ɛkwyal ɛ́ náá: “Mot tak ke ɛ́ náá: Mɛ ɛ́ mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda.”» <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilat eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa mɛ zekwyal ɛ, ye lik ɛ́ kwyala.»<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Dáa esodja nasilal ɛbem Yezu é mɛlaaba ɛ, bɛ eezɛnɔɔ ekaad bɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛkaa yɛ mɛkɛɛ mɛná, mot nɛ mot nɛ yɛ ɛkɛɛ. Bɛ zokabaazɛnɔɔ lɔbɔ yɛ nadi lata nɛ kel wat kana pɛ si kɛkum pɛ ɛko ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Tin, esodja moo tin eke pak'ɔɔ náá: «Sa mena àànyaaka lɔbɔ yak. Deenek djhoosaka ɛgwyeeg, étɛp mena neeguka mot aanɔɔ yɛ ɔ.» Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́, mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb di elɛɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Bɛ naakaa ekaad bam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">Bɛ naasa ɛgwyeeg étɛp ɛnɔŋ ɛ́ kaad'am<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.24 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:19">Mɛd 22.19</ref></char></char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">nabela ɛsuk. Beeka, dáa esodja nasa ɛ́, yɛ ɛ́ yenek.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ tin tetel, é ngwoob mɛlaaba, bɛ nɛ mɔn-nyɛɛg, zɛnɔɔ Maali mwaa Keleopas, dɔɔ nɛ Maali, moma dɛl ɛ Makdala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yezu eezɛbee nyɛɛg, tin, djekel nyɛ nadyeebakwyɛl ɔ é ngwoob'ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nyɛɛg náá: «Nyaagam, beea mɔn'ɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ djekel tak náá: «Beea nyoog é». Tin, kana ɛwala ɛlenek, djekel yenɔk eezɛnɔɔ nyɛ, tɔ́, kɛdi é di wat bɛ nɛ nɛ tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛsyee ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Bhii etɛp binek, dáa Yezu nadi egu náá, etɛp djas nabɛ ɛ́, ye naazesael ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ gwyes mɛdii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.28 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:16">Mɛd 22.16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:21-22">69.21-22</ref></char></char></note>.» Nyɛ nake deenek ɛ etɛɛ náá, etɛp djas nadi tɔ Ekwyala ɛ, neebela ɛsuk. <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />É di tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bhe mɛnyok mɛ na bwaaz-bwaaz tɔɔɔ. Tin, wɔ gwaa esodja zokaduu pes mɛnyuku tɔ mɛnyok mɛ tak, bɛ eezɛkɔl é lɛɛ mɔɔ le. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛsɛɛb yɛ pɛ pak nuub ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yezu eezɛdɛ mɛnyok mɛ na bwaaz-bwaaz menek, bhii tak, nyɛ zɛke náá: «Djas eedjala!» É di'enek, nyɛ eezɛsil lo si, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛsil eswos.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sodja eelum Yezu é ebhaaz nɛ ɛkɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, é ges dwoo saba. Ekukuma e eYuda nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛl náá, myoŋ di kɔ mɛlaaba é dwoo saba. Bela náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ boo dwoo saba. Tin, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ Pilat náá, nyɛ lwom bot, bɛ kɛbwak mɛko mɛ bot ɛ nadi é mɛlaaba ɔ, da bɛ ɛ́ dis myoŋ mɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Tin, esodja naazɛzyɛ zɛbwak mɛko mɛ bot ɛbá nabemaa é mɛlaaba lɔɔg wat nɛ Yezu ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Dáa bɛ nakazyɛ étɛp ɛzɛbwak yɛ Yezu ɛ, bɛ kabee ɛ́, nyɛ eezegwyɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ bɛ nadi ààbwak nyɛ mɛko. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Tin, wɔ gwaa sodja ngɔt zokazɛlum nyɛ nɛ ɛkɔɔ é ebhaaz. Wɔ gwaa, ghiya nɛ mɛdii zokazɛwyis é sum di tak. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Mot nabee nɛ mis mɛ dáa étɛp bak djas nadi esael ɛ, nyɛy ɛ di ekaada etɛp bak. Etɛp ee nyɛ di elɛɛ wak ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ etɛp etsɛɛtsɛ. Nyɛ nɛ gu náá, nyɛ lɛɛ ɛ́ etɛp etsɛɛtsɛ, etɛɛ náá, biyɔ pe, bi neemyaal. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Etɛp bak djas nasael ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, sa nakwyalaa tɔ Mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb náá: «Nyɛ aanàkwaabwakaa gwyes wat ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.36 <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Ɛwy 12.46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Ɛla 9.12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:21">Mɛd 34.21</ref></char></char></note>» neebela ɛsuk. <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />É dhiiti di, Mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb baalɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Bɛ waabee mot bɛ lum nyɛ nɛ ɛkɔɔ ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.37 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zal 12.10</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muu ɛ Yezu eekɛnɛɛgaa tɔ ɛvit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Bhii tak, Zozɛf mot dɛl Aelimate eezɛwaab nɛ Pilat náá, nyɛ djɛ nyɛ ze étɛp ɛnɔɔ muu ɛ Yezu, nyɛ neekɛdel. Zozɛf nabɛ ɛ́ djekel ɛ Yezu tɔ syaab, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi ekaab ekukuma eYuda. Pilat zokamyaal, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́, kɛnɔɔ muu ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodhɛm, mot natɔ́ kɛboma nɛ Yezu dhiiti dwoo é pum ɔ, zokazyɛ. Nyɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ nɛ epuuza e bɛmɛnanas ekilo mɛkam-mɛlɛl ee nasael nɛ miid nɛ aloe ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nasael nɛ miid nɛ aloe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yɛ ɛ́ bɛmul na mbɛɛ mɛnuub nasael nɛ epɛk nɛ eka e le ɛ. EYuda nadi eso yɛ tɔ epes e kaad, da bɛ ɛ́ del muu nɛ yɛ ɛ.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Tin, bɔɔ bɛbá eezɛnɔɔ muu ɛ Yezu. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛpil yɛ tɔ epes e bheeza, nɛ ɛseso mɛnanas menek é tak. Bot ɛ mbyak eYuda dyeebazezyɛ nɛ ɛsa ɛ́ deenek, é sok bɛ di ekɛdel mot ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />É ngwoob di bɛ nawa Yezu é mɛlaaba ɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bok wat tin. Tɔ bok tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛvit ɛ na bes<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɛvit ɛ na bes </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eYuda nabebwak mɛvit mɔɔ ɛ́ tɔ mɛkok dáa bɔɔ mendjaa.</char></note>, nadi náá, bɛ dinaa ààpawa mot tɔ tak sok ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Dáa ye nadi náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ é ges dwoo saba eYuda ɛ, nɛ dáa ye nabela náá, ɛvit nadi ɛ́ ɛkunaaɛpe ɛ. Étɛp tak ɛ, bɛ nanɛɛg muu ɛ Yezu tɔ tak. <figure style="fig" alt="Ils sont partis enterrer le cadavre de Jésus" file="44_John19.42_Jesus'BodyCarriedToTomb(Burial).tif" size="col" loc="19.42" copy="Gordon Thompson" ref="19.42">Bɛ eetɔ́ kɛdel muu ɛ Yezu</figure><verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Ɛvit toto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Kɛɛŋ tɔ ghooghom mɛlem mɛ dwoo yenga, Maali moma dɛl Makdala eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ɛvit. Nyɛ kabee ɛ́, ɛvit moo mbek, boo ɛkok ɛ́ nadi ediyalaa ɛvit nɛ yɛ ɔ, moo biŋela é ngwoob ɛvit. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Nyɛ eezɛsum kaab, tɔ́, kɛboma nɛ Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd nɛ dhiiti djekel ɛ Yezu nadi ekwyɛl ɛbuɛpe ɔ. Tin, nyɛ eezɛlɛɛ bɛ náá: «Bɛ eedis muu ɛ Ghɛŋ tɔ ɛvit ɛ lɛ. Bis ààgu pɛ kyee bɛ kɛnɛɛg nyɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Tin, Pyɛɛd bɛ nɛ dhiiti djekel eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel tɔ́ pɛ ɛvit ɛ tak. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Bɔɔ djas bɛbá eezɛsum kaab. Dáa bɛ nadi ekaab ɛ, dhiiti djekel yenɔk naadhaa Pyɛɛd nɛ kaab, nyɛ eezɛkum pɛ ɛvit ɛsok. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛmalal gwyák tɔ ɛvit, nyɛ kabee ɛ́ bɔɔ epes ekaad ee bɛ nadipal Yezu nyel nɛ yɛ ɛ, nɛɛga si. Nyɛ kadi ɛ́, ààni tɔ́ ɛvit. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd mot nadi edu nyɛ pɛ bhis ɔ eebaazɛkum yɛ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛni tɔ ɛvit, nyɛ kabee ɛ́ bɔɔ epes e kaad bɛ nadipal nyɛ nyel nɛ yɛ ɛ, nɛɛga si. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Dɔɔ nɛ bhɛɛ bɛ nabutal lo ɛ Yezu nɛ yɛ ɛ. Bhɛɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi é di wat nɛ bɔɔ epes e kaad bɛ nadjɛl nyɛ nyel nɛ yɛ ɛ. Bhɛɛ nadi ɛ́, pila é dhiiti di. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Tin, djekel naleekum ɛsok ɔ, zokazɛni tɔ ɛvit. Dáa nyɛ nabee deenek ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛdum koŋ nɛ Yezu. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Tin, kɛkum ɛwala ɛlenek, bɛdjekel ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ dinaa ààmɛt ɛsuk ɛ Ekwyala yii Zɛɛb di eke náá, Yezu nawaadi ɛ́ gom tɔ ɛsyee ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Bhii tak, bɛdjekel binɔk bɛbá eezɛsik, tɔ́ pɛ ndjaŋ'ɔɔ.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eezɛlyaal Maali moma Makdala nyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Maali nadi ɛ́ tetel pɛ kel é ngwoob ɛvit, nyɛy edje. Dáa nyɛ nadi edje ɛ, wɔ gwaa nyɛ malal, gwyák tɔ ɛvit. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Nyɛ kabee ɛ́, efofop ebá nɛ ekaad e na puu é mɛnyel, bɔɔ mendiindil é di bɛ nanɛɛg muu ɛ Yezu ɔ. Ngɔt pɛ kyee bɛ nanɛɛg lo ɛ Yezu ɛ, nwyak ngɔt pɛ kyee mɛko. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />É di'enek, efofop eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ dje yé?» Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bɛ eedis Ghɛŋ'am, mɛ ààgu pɛ bɛ kɛnɛɛg nyɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Dáa nyɛ nalii deenek ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛliig mis, nyɛ eebee Yezu tinaak tetel. Tin, Maali nabɛ ɛ́ ààgu náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Yezu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛdji náá: «Wɛn moma, wɔ dje yé? Wɔ saa zɛ?» Nyɛ nagu ɛ́ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ mot-mɛsa mɛ bok. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ nabɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, yɛ bɛ náá, wɔy ɛ dis nyɛ ɔɔ, lɛɛa mɛ pɛ wɔ kɛnɛɛg nyɛ ɛ, mɛ neetɔ́, kɛnɔɔ nyɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ: «Maali!» Nyɛ eezɛliigel, gwyák pɛ Yezu nadi ɛ́. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛlii nɛ nɛ tɔ lii eBhele náá: «Labhuni!» Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́: «Lyoel». <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Nàmɛt mɛ etɛɛ náá, mɛ dinaa ààpabyet pɛ daa Saagam. Deenek, tɔ́a, kɛlɛɛ nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bam náá, mɛ ɛpebyet pɛ daa Saagam, mot baadi pe Sɛɛg'en ɔ, pɛ daa Zɛɛb'am, mot baadi pe Zɛɛb'en ɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />É di'enek, Maali moma dɛl Makdala eezɛsik, tɔ́ pɛ bɛdjekel nadi ɛ, nyɛ eekɛlɛɛ bɛ náá: «Mɛ eebee Ghɛŋ!» Bhii tak, nyɛ moo elɛɛ bɛ etɛp ee nyɛ nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eezɛtel bɛdjekel bɛ nyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Ye nazobɛ ɛ́ dwoo yenga tak wat bikoko, bɛdjekel nadi ɛ́ bɔɔ djas é di wat tɔ dhiiti ndjaa. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ eekɔɔl ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa ghiŋ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ekaab ekukuma eYuda. Yezu eezɛzyɛ, nyɛ eezɛtyaa tetel kuku ɛbwak ɛ lɔɔ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Egwyem di nɛ nen!»<verse eid="JHN 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Tin, dáa nyɛ nasilal ɛke nɛ nɔɔ deenek ɛ́, nyɛ moo tin elyaal bɛ ebham mɛpyoŋ mɛmbɔ mɛ, nɛ yii ebhaaz bɛ. É di'enek, elyem e bɛdjekel nadi ɛ́ tɔɔɔ nɛ mɛmyaala dáa bɛ nabee Ghɛŋ ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yezu eebaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Egwyem di nɛ nen! Dáa Saagam nalwom mɛ ɛ, mam pe mɛ eelwom bin.»<verse eid="JHN 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Bhii mɛkpa menek, Yezu eezɛwuubal kɔ lɔɔ, nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Nɔɔka Sisim na Dɛɛ! <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Bot ɛ bi aapel mesyem mɔɔ ɔ, mesyem mɔɔ waapelel. Bot ɛ bi aapɛɛ ɛpel ɛ mesyem mɔɔ ɔ, mesyem mɔɔ aanàkwaapelel.»<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eezɛtel Toma nyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Ghuna ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel kam nɛ bɛbá, Toma mot nagetaa din ɛ Ɛwas ɔ, nabɛ ààdi tak é ghɛŋ Yezu natel bɛ nyel ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Tin, bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel zokazɛlɛɛ nyɛ náá: «Bis eebee Ghɛŋ!» Wɔ gwaa, Toma zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ di ààbee ebam e mɛpyoŋ mɛ epɔndi tɔ mɛmbɔ mɛ ɔɔ, mɛ di ààwa djin tɔ ebam e mɛpyoŋ mɛ tak ɔɔ, mɛ di ààwa mbɔ tɔ bam bɛ nalum nyɛ ɛkɔɔ é ebhaaz ɔɔ, yɛ di ààbɛ deenek ɔɔ, mɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛmyaal.»<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Yenga wat bhii tak, bɛdjekel nabaadi ɛ́ zɛɛga é di wat tɔ ndjaa. Toma nadi ɛ́ tin, bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ. Mɛbɛ mɛ ndjaa nadi ɛ́ ekɔɔla ghiŋ. Tin, Yezu eezɛtuula, nyɛ eezɛtyaa tetel kuku ɛbwak ɛ lɔɔ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Egwyem di nɛ nen!» <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ Toma náá: «Wa djin'ɔ wak, da wɔ ɛ́ bee mɛmbɔ mam. Sɛɛba mbɔ'ɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ zɛwa tɔ ebhaaz bam. Kata ɛswonal, da wɔ ɛ́ dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb!» <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tin, Toma eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Ghɛŋ'am, Zɛɛb'am!» <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ dum koŋ'ɔ nɛ nam ɛ, etɛɛ náá, wɔ eebee mɛ? Ɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ nam, bɔɔ ààbee mɛ ɔ!»<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛsɔ mɛ mɛkana mak nakwyalaa ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yezu naasa dhiiti bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala é mis mɛ bɛdjekel bɛ, ee di ààdi kwyala tɔ mɛkana mak ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Yak tak nakwyalaa ɛ́, étɛp bi neemyaal náá, Yezu ɛ́ Mɛsia Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, bi ɛ dum koŋ nɛ nɛ deenek ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm nɛ din ɛ lɛ.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yezu eebaazɛlyaal nyel nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Ba mɛlu bhii tak, Yezu eebaazɛtel nyel tela sis nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ é ɛboŋ ɛ dii Tibeliaad. Beeka dáa ye nadhaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd, nɛ Toma nadi edjóoaa Ɛwas ɔ, zɛnɔɔ Natanaɛl mot ghaada Kana, pɛ kyee dik Ghalile, baazɛnɔɔ bɔn ɛ Zɛbɛdɛ bɛbá, nɛ bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel bɛbá, bɛ nadi ɛ́ sama wat. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ ɛpetɔ́ kɛlóo ngwyep.» Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Djhookaka.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">É di'enek, bɛ eezɛwyis, zɛni tɔ boo elɛɛd. Tin, é pum yenek djas bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkobela sonok. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />É mɛlem kɛɛŋ, Yezu eezɛtyaa é ngwoob dii tak. Tin, bɛdjekel naabee nyɛ, ààgu náá, yɛ ɛ́ Yezu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ mengbaaz, bi tok nɛ ba bɛsu?» Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Hooo, bis tok nɛ yɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Laka ɛwyet pɛ kyee mbɔ eghɛŋ e boo elɛɛd bin, bi ɛ́ waabela.» Tin, bɛ eezɛla ɛwyet, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛbela bɛtɛ nɛ bɛsu. Mɛbu mɛ tak ààdjala nɛ dáa bɛ aakwak ɛghɛɛ yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Djekel Yezu nadi ekwyɛl ɛbuɛpe ɔ, zokake nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:7">Dáa Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd nagwak mɛkpa mɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ ɛ!» Nyɛ eezɛkɔl ndjookuwa yɛ é kuu, etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naadis ndjookuwa étɛp ɛla ɛwyet. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛghaaga tɔ dii. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel eezɛbula tɔ boo elɛɛd, bɔɔ é dul ɛwyet tɔɔɔ nɛ bɛsu tɔ tak. Bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdyeebatseta nɛ ɛboŋ, bɛ nadi ɛ́ tyee emɛtɛlɛ dhet (100) nɛ ɛboŋ. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Dáa bɛ nazesɛɛ nɛ elɛɛd é bɔs ɛ, bɛ kabee ɛ́ du nɛ su kɔ tak, zɛnɔɔ mapa. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dhaka nɛ bɛdhiiti bɛsu ɛ bi gó ɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Tin, Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd eezɛgo tɔ elɛɛd. Nyɛ eezɛdul ɛwyet ɛ nazelwood nɛ bɛsu ɛ, pɛ kyiid. Deenek, tɔ ɛwyet, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ eboo bɛsu dhet nɛ mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ elɛl (153). Tin, nɛ eboo bɛsu binek, ɛwyet nabɛ ɛ́ àànyɛɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel náá: «Dha dɛka!» Tin, tɔ bɛdjekel, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ mot ngɔt naabɛɛ nuub'ɛ, dji náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ zɛ?» Etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ djas nadi egu náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yezu eezɛtiila. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛnɔɔ mapa, kaa bɛ yɛ ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eebaazɛnɔɔ su, kaa bɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Yenek tak nabɛ ɛ́ tyee esok elɛl ee nyɛ nalyaal bɛdjekel bɛ nyel, bhii nyɛ nagom bhis ɛsyee ɛ.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eezɛbulal ɛgwakel ɛ bɛ nɛ Pyɛɛd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Bhii bɛ nasilal ɛdɛ edee ɛ, Yezu eezɛke nɛ Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd náá: «Simɔŋ mɔn Zaŋ, wɔ nɛ kwyɛl mɛ dhaa bak bot é?» Simɔŋ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Hɛɛɛ, Ghɛŋ, wɔy wɔ ɛmet nɛ gu náá, mɛ nɛ kwyɛl wɔ.» Tin, Yezu eezɛlɛɛ nɛ nɛ náá: «Wyela bɔɔ ebhata bam.» <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Nyɛ eebaazɛdji-djia sis tyee esok ebá: «Simɔŋ, mɔn Zaŋ, wɔ nɛ kwyɛl mɛ?» Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Hɛɛɛ, Ghɛŋ, wɔ nɛ gu djas. Wɔ nɛ gu náá, mɛ nɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ wɔ!» Yezu eebaazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «dia mbaalel etaa bam.» <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Nyɛ eebaazɛdji-djia sis tyee esok elɛl náá: «Simɔŋ, mɔn Zaŋ, wɔ nɛ kwyɛl mɛ?» Tin, lyem nabɛ ɛ́, ye kpaa Simɔŋ nɛ dáa nyɛ nabaadji mɛdjin mɛ tak djia sis náá: «Simɔŋ, mɔn Zaŋ, wɔ nɛ kwyɛl mɛ?» Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, wɔ nɛ gu djas, wɔ nɛ gu náá, mɛ nɛ kwyɛl wɔ!» Yezu eebaazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wyela ebhata bam. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, é ghɛŋ wɔ nadi, wɔ dinaa ngbaaz ɛ, wɔ nakokɔl bhɛtɛ yɔ é kuu ɛ, wɔy wɔ ɛmet. Wɔ natetɔ́ ɛ́, pɛ lyem'ɔ nadi ekwos ɛtɔ́ ɛ. Tin, é ghɛŋ yɛ aakabɛ náá, wɔ eezegeeb ɛ, wɔ aazokasesɛɛb ɛ́ mɛmbɔ, da mot sis ɛ́ kɔl wɔ bhɛtɛ. Da nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ́ nɛ nɔ pɛ lyem'ɔ aadi ààkwos ɛtɔ́ ɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Nɛ mɛkpa menek, Yezu nadi elyaal ɛ́ dáa ɛsyee ɛ Pyɛɛd aadi ɛ, dáa ɛsyee ɛ lɛ aadjɛ Zɛɛb duu ɛ. Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Dua mɛ!»<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu bɛ nɛ djekel nyɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛbuɛpe ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Pyɛɛd eezɛliig mis, nyɛ eezɛbee djekel ɛ Yezu nadi ekwyɛl ɛbuɛpe ɔ. Djekel tak ɛ́ mot namalal kɔ Yezu é sok bɛ nadi edɛ edee ɛ. Da nyɛ ɛ́ zɛdji Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, ɛzɛ aakɛka wɔ gha?» <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Tin, beea Pyɛɛd nabee nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛdji Yezu náá: «Haaa nyɛy, Ghɛŋ, ɛyé aasa nyɛy?» <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Mɛ kwyɛl náá, nyɛ di nɛ tsik kɛyaka nɛ dwoo mɛ aabula ɔɔ, ye gwyák wɔ wo? Wɔy, dua mɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Tin, lɛŋ tak eezɛkɛ pak bot ɛ nadi dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ náá, djekel yenɔk aanàkwaagwyɛ. Ghuna Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ ààke nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: «Nyɛ aanàkwaagwyɛ.» Nyɛy nake ɛ́ náá: «Mɛ kwyɛl náá, nyɛ di nɛ tsik, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo mɛ aabula ɔ, ye gwyák wɔ wo?»<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Yɛ ɛ́ djekel tak nyɛ ɛmet ɛ di ekaada etɛp ee nyɛ bee ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boowa yɛ tɔ Ekwyala. Deenek, mena nɛ guka náá, etɛp ee nyɛ di elɛɛ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lii mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yezu naabaasa bɛdhiiti bɛtɛ nɛ esonok. Yɛ pe di ɛ́ bɛ náá, etɛp binek djas nakwyalaa ɛ kwyalak ɔɔ, pe yɛ aanàkwaabelaaa di ɛkwom bɛmɛkana mɛ tak kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak djas.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>